{"meta":{"seed":n:40a2260000000000,"ticksRequested":n:4105180000000000,"founders":null,"engine":s:"emergence-engine.js","engineVersion":s:"2.6.0",},"events":[{"id":n:0000000000000000,"tick":n:0000000000000000,"day":n:3ff0000000000000,"year":n:3ff0000000000000,"type":s:"start","txt":s:"🌍 Four humans wake in an untouched world: <b>Eira</b>, <b>Ask</b>, <b>Embla</b>, <b>Torv</b>. They know nothing — but they can observe everything. What will they create?",},{"id":n:3ff0000000000000,"tick":n:4026000000000000,"day":n:3ff0000000000000,"year":n:3ff0000000000000,"type":s:"tech","txt":s:"📖 <b>Eira</b> told the day back as a story worth remembering — <b>Eira's the tale</b> (Storytelling) has been invented! <i>The first culture — memory shaped into meaning.</i>","tech":s:"storytelling","agent":n:3ff0000000000000,"x":n:404ab0b402378d46,"y":n:4042dcdd49bdfb00,"causes":[],},{"id":n:4000000000000000,"tick":n:402c000000000000,"day":n:3ff0000000000000,"year":n:3ff0000000000000,"type":s:"star","txt":s:"✨ <b>Embla</b> lay awake in the dark and watched the lights that do not fall.","agent":n:4008000000000000,"x":n:40482a72e9259634,"y":n:4042639783cf11a2,},{"id":n:4008000000000000,"tick":n:4031000000000000,"day":n:3ff0000000000000,"year":n:3ff0000000000000,"type":s:"star","txt":s:"✨ <b>Torv</b> lay awake in the dark and watched the lights that do not fall.","agent":n:4010000000000000,"x":n:404a0df85553f868,"y":n:4041b7e1554fe1a2,},{"id":n:4010000000000000,"tick":n:4032000000000000,"day":n:4000000000000000,"year":n:3ff0000000000000,"type":s:"star","txt":s:"✨ <b>Eira</b> lay awake in the dark and watched the lights that do not fall.","agent":n:3ff0000000000000,"x":n:404b20fd9d05ff0a,"y":n:4041ebcb80584dde,},{"id":n:4014000000000000,"tick":n:4042800000000000,"day":n:4000000000000000,"year":n:3ff0000000000000,"type":s:"tech","txt":s:"🔥 <b>Eira</b> rubbed sticks together until a spark caught the tinder — <b>Eira's ember</b> (Fire) has been invented! <i>Warmth at night. Opens the path to pottery and smithing.</i>","tech":s:"fire","agent":n:3ff0000000000000,"x":n:404b3d79093598a4,"y":n:4041efdd88854dde,"causes":[],},{"id":n:4018000000000000,"tick":n:4042800000000000,"day":n:4000000000000000,"year":n:3ff0000000000000,"type":s:"epithet","txt":s:"✨ From that day on, <b>Eira</b> was known as <b>Eira the Firebringer</b>.","agent":n:3ff0000000000000,"x":n:404b3d79093598a4,"y":n:4041efdd88854dde,},{"id":n:401c000000000000,"tick":n:4045000000000000,"day":n:4008000000000000,"year":n:3ff0000000000000,"type":s:"star","txt":s:"✨ <b>Ask</b> lay awake in the dark and watched the lights that do not fall.","agent":n:4000000000000000,"x":n:4041edb3779e4695,"y":n:40426128ecffac63,},{"id":n:4020000000000000,"tick":n:405d000000000000,"day":n:4018000000000000,"year":n:3ff0000000000000,"type":s:"season","txt":s:"❄️ The first winter has come. The world turns white and hard, and the nights grow long. Fire is no longer comfort — it is life.",},{"id":n:4022000000000000,"tick":n:405d400000000000,"day":n:4018000000000000,"year":n:3ff0000000000000,"type":s:"star","txt":s:"✨ <b>Eira the Firebringer</b> watches the stars again, night after night. Something is taking shape.","agent":n:3ff0000000000000,},{"id":n:4024000000000000,"tick":n:4060e00000000000,"day":n:4018000000000000,"year":n:3ff0000000000000,"type":s:"custom","txt":s:"🌿 <b>Ask</b> began believing the stars are the eyes of the ancestors, so the dead are never wholly gone — no one told them to. Others may follow. <i>(the Watchers)</i>","custom":s:"c1","agent":n:4000000000000000,"x":n:40496288fcd65469,"y":n:4040d7b33812ea7c,"label":s:"A NEW WAY OF SEEING",},{"id":n:4026000000000000,"tick":n:4060e00000000000,"day":n:4018000000000000,"year":n:3ff0000000000000,"type":s:"star","txt":s:"🌌 <b>Ask</b> saw a pattern in the stars and gave it a name — <b>the Watchers</b>. From watching, a cosmology is born: the first faith of the sky.","agent":n:4000000000000000,"label":s:"A RELIGION OF THE SKY",},{"id":n:4028000000000000,"tick":n:4062000000000000,"day":n:401c000000000000,"year":n:4000000000000000,"type":s:"season","txt":s:"🌸 Spring returns. The survivors count each other, and begin again.",},{"id":n:402a000000000000,"tick":n:4064400000000000,"day":n:4020000000000000,"year":n:4000000000000000,"type":s:"tech","txt":s:"🪢 <b>Embla</b> twisted grass fibers into something strong — <b>Embla's braid</b> (Rope) has been invented! <i>Makes it possible to bind parts together.</i>","tech":s:"rope","agent":n:4008000000000000,"x":n:404ce4077f16098d,"y":n:40414b7b59ce07fd,"causes":[],},{"id":n:402c000000000000,"tick":n:4064e00000000000,"day":n:4020000000000000,"year":n:4000000000000000,"type":s:"tech","txt":s:"🏺 <b>Ask</b> placed shaped clay in the fire and found it hard as stone — <b>Ask's urn</b> (Pottery) has been invented! <i>Food can be stored — hunger bites less.</i>","tech":s:"pottery","agent":n:4000000000000000,"x":n:40492a01d8142136,"y":n:4040cd19844950e3,"causes":[s:"ev:5",],},{"id":n:402e000000000000,"tick":n:4064e00000000000,"day":n:4020000000000000,"year":n:4000000000000000,"type":s:"custom","txt":s:"🌿 <b>Ask</b> began painting a mark on an old tree when something new is made — no one told them to. Others may follow. <i>(Painting a mark on an old tree)</i>","custom":s:"c2","agent":n:4000000000000000,"x":n:40492a01d8142136,"y":n:4040cd19844950e3,"label":s:"A CUSTOM APPEARS",},{"id":n:4030000000000000,"tick":n:4067200000000000,"day":n:4020000000000000,"year":n:4000000000000000,"type":s:"tech","txt":s:"📜 <b>Ask</b> carved signs into clay so knowledge could outlive its owner — <b>Ask's script</b> (Writing) has been invented! <i>Knowledge spreads to all — and to generations to come.</i>","tech":s:"writing","agent":n:4000000000000000,"x":n:4049c1245bad7d5a,"y":n:40419efededb65ce,"causes":[s:"ev:14",],},{"id":n:4031000000000000,"tick":n:4067200000000000,"day":n:4020000000000000,"year":n:4000000000000000,"type":s:"epithet","txt":s:"✨ From that day on, <b>Ask</b> was known as <b>Ask the Rememberer</b>.","agent":n:4000000000000000,"x":n:4049c1245bad7d5a,"y":n:40419efededb65ce,},{"id":n:4032000000000000,"tick":n:4068c00000000000,"day":n:4022000000000000,"year":n:4000000000000000,"type":s:"child","txt":s:"👶 <b>Ask</b> and <b>Eira</b> have had a child, <b>Liv</b> — generation 2. They inherit traits from both.","agent":n:4014000000000000,"x":n:404a0b3f3adcef75,"y":n:40419eed671a5d61,"causes":[s:"agent:2",s:"agent:1",],},{"id":n:4033000000000000,"tick":n:4070200000000000,"day":n:4028000000000000,"year":n:4000000000000000,"type":s:"star","txt":s:"📜✨ <b>Ask the Rememberer</b> pressed the pattern of the stars into clay — the first star-marks. Now the sky can be remembered.","agent":n:4000000000000000,},{"id":n:4034000000000000,"tick":n:4070400000000000,"day":n:4028000000000000,"year":n:4000000000000000,"type":s:"season","txt":s:"❄️ Winter closes over the world. The stores will decide who sees spring.",},{"id":n:4035000000000000,"tick":n:4070700000000000,"day":n:4028000000000000,"year":n:4000000000000000,"type":s:"hoard","txt":s:"🏺 <b>Ask the Rememberer</b> has begun laying up stores beyond any need. The pile grows — and eyes have begun to follow it.","agent":n:4000000000000000,"x":n:404ce9aa21ca3043,"y":n:40424ef40a3b39b3,"causes":[s:"agent:2",],},{"id":n:4036000000000000,"tick":n:4070800000000000,"day":n:4028000000000000,"year":n:4000000000000000,"type":s:"tech","txt":s:"🔪 <b>Ask</b> struck two stones together and kept the sharp shard — <b>Ask's knife</b> (Sharpened stone) has been invented! <i>Faster gathering of everything.</i>","tech":s:"sharp","agent":n:4000000000000000,"x":n:404ce9aa21ca3043,"y":n:40424ef40a3b39b3,"causes":[],},{"id":n:4037000000000000,"tick":n:4072600000000000,"day":n:402a000000000000,"year":n:4008000000000000,"type":s:"tech","txt":s:"🗡️ <b>Ask</b> lashed a sharp point to a long shaft — <b>Ask's javelin</b> (Spear) has been invented! <i>Humans are prey no longer. Deer can be hunted — food even in winter.</i>","tech":s:"spear","agent":n:4000000000000000,"x":n:404cf25d68755940,"y":n:4040f57aabaefe28,"causes":[s:"ev:22",s:"ev:13",],},{"id":n:4038000000000000,"tick":n:4073100000000000,"day":n:402a000000000000,"year":n:4008000000000000,"type":s:"tech","txt":s:"🪓 <b>Embla</b> bound a hard edge to a wooden shaft — <b>Embla's cleaver</b> (Axe) has been invented! <i>Twice as fast logging. Required to build huts.</i>","tech":s:"axe","agent":n:4008000000000000,"x":n:404e86c0c4876318,"y":n:40418e35542866b9,"causes":[s:"ev:22",s:"ev:13",],},{"id":n:4039000000000000,"tick":n:4073100000000000,"day":n:402a000000000000,"year":n:4008000000000000,"type":s:"custom","txt":s:"🌿 <b>Embla</b> began believing the world repeats and can be understood — no one told them to. Others may follow. <i>(The Knowing Eye)</i>","custom":s:"c3","agent":n:4008000000000000,"x":n:404e86c0c4876318,"y":n:40418e35542866b9,"label":s:"A NEW WAY OF SEEING",},{"id":n:403a000000000000,"tick":n:4074b00000000000,"day":n:402e000000000000,"year":n:4008000000000000,"type":s:"failed","txt":s:"<b>Torv</b> tried something with wood and stone and fiber — and failed. But failure teaches.","agent":n:4010000000000000,},{"id":n:403b000000000000,"tick":n:4077d00000000000,"day":n:4031000000000000,"year":n:4008000000000000,"type":s:"observed","txt":s:"👁️ <b>Embla</b> noticed that fire makes clay hard. An idea begins to form.","obs":s:"heatHardens","agent":n:4008000000000000,"x":n:4049a740b91c748b,"y":n:4041eec7d299fcc8,},{"id":n:403c000000000000,"tick":n:4077e00000000000,"day":n:4031000000000000,"year":n:4008000000000000,"type":s:"tech","txt":s:"🛖 <b>Ask</b> raised logs against each other into a shelter — <b>Ask's lodge</b> (Hut) has been invented! <i>Shelter and warmth at night. Three huts close together become a village.</i>","tech":s:"hut","agent":n:4000000000000000,"x":n:404c43def680a82d,"y":n:40411d1f172c4e6a,"causes":[s:"ev:24",],},{"id":n:403d000000000000,"tick":n:4078500000000000,"day":n:4031000000000000,"year":n:4008000000000000,"type":s:"observed","txt":s:"👁️ <b>Eira</b> noticed that fire makes clay hard. An idea begins to form.","obs":s:"heatHardens","agent":n:3ff0000000000000,"x":n:404a83538f8d71ce,"y":n:4040f2088f1761c2,},{"id":n:403e000000000000,"tick":n:4078600000000000,"day":n:4031000000000000,"year":n:4008000000000000,"type":s:"failed","txt":s:"<b>Ask</b> tried something with what was at hand — and failed. But failure teaches.","agent":n:4000000000000000,},{"id":n:403f000000000000,"tick":n:4079400000000000,"day":n:4032000000000000,"year":n:4008000000000000,"type":s:"season","txt":s:"❄️ Winter closes over the world. The stores will decide who sees spring.",},{"id":n:4040000000000000,"tick":n:4079700000000000,"day":n:4032000000000000,"year":n:4008000000000000,"type":s:"tech","txt":s:"🏹 <b>Ask</b> bent a young branch with a cord and felt it fight back — <b>Ask's longbow</b> (Bow) has been invented! <i>The hunt no longer needs closeness. Deer fall at a distance.</i>","tech":s:"bow","agent":n:4000000000000000,"x":n:404c660d1e1a0e94,"y":n:404106d4fcf11b36,"causes":[s:"ev:23",s:"ev:13",],},{"id":n:4040800000000000,"tick":n:407be00000000000,"day":n:4033000000000000,"year":n:4010000000000000,"type":s:"star","txt":s:"📜✨ <b>Torv</b> pressed the pattern of the stars into clay — the first star-marks. Now the sky can be remembered.","agent":n:4010000000000000,},{"id":n:4041000000000000,"tick":n:407c800000000000,"day":n:4034000000000000,"year":n:4010000000000000,"type":s:"taught","txt":s:"<b>Embla</b> taught <b>Liv</b> the secret of Embla's braid. The knowledge spreads.","tech":s:"rope",},{"id":n:4041800000000000,"tick":n:407e200000000000,"day":n:4035000000000000,"year":n:4010000000000000,"type":s:"child","txt":s:"👶 <b>Torv</b> and <b>Embla</b> have had a child, <b>Sten</b> — generation 2. They inherit traits from both.","agent":n:4018000000000000,"x":n:404db3f5f6c22565,"y":n:40404fa2ced64b44,"causes":[s:"agent:4",s:"agent:3",],},{"id":n:4042000000000000,"tick":n:407e200000000000,"day":n:4035000000000000,"year":n:4010000000000000,"type":s:"taught","txt":s:"<b>Sten</b> taught <b>Liv</b> the secret of Embla's cleaver. The knowledge spreads.","tech":s:"axe",},{"id":n:4042800000000000,"tick":n:407f500000000000,"day":n:4036000000000000,"year":n:4010000000000000,"type":s:"hut","txt":s:"🛖 <b>Embla</b> built a hut.","x":n:404c437717b6db46,"y":n:40406d1dfd19547b,},{"id":n:4043000000000000,"tick":n:407fe00000000000,"day":n:4036000000000000,"year":n:4010000000000000,"type":s:"taught","txt":s:"<b>Sten</b> taught <b>Eira</b> the secret of Embla's braid. The knowledge spreads.","tech":s:"rope",},{"id":n:4043800000000000,"tick":n:4080900000000000,"day":n:4037000000000000,"year":n:4010000000000000,"type":s:"tech","txt":s:"🧱 <b>Ask</b> built a stone chamber that gathered the heat of the fire — <b>Ask's hearth</b> (Kiln) has been invented! <i>Heat enough to melt what hides in ore and sand.</i>","tech":s:"kiln","agent":n:4000000000000000,"x":n:404ee130c6700081,"y":n:4041260a4c92b124,"causes":[s:"ev:5",s:"ev:14",],},{"id":n:4044000000000000,"tick":n:4080b00000000000,"day":n:4037000000000000,"year":n:4010000000000000,"type":s:"tech","txt":s:"🌱 <b>Embla</b> pressed spilled seeds into turned soil and waited — <b>Embla's seedcraft</b> (Farming) has been invented! <i>Food that returns every year. The village roots itself.</i>","tech":s:"farming","agent":n:4008000000000000,"x":n:404de59d4ea732cd,"y":n:404225941c6b6622,"causes":[s:"ev:14",],},{"id":n:4044800000000000,"tick":n:4080f00000000000,"day":n:4037000000000000,"year":n:4010000000000000,"type":s:"star","txt":s:"📜✨ <b>Eira the Firebringer</b> pressed the pattern of the stars into clay — the first star-marks. Now the sky can be remembered.","agent":n:3ff0000000000000,},{"id":n:4045000000000000,"tick":n:4081200000000000,"day":n:4038000000000000,"year":n:4010000000000000,"type":s:"season","txt":s:"❄️ Winter closes over the world. The stores will decide who sees spring.",},{"id":n:4045800000000000,"tick":n:4081600000000000,"day":n:4038000000000000,"year":n:4010000000000000,"type":s:"tech","txt":s:"🏚️ <b>Ask</b> built a dry raised store so the harvest kept till spring — <b>Ask's silo</b> (Granary) has been invented! <i>Surplus survives winter — the first true wealth.</i>","tech":s:"granary","agent":n:4000000000000000,"x":n:404f541884304294,"y":n:4040da71d06aa86a,"causes":[s:"ev:40",s:"ev:14",],},{"id":n:4046000000000000,"tick":n:4081c00000000000,"day":n:4038000000000000,"year":n:4010000000000000,"type":s:"failed","txt":s:"<b>Eira</b> tried something with stone and clay — and failed. But failure teaches.","agent":n:3ff0000000000000,},{"id":n:4046800000000000,"tick":n:4081f80000000000,"day":n:4039000000000000,"year":n:4010000000000000,"type":s:"failed","txt":s:"<b>Eira</b> tried something with stone and clay — and failed. But failure teaches.","agent":n:3ff0000000000000,},{"id":n:4047000000000000,"tick":n:4082300000000000,"day":n:4039000000000000,"year":n:4014000000000000,"type":s:"tech","txt":s:"🧶 <b>Embla</b> crossed threads over threads until cloth grew on the frame — <b>Embla's the loom</b> (Weaving) has been invented! <i>Cloth for warmth and trade — and hands that specialize.</i>","tech":s:"weaving","agent":n:4008000000000000,"x":n:404eac8b61cdf230,"y":n:404188043451aa0b,"causes":[s:"ev:13",],},{"id":n:4047800000000000,"tick":n:4082400000000000,"day":n:4039000000000000,"year":n:4014000000000000,"type":s:"field","txt":s:"🌱 <b>Eira the Firebringer</b> has turned the soil — the valley's first field lies open to the sky.","agent":n:3ff0000000000000,"x":n:404c000000000000,"y":n:4041000000000000,},{"id":n:4048000000000000,"tick":n:4082400000000000,"day":n:4039000000000000,"year":n:4014000000000000,"type":s:"field","txt":s:"🌱 <b>Ask the Rememberer</b> has turned the soil — a new field lies open to the sky.","agent":n:4000000000000000,"x":n:404f000000000000,"y":n:4040800000000000,},{"id":n:4048800000000000,"tick":n:4082400000000000,"day":n:4039000000000000,"year":n:4014000000000000,"type":s:"field","txt":s:"🌱 <b>Embla</b> has turned the soil — a new field lies open to the sky.","agent":n:4008000000000000,"x":n:404e800000000000,"y":n:4041000000000000,},{"id":n:4049000000000000,"tick":n:4083900000000000,"day":n:403b000000000000,"year":n:4014000000000000,"type":s:"taught","txt":s:"<b>Torv</b> taught <b>Sten</b> the secret of Eira's ember. The knowledge spreads.","tech":s:"fire",},{"id":n:4049800000000000,"tick":n:4084100000000000,"day":n:403c000000000000,"year":n:4014000000000000,"type":s:"taught","txt":s:"<b>Eira</b> taught <b>Embla</b> the secret of Ask's script. The knowledge spreads.","tech":s:"writing",},{"id":n:404a000000000000,"tick":n:4084500000000000,"day":n:403c000000000000,"year":n:4014000000000000,"type":s:"hoard","txt":s:"🏺 <b>Torv</b> has begun laying up stores beyond any need. The pile grows — and eyes have begun to follow it.","agent":n:4010000000000000,"x":n:404e529f8d62a6ce,"y":n:4042161212b06d42,"causes":[s:"agent:4",],},{"id":n:404a800000000000,"tick":n:4084700000000000,"day":n:403c000000000000,"year":n:4014000000000000,"type":s:"taught","txt":s:"<b>Liv</b> taught <b>Sten</b> the secret of Ask's lodge. The knowledge spreads.","tech":s:"hut",},{"id":n:404b000000000000,"tick":n:4084800000000000,"day":n:403c000000000000,"year":n:4014000000000000,"type":s:"tech","txt":s:"🧱 <b>Embla</b> fired shaped clay into blocks that stack true — <b>Embla's mudbrick</b> (Brick) has been invented! <i>Walls that outlast weather — the start of building.</i>","tech":s:"brick","agent":n:4008000000000000,"x":n:404cc402e4100e2c,"y":n:404102b93852cc72,"causes":[s:"ev:14",s:"ev:39",],},{"id":n:404b800000000000,"tick":n:4085a00000000000,"day":n:403e000000000000,"year":n:4014000000000000,"type":s:"season","txt":s:"❄️ Winter closes over the world. The stores will decide who sees spring.",},{"id":n:404c000000000000,"tick":n:4086180000000000,"day":n:403e000000000000,"year":n:4014000000000000,"type":s:"tech","txt":s:"🕳️ <b>Ask</b> lined a deep pit with stone to hold clean water — <b>Ask's stone well</b> (Well) has been invented! <i>Water without walking to the river — a village can grow inland.</i>","tech":s:"well","agent":n:4000000000000000,"x":n:404c10def64ecdf3,"y":n:403ce313d0348eab,"causes":[s:"ev:54",],},{"id":n:404c800000000000,"tick":n:4088a80000000000,"day":n:4041000000000000,"year":n:4018000000000000,"type":s:"imitated","txt":s:"<b>Torv</b> has begun painting a mark on an old tree when something new is made, the way Ask does. The custom spreads.","custom":s:"c2",},{"id":n:404d000000000000,"tick":n:4089080000000000,"day":n:4041000000000000,"year":n:4018000000000000,"type":s:"tech","txt":s:"⚪ <b>Ask</b> smelted a pale metal too soft to be worth much alone — <b>Ask's the pale metal</b> (Tin) has been invented! <i>Useless alone — everything when married to copper.</i>","tech":s:"tin","agent":n:4000000000000000,"x":n:4045f6c6ee878507,"y":n:402573408d83b59a,"causes":[s:"ev:39",],},{"id":n:404d800000000000,"tick":n:4089980000000000,"day":n:4041800000000000,"year":n:4018000000000000,"type":s:"taught","txt":s:"<b>Torv</b> taught <b>Sten</b> the secret of Ask's urn. The knowledge spreads.","tech":s:"pottery",},{"id":n:404e000000000000,"tick":n:408a200000000000,"day":n:4042000000000000,"year":n:4018000000000000,"type":s:"season","txt":s:"❄️ Winter closes over the world. The stores will decide who sees spring.",},{"id":n:404e800000000000,"tick":n:408ac80000000000,"day":n:4042000000000000,"year":n:4018000000000000,"type":s:"star","txt":s:"📜✨ <b>Embla</b> pressed the pattern of the stars into clay — the first star-marks. Now the sky can be remembered.","agent":n:4008000000000000,},{"id":n:404f000000000000,"tick":n:408b300000000000,"day":n:4042800000000000,"year":n:401c000000000000,"type":s:"taught","txt":s:"<b>Embla</b> taught <b>Sten</b> the secret of Ask's hearth. The knowledge spreads.","tech":s:"kiln",},{"id":n:404f800000000000,"tick":n:408b400000000000,"day":n:4042800000000000,"year":n:401c000000000000,"type":s:"field","txt":s:"🌱 <b>Torv</b> has turned the soil — a new field lies open to the sky.","agent":n:4010000000000000,"x":n:4045800000000000,"y":n:4022000000000000,},{"id":n:4050000000000000,"tick":n:408be00000000000,"day":n:4043000000000000,"year":n:401c000000000000,"type":s:"hut","txt":s:"🛖 <b>Ask</b> built a hut.","x":n:4047f9447a4604eb,"y":n:403adf3495a7eb5a,},{"id":n:4050400000000000,"tick":n:408cf00000000000,"day":n:4043800000000000,"year":n:401c000000000000,"type":s:"tech","txt":s:"🛞 <b>Ask</b> watched a log roll and understood something great — <b>Ask's roller</b> (The Wheel) has been invented! <i>The foundation of mills, carts — and everything that spins.</i>","tech":s:"wheel","agent":n:4000000000000000,"x":n:40480c36583c9e85,"y":n:4039d8f340351e8e,"causes":[s:"ev:24",],},{"id":n:4050800000000000,"tick":n:408e380000000000,"day":n:4044800000000000,"year":n:401c000000000000,"type":s:"death","txt":s:"<b>Sten</b> starved to death. Much knowledge died with them — unless someone learned in time.","agent":n:4018000000000000,"x":n:4042ecbee8a12fb9,"y":n:403b344f0e74db4a,"cause":s:"starvation","causes":[s:"cause:starvation",],},{"id":n:4050c00000000000,"tick":n:408ea00000000000,"day":n:4045000000000000,"year":n:401c000000000000,"type":s:"season","txt":s:"❄️ Winter closes over the world. The stores will decide who sees spring.",},{"id":n:4051000000000000,"tick":n:408f200000000000,"day":n:4045000000000000,"year":n:401c000000000000,"type":s:"tech","txt":s:"⛵ <b>Ask</b> stretched cloth on a hull and let the wind do the work — <b>Ask's the sail</b> (Sailing) has been invented! <i>Rivers and coasts become roads — trade and migration by water.</i>","tech":s:"sailing","agent":n:4000000000000000,"x":n:4048f7baf487c07e,"y":n:403e7da2ef303b15,"causes":[s:"ev:46",s:"ev:24",],},{"id":n:4051400000000000,"tick":n:4090000000000000,"day":n:4045800000000000,"year":n:4020000000000000,"type":s:"failed","txt":s:"<b>Torv</b> tried something with wood and clay — and failed. But failure teaches.","agent":n:4010000000000000,},{"id":n:4051800000000000,"tick":n:4090040000000000,"day":n:4045800000000000,"year":n:4020000000000000,"type":s:"trade","txt":s:"🤝 <b>Embla</b> and <b>Eira the Firebringer</b> struck a fair trade.","agent":n:4008000000000000,"x":n:4046de3636087560,"y":n:403f8bedde0cfab5,},{"id":n:4051c00000000000,"tick":n:4091100000000000,"day":n:4047000000000000,"year":n:4020000000000000,"type":s:"failed","txt":s:"<b>Embla</b> tried something with tin — and failed. But failure teaches.","agent":n:4008000000000000,},{"id":n:4052000000000000,"tick":n:4091900000000000,"day":n:4048000000000000,"year":n:4020000000000000,"type":s:"season","txt":s:"❄️ Winter closes over the world. The stores will decide who sees spring.",},{"id":n:4052400000000000,"tick":n:4092000000000000,"day":n:4048800000000000,"year":n:4022000000000000,"type":s:"season","txt":s:"🌸 Spring returns. The survivors count each other, and begin again.",},{"id":n:4052800000000000,"tick":n:4092d00000000000,"day":n:4049800000000000,"year":n:4022000000000000,"type":s:"taught","txt":s:"<b>Eira</b> taught <b>Torv</b> the secret of Ask's longbow. The knowledge spreads.","tech":s:"bow",},{"id":n:4052c00000000000,"tick":n:4093b80000000000,"day":n:404a800000000000,"year":n:4022000000000000,"type":s:"hut","txt":s:"🛖 <b>Eira</b> built a hut.","x":n:40485476bf8c5698,"y":n:40371457154d554f,},{"id":n:4053000000000000,"tick":n:4093d00000000000,"day":n:404b000000000000,"year":n:4022000000000000,"type":s:"season","txt":s:"❄️ Winter closes over the world. The stores will decide who sees spring.",},{"id":n:4053400000000000,"tick":n:4094b40000000000,"day":n:404c000000000000,"year":n:4024000000000000,"type":s:"child","txt":s:"👶 <b>Eira</b> and <b>Embla</b> have had a child, <b>Ylva</b> — generation 2. They inherit traits from both.","agent":n:401c000000000000,"x":n:404a22dc4fd0f3a2,"y":n:404072149b8a6ea4,"causes":[s:"agent:1",s:"agent:3",],},{"id":n:4053800000000000,"tick":n:4095080000000000,"day":n:404c800000000000,"year":n:4024000000000000,"type":s:"failed","txt":s:"<b>Eira</b> tried something with wood and stone — and failed. But failure teaches.","agent":n:3ff0000000000000,},{"id":n:4053c00000000000,"tick":n:4095480000000000,"day":n:404d000000000000,"year":n:4024000000000000,"type":s:"observed","txt":s:"👁️ <b>Ylva</b> noticed that grass fibers hold when twisted. An idea begins to form.","obs":s:"fibersTwist","agent":n:401c000000000000,"x":n:404a22dc4fd0f3a2,"y":n:404072149b8a6ea4,},{"id":n:4054000000000000,"tick":n:4095780000000000,"day":n:404d000000000000,"year":n:4024000000000000,"type":s:"tech","txt":s:"🎣 <b>Ask</b> let a twisted line sink where the fish gather — <b>Ask's fishing line</b> (Fishing) has been invented! <i>The water becomes a larder — food even when the land gives little.</i>","tech":s:"fishing","agent":n:4000000000000000,"x":n:404dd7906023fcc8,"y":n:4041cc2958fb674a,"causes":[s:"ev:13",],},{"id":n:4054400000000000,"tick":n:4095c00000000000,"day":n:404d800000000000,"year":n:4024000000000000,"type":s:"observed","txt":s:"👁️ <b>Ylva</b> noticed that struck stone breaks into sharp shards. An idea begins to form.","obs":s:"sharpShards","agent":n:401c000000000000,"x":n:4049ec4f6fa19c35,"y":n:404189b174bf377f,},{"id":n:4054800000000000,"tick":n:4095d00000000000,"day":n:404d800000000000,"year":n:4024000000000000,"type":s:"taught","txt":s:"<b>Ask</b> taught <b>Liv</b> the secret of Ask's longbow. The knowledge spreads.","tech":s:"bow",},{"id":n:4054c00000000000,"tick":n:4096100000000000,"day":n:404e000000000000,"year":n:4024000000000000,"type":s:"season","txt":s:"❄️ Winter closes over the world. The stores will decide who sees spring.",},{"id":n:4055000000000000,"tick":n:4096c00000000000,"day":n:404e800000000000,"year":n:4026000000000000,"type":s:"star","txt":s:"🌌 Under the Watchers, the people gather in the dark and turn their faces to the stars.","agent":n:4008000000000000,"x":n:404cf8719295554b,"y":n:403f1f6268f512ee,},{"id":n:4055400000000000,"tick":n:4098500000000000,"day":n:4050800000000000,"year":n:4026000000000000,"type":s:"season","txt":s:"❄️ Winter closes over the world. The stores will decide who sees spring.",},{"id":n:4055800000000000,"tick":n:4098800000000000,"day":n:4050800000000000,"year":n:4026000000000000,"type":s:"tech","txt":s:"🌾 <b>Eira</b> let the wheel drive stones that ground grain — <b>Eira's millhouse</b> (Mill) has been invented! <i>The village can process food — famine recedes.</i>","tech":s:"mill","agent":n:3ff0000000000000,"x":n:404c56218effa6c0,"y":n:404364665bb40d56,"causes":[s:"ev:65",],},{"id":n:4055c00000000000,"tick":n:4098fc0000000000,"day":n:4050c00000000000,"year":n:4028000000000000,"type":s:"tech","txt":s:"🎵 <b>Ask</b> found that a struck string and a voice could ring together — <b>Ask's melody</b> (Music) has been invented! <i>Song at the fire — the root of every art to come.</i>","tech":s:"song","agent":n:4000000000000000,"x":n:404dd3dc4aa448a1,"y":n:4041d4e1535d54f6,"causes":[s:"ev:1",],},{"id":n:4056000000000000,"tick":n:4099280000000000,"day":n:4051000000000000,"year":n:4028000000000000,"type":s:"taught","txt":s:"<b>Eira</b> taught <b>Ylva</b> the secret of Ask's javelin. The knowledge spreads.","tech":s:"spear",},{"id":n:4056400000000000,"tick":n:40992c0000000000,"day":n:4051000000000000,"year":n:4028000000000000,"type":s:"tech","txt":s:"🔢 <b>Ask</b> matched pebble to sheep and found number itself — <b>Ask's number</b> (Counting) has been invented! <i>The world made countable — trade, calendars and mathematics begin.</i>","tech":s:"numbers","agent":n:4000000000000000,"x":n:404d93e5950eaf08,"y":n:40422d71b1e554f6,"causes":[],},{"id":n:4056800000000000,"tick":n:4099400000000000,"day":n:4051000000000000,"year":n:4028000000000000,"type":s:"field","txt":s:"🌱 <b>Liv</b> has turned the soil — a new field lies open to the sky.","agent":n:4014000000000000,"x":n:404f000000000000,"y":n:4041800000000000,},{"id":n:4056c00000000000,"tick":n:4099480000000000,"day":n:4051000000000000,"year":n:4028000000000000,"type":s:"tech","txt":s:"📅 <b>Ask</b> counted the stars and seasons into a fixed wheel of days — <b>Ask's the year-wheel</b> (Calendar) has been invented! <i>The future made plannable — harvest, festival and rite find their day.</i>","tech":s:"calendar","agent":n:4000000000000000,"x":n:404d93e5950eaf08,"y":n:40422d71b1e554f6,"causes":[s:"ev:89",],},{"id":n:4057000000000000,"tick":n:4099700000000000,"day":n:4051400000000000,"year":n:4028000000000000,"type":s:"tech","txt":s:"🌿 <b>Ask</b> learned which leaves ease pain and close a wound — <b>Ask's the healer</b> (Medicine) has been invented! <i>Death held off a while — the healer becomes needed.</i>","tech":s:"medicine","agent":n:4000000000000000,"x":n:404dc5ab31a8e23b,"y":n:404225412c8421c2,"causes":[],},{"id":n:4057400000000000,"tick":n:4099800000000000,"day":n:4051400000000000,"year":n:4028000000000000,"type":s:"taught","txt":s:"<b>Ask</b> taught <b>Liv</b> the secret of Ask's melody. The knowledge spreads.","tech":s:"song",},{"id":n:4057800000000000,"tick":n:40998c0000000000,"day":n:4051400000000000,"year":n:4028000000000000,"type":s:"taught","txt":s:"<b>Eira</b> taught <b>Ylva</b> the secret of Embla's the loom. The knowledge spreads.","tech":s:"weaving",},{"id":n:4057c00000000000,"tick":n:4099c00000000000,"day":n:4051400000000000,"year":n:4028000000000000,"type":s:"star","txt":s:"🌌 Under the Watchers, the people gather in the dark and turn their faces to the stars.","agent":n:4010000000000000,"x":n:40433e438008b758,"y":n:403f3575ef3ff2ec,},{"id":n:4058000000000000,"tick":n:409a900000000000,"day":n:4052000000000000,"year":n:4028000000000000,"type":s:"season","txt":s:"❄️ Winter closes over the world. The stores will decide who sees spring.",},{"id":n:4058400000000000,"tick":n:409ae00000000000,"day":n:4052000000000000,"year":n:4028000000000000,"type":s:"star","txt":s:"🌌 Under the Watchers, the people gather in the dark and turn their faces to the stars.","agent":n:4010000000000000,"x":n:4044c9d270075d00,"y":n:4043b11aea30c5ee,},{"id":n:4058800000000000,"tick":n:409b540000000000,"day":n:4052800000000000,"year":n:402a000000000000,"type":s:"child","txt":s:"👶 <b>Ask</b> and <b>Torv</b> have had a child, <b>Bjorn</b> — generation 2. They inherit traits from both.","agent":n:4020000000000000,"x":n:404087144c36add1,"y":n:40440a12cbc28c55,"causes":[s:"agent:2",s:"agent:4",],},{"id":n:4058c00000000000,"tick":n:409b600000000000,"day":n:4052800000000000,"year":n:402a000000000000,"type":s:"taught","txt":s:"<b>Bjorn</b> taught <b>Liv</b> the secret of Ask's roller. The knowledge spreads.","tech":s:"wheel",},{"id":n:4059000000000000,"tick":n:409be00000000000,"day":n:4052c00000000000,"year":n:402a000000000000,"type":s:"hoard","txt":s:"🏺 <b>Eira the Firebringer</b> has begun laying up stores beyond any need. The pile grows — and eyes have begun to follow it.","agent":n:3ff0000000000000,"x":n:404b5175b222acb8,"y":n:4042a1713b7e0d1f,"causes":[s:"agent:1",],},{"id":n:4059400000000000,"tick":n:409cd00000000000,"day":n:4053800000000000,"year":n:402a000000000000,"type":s:"season","txt":s:"❄️ Winter closes over the world. The stores will decide who sees spring.",},{"id":n:4059800000000000,"tick":n:409e080000000000,"day":n:4054400000000000,"year":n:402c000000000000,"type":s:"child","txt":s:"👶 <b>Embla</b> and <b>Eira</b> have had a child, <b>Saga</b> — generation 2. They inherit traits from both.","agent":n:4022000000000000,"x":n:404bf07a2b045c29,"y":n:4043d3eb4ddad416,"causes":[s:"agent:3",s:"agent:1",],},{"id":n:4059c00000000000,"tick":n:409e580000000000,"day":n:4054800000000000,"year":n:402c000000000000,"type":s:"hut","txt":s:"🛖 <b>Torv</b> built a hut.","x":n:401204da12216458,"y":n:402d367cdde99be4,},{"id":n:405a000000000000,"tick":n:409e6c0000000000,"day":n:4054800000000000,"year":n:402c000000000000,"type":s:"taught","txt":s:"<b>Saga</b> taught <b>Eira</b> the secret of Ask's fishing line. The knowledge spreads.","tech":s:"fishing",},{"id":n:405a400000000000,"tick":n:409e700000000000,"day":n:4054800000000000,"year":n:402c000000000000,"type":s:"taught","txt":s:"<b>Liv</b> taught <b>Bjorn</b> the secret of Eira's ember. The knowledge spreads.","tech":s:"fire",},{"id":n:405a800000000000,"tick":n:409ea00000000000,"day":n:4054800000000000,"year":n:402c000000000000,"type":s:"star","txt":s:"✨ <b>Liv</b> lay awake in the dark and watched the lights that do not fall.","agent":n:4014000000000000,"x":n:401e9f7e0ea3c036,"y":n:402ac622264eef9b,},{"id":n:405ac00000000000,"tick":n:409f100000000000,"day":n:4055000000000000,"year":n:402c000000000000,"type":s:"season","txt":s:"❄️ Winter closes over the world. The stores will decide who sees spring.",},{"id":n:405b000000000000,"tick":n:409f440000000000,"day":n:4055000000000000,"year":n:402c000000000000,"type":s:"observed","txt":s:"👁️ <b>Eira</b> noticed that things can be counted, matched and made equal. An idea begins to form.","obs":s:"weightsBalance","agent":n:3ff0000000000000,"x":n:404d51ff8ac54d47,"y":n:40424371e1c0be9b,},{"id":n:405b400000000000,"tick":n:409fd40000000000,"day":n:4055800000000000,"year":n:402e000000000000,"type":s:"observed","txt":s:"👁️ <b>Embla</b> noticed that the yellow metal never dulls and all hands want it. An idea begins to form.","obs":s:"goldGleams","agent":n:4008000000000000,"x":n:404ce3ffd8e50eb4,"y":n:403d0ecf903845a0,},{"id":n:405b800000000000,"tick":n:40a0100000000000,"day":n:4055800000000000,"year":n:402e000000000000,"type":s:"field","txt":s:"🌱 <b>Ylva</b> has turned the soil — a new field lies open to the sky.","agent":n:401c000000000000,"x":n:404d000000000000,"y":n:4041800000000000,},{"id":n:405bc00000000000,"tick":n:40a0a40000000000,"day":n:4056800000000000,"year":n:402e000000000000,"type":s:"star","txt":s:"✨ <b>Liv</b> watches the stars again, night after night. Something is taking shape.","agent":n:4014000000000000,},{"id":n:405c000000000000,"tick":n:40a0a80000000000,"day":n:4056800000000000,"year":n:402e000000000000,"type":s:"season","txt":s:"❄️ Winter closes over the world. The stores will decide who sees spring.",},{"id":n:405c40