eel",},{"id":n:405e400000000000,"tick":n:40a3760000000000,"day":n:405a400000000000,"year":n:4032000000000000,"type":s:"failed","txt":s:"<b>Liv</b> tried something with wood and fiber — and failed. But failure teaches.","agent":n:4014000000000000,},{"id":n:405e800000000000,"tick":n:40a3a20000000000,"day":n:405a400000000000,"year":n:4032000000000000,"type":s:"child","txt":s:"👶 <b>Liv</b> and <b>Torv</b> have had a child, <b>Rune</b> — generation 3. They inherit traits from both.","agent":n:4024000000000000,"x":n:401927833ba6becd,"y":n:40274a8156ebdd3f,"causes":[s:"agent:5",s:"agent:4",],},{"id":n:405ec00000000000,"tick":n:40a3b40000000000,"day":n:405a800000000000,"year":n:4032000000000000,"type":s:"hunt","txt":s:"🎣 <b>Ylva</b> pulled silver from the water.","agent":n:401c000000000000,"x":n:404e3aa19c41a669,"y":n:4041e1dc7188da47,},{"id":n:405f000000000000,"tick":n:40a3e20000000000,"day":n:405ac00000000000,"year":n:4032000000000000,"type":s:"taught","txt":s:"<b>Embla</b> taught <b>Saga</b> the secret of Ask's urn. The knowledge spreads.","tech":s:"pottery",},{"id":n:405f400000000000,"tick":n:40a4000000000000,"day":n:405ac00000000000,"year":n:4032000000000000,"type":s:"taught","txt":s:"<b>Eira</b> taught <b>Ylva</b> the secret of Ask's silo. The knowledge spreads.","tech":s:"granary",},{"id":n:405f800000000000,"tick":n:40a4080000000000,"day":n:405b000000000000,"year":n:4032000000000000,"type":s:"season","txt":s:"❄️ A hard winter grips the world. The old will remember it; not all the young will see spring.",},{"id":n:405fc00000000000,"tick":n:40a4140000000000,"day":n:405b000000000000,"year":n:4032000000000000,"type":s:"taught","txt":s:"<b>Embla</b> taught <b>Saga</b> the secret of Eira's ember. The knowledge spreads.","tech":s:"fire",},{"id":n:4060000000000000,"tick":n:40a4400000000000,"day":n:405b400000000000,"year":n:4033000000000000,"type":s:"season","txt":s:"🌸 Spring returns. The survivors count each other, and begin again.",},{"id":n:4060200000000000,"tick":n:40a45c