4043b7da751bb8dd,},{"id":n:406ae00000000000,"tick":n:40b3200000000000,"day":n:4069a00000000000,"year":n:4041800000000000,"type":s:"tradition","txt":s:"🏘️ In Runestead, believing the world repeats and can be understood is now simply what one does. <b>The Knowing Eye</b> has become a tradition.","custom":s:"c3","x":n:403e5a7031830b7a,"y":n:4043b7da751bb8dd,},{"id":n:406b000000000000,"tick":n:40b32f0000000000,"day":n:4069a00000000000,"year":n:4041800000000000,"type":s:"star","txt":s:"📜✨ <b>Rune the Founder</b> pressed the pattern of the stars into clay — the first star-marks. Now the sky can be remembered.","agent":n:4024000000000000,},{"id":n:406b200000000000,"tick":n:40b3410000000000,"day":n:4069c00000000000,"year":n:4041800000000000,"type":s:"hoard","txt":s:"🏺 <b>Bjorn</b> has begun laying up stores beyond any need. The pile grows — and eyes have begun to follow it.","agent":n:4020000000000000,"x":n:4036a589ade19dd7,"y":n:4036a1cada567609,"causes":[s:"agent:8",],},{"id":n:406b400000000000,"tick":n:40b3470000000000,"day":n:4069c00000000000,"year":n:4041800000000000,"type":s:"star","txt":s:"✨ <b>Freja</b> lay awake in the dark and watched the lights that do not fall.","agent":n:4026000000000000,"x":n:4042081166106e29,"y":n:403cefe1855e838a,},{"id":n:406b600000000000,"tick":n:40b3580000000000,"day":n:4069e00000000000,"year":n:4041800000000000,"type":s:"taught","txt":s:"<b>Eira</b> taught <b>Idun</b> the secret of Ask's cave-marks. The knowledge spreads.","tech":s:"painting",},{"id":n:406b800000000000,"tick":n:40b3780000000000,"day":n:406a000000000000,"year":n:4041800000000000,"type":s:"hoard","txt":s:"🏺 <b>Ylva</b> has begun laying up stores beyond any need. The pile grows — and eyes have begun to follow it.","agent":n:401c000000000000,"x":n:403b59759d158199,"y":n:4040b7bb4fdf42d0,"causes":[s:"agent:7",],},{"id":n:406ba00000000000,"tick":n:40b3940000000000,"day":n:406a400000000000,"year":n:4041800000000000,"type":s:"season","txt":s:"❄️ Winter closes over the world. The