ply so.","village":s:"Majaheim","agent":n:402a000000000000,"x":n:4044ec11de87a577,"y":n:4037e90f53b2617b,"label":s:"A LEADER IS RECOGNIZED","causes":[s:"agent:13",],},{"id":n:4086e00000000000,"tick":n:40c7100000000000,"day":n:407ed00000000000,"year":n:4054c00000000000,"type":s:"epithet","txt":s:"✨ From that day on, <b>Idun</b> was known as <b>Idun the Voice of Majaheim</b>.","agent":n:402a000000000000,"x":n:4041192532d73739,"y":n:4044bf28d103845d,},{"id":n:4086e80000000000,"tick":n:40c7108000000000,"day":n:407ed00000000000,"year":n:4054c00000000000,"type":s:"moved","txt":s:"<b>Sten II</b> moved into an abandoned hut.",},{"id":n:4086f00000000000,"tick":n:40c7148000000000,"day":n:407ed00000000000,"year":n:4054c00000000000,"type":s:"epithet","txt":s:"✨ From that day on, <b>Signe</b> was known as <b>Signe the Rekindler</b>.","agent":n:402e000000000000,"x":n:40315b43b2e992da,"y":n:4040ca1650554178,},{"id":n:4086f80000000000,"tick":n:40c7148000000000,"day":n:407ed00000000000,"year":n:4054c00000000000,"type":s:"rediscovered","txt":s:"💡 <b>Signe the Rekindler</b> has rediscovered Ask's cave-marks (Painting) — knowledge lost for 20 years lives again!","tech":s:"painting","agent":n:402e000000000000,"x":n:40315b43b2e992da,"y":n:4040ca1650554178,"causes":[s:"ev:454",],},{"id":n:4087000000000000,"tick":n:40c71a0000000000,"day":n:407ee00000000000,"year":n:4054c00000000000,"type":s:"taught","txt":s:"<b>Freja II</b> taught <b>Ronja II</b> the secret of Embla's braid. The knowledge spreads.","tech":s:"rope",},{"id":n:4087080000000000,"tick":n:40c71c0000000000,"day":n:407ee00000000000,"year":n:4054c00000000000,"type":s:"field","txt":s:"🌱 <b>Saga II</b> has turned the soil — a new field lies open to the sky.","agent":n:4043800000000000,"x":n:4031000000000000,"y":n:4040800000000000,},{"id":n:4087100000000000,"tick":n:40c7200000000000,"day":n:407ee00000000000,"year":n:4054c00000000000,"type":s:"taught","txt":s:"<b>Saga</b> taught <b>Rune II</b> the secret of Ask's hearth. The knowledge 