star","txt":s:"✨ <b>Saga II</b> watches the stars again, night after night. Something is taking shape.","agent":n:4043800000000000,},{"id":n:4088d80000000000,"tick":n:40c8050000000000,"day":n:4080080000000000,"year":n:4055800000000000,"type":s:"taught","txt":s:"<b>Ask II</b> taught <b>Idun II</b> the secret of Ask's the sail. The knowledge spreads.","tech":s:"sailing",},{"id":n:4088e00000000000,"tick":n:40c8050000000000,"day":n:4080080000000000,"year":n:4055800000000000,"type":s:"taught","txt":s:"<b>Maja II</b> taught <b>Saga II</b> the secret of Embla's mudbrick. The knowledge spreads.","tech":s:"brick",},{"id":n:4088e80000000000,"tick":n:40c8068000000000,"day":n:4080080000000000,"year":n:4055800000000000,"type":s:"death","txt":s:"<b>Nanna</b> starved to death. Much knowledge died with them — unless someone learned in time.","agent":n:403b000000000000,"x":n:40494021939dbb41,"y":n:4047922981f17bf0,"cause":s:"starvation","causes":[s:"cause:starvation",],},{"id":n:4088f00000000000,"tick":n:40c8068000000000,"day":n:4080080000000000,"year":n:4055800000000000,"type":s:"knowledgeLost","txt":s:"🕯️ With <b>Embla</b> died the last knowledge of Ask's cave-marks (Painting). It is <b>extinct</b> — until someone rediscovers it.","tech":s:"painting",},{"id":n:4088f80000000000,"tick":n:40c8080000000000,"day":n:4080080000000000,"year":n:4055800000000000,"type":s:"taught","txt":s:"<b>Tuva II</b> taught <b>Sixten II</b> the secret of Ask's script. The knowledge spreads.","tech":s:"writing",},{"id":n:4089000000000000,"tick":n:40c8100000000000,"day":n:4080100000000000,"year":n:4055800000000000,"type":s:"raid","txt":s:"⚔️ <b>Falk</b> set upon <b>Idun the Voice of Majaheim</b> and seized goods — the gap was cheaper to close by force.","agent":n:403a000000000000,"victim":n:402a000000000000,"x":n:403e4e56cdf0d9cd,"y":n:404034921d036dc6,"cause":s:"greed","causes":[s:"ev:308",s:"agent:13",s:"cause:greed",],},{"id":n:4089080000000000,"tick":n:40c8148000000000,"day":n:4080100000000000,"year":n