 deserves it or not. Once begun, never stopped.","agent":n:4022000000000000,"x":n:403e161ae97e448a,"y":n:40412f18e6086d8a,},{"id":n:408d000000000000,"tick":n:40ca280000000000,"day":n:4081780000000000,"year":n:4057800000000000,"type":s:"custom","txt":s:"🌿 <b>Saga</b> began whistling to greet the morning — no one told them to. Others may follow. <i>(The Morning Whistle)</i>","custom":s:"c7","agent":n:4022000000000000,"x":n:403e161ae97e448a,"y":n:40412f18e6086d8a,"label":s:"A CUSTOM APPEARS",},{"id":n:408d080000000000,"tick":n:40ca280000000000,"day":n:4081780000000000,"year":n:4057800000000000,"type":s:"quirk","txt":s:"🙂 <b>Sixten II</b> carries a stick everywhere. It is never used for anything. As Ronja did before them. No one decided this.","agent":n:4049000000000000,"x":n:40424b30a5138f48,"y":n:4038d442bca07efd,},{"id":n:408d100000000000,"tick":n:40ca318000000000,"day":n:4081800000000000,"year":n:4057800000000000,"type":s:"star","txt":s:"✨ <b>Alve II</b> lay awake in the dark and watched the lights that do not fall.","agent":n:4048000000000000,"x":n:40172713e4bbf2fd,"y":n:402d1af3bfabac45,},{"id":n:408d180000000000,"tick":n:40ca330000000000,"day":n:4081800000000000,"year":n:4057800000000000,"type":s:"custom","txt":s:"🌿 <b>Eira II</b> began carving a sign into a flat stone — no one told them to. Others may follow. <i>(Carving a sign into a flat stone)</i>","custom":s:"c8","agent":n:403f000000000000,"x":n:401237c3a0ca6033,"y":n:40301f780a80ebf4,"label":s:"A CUSTOM APPEARS",},{"id":n:408d200000000000,"tick":n:40ca340000000000,"day":n:4081800000000000,"year":n:4057800000000000,"type":s:"field","txt":s:"🌱 <b>Selma II</b> has turned the soil — a new field lies open to the sky.","agent":n:404b800000000000,"x":n:403e000000000000,"y":n:4039000000000000,},{"id":n:408d280000000000,"tick":n:40ca350000000000,"day":n:4081800000000000,"year":n:4057800000000000,"type":s:"taught","txt":s:"<b>Signe II</b> taught <b>Ulv II</b> the secret of Ask's javelin. The knowledge spreads.","tech":s:"spear",},{"id":n:408d300000000000,"tick":n:40ca428000000000,"day":n:4081880000000000,"year":n:4057800000000000,"type":s:"raid","txt":s:"⚔️ <b>Ask II</b> set upon <b>Signe the Rekindler</b> and seized goods — the gap was cheaper to close by force.","agent":n:4040000000000000,"victim":n:402e000000000000,"x":n:4041c047b7031908,"y":n:4040250cdc55eb09,"cause":s:"greed","causes":[s:"ev:334",s:"agent:15",s:"cause:greed",],},{"id":n:408d380000000000,"tick":n:40ca428000000000,"day":n:4081880000000000,"year":n:4057800000000000,"type":s:"trade","txt":s:"🤝 <b>Tuva II</b> and <b>Tuva</b> struck a fair trade across village lines.","agent":n:4047800000000000,"x":n:40375e667c80b5b4,"y":n:402fc31c0b60549f,},{"id":n:408d400000000000,"tick":n:40ca448000000000,"day":n:4081880000000000,"year":n:4057800000000000,"type":s:"taught","txt":s:"<b>Sixten II</b> taught <b>Maja II</b> the secret of Ask's lenswork. The knowledge spreads.","tech":s:"glass",},{"id":n:408d480000000000,"tick":n:40ca450000000000,"day":n:4081880000000000,"year":n:4057800000000000,"type":s:"failed","txt":s:"<b>Tuva</b> tried something with what was at hand — and failed. But failure teaches.","agent":n:4031000000000000,},{"id":n:408d500000000000,"tick":n:40ca480000000000,"day":n:4081880000000000,"year":n:4057800000000000,"type":s:"star","txt":s:"🌌 Under the Watchers, the people gather in the dark and turn their faces to the stars.","agent":n:402e000000000000,"x":n:4041709e5bdeed1d,"y":n:4041f8d499d3758a,},{"id":n:408d580000000000,"tick":n:40ca480000000000,"day":n:4081880000000000,"year":n:4057800000000000,"type":s:"star","txt":s:"📜✨ <b>Saga II</b> pressed the pattern of the stars into clay — the first star-marks. Now the sky can be remembered.","agent":n:4043800000000000,},{"id":n:408d600000000000,"tick":n:40ca498000000000,"day":n:4081900000000000,"year":n:4057800000000000,"type":s:"taught","txt":s:"<b>Eira II</b> taught <b>Orm II</b> the secret of Ask's knife. The knowledge spreads.","tech":s:"sharp",},{"id":n:408d