0000000,"tick":n:40caa10000000000,"day":n:4081c80000000000,"year":n:4057c00000000000,"type":s:"field","txt":s:"🌾 <b>Bjorn II</b> brings in the harvest from Bjorn II's field. Winter holds less fear now.","agent":n:4051000000000000,"x":n:4038000000000000,"y":n:4037000000000000,},{"id":n:408e500000000000,"tick":n:40caa40000000000,"day":n:4081c80000000000,"year":n:4057c00000000000,"type":s:"death","txt":s:"<b>Signe the Rekindler</b> died of old age at 62. Much knowledge died with them — unless someone learned in time.","agent":n:402e000000000000,"x":n:4043ad92469625c4,"y":n:404261d12a67c1bf,"cause":s:"age","causes":[s:"cause:age",],},{"id":n:408e580000000000,"tick":n:40caa40000000000,"day":n:4081c80000000000,"year":n:4057c00000000000,"type":s:"moved","txt":s:"<b>Rune II</b> moved into an abandoned hut.",},{"id":n:408e600000000000,"tick":n:40caa98000000000,"day":n:4081d00000000000,"year":n:4057c00000000000,"type":s:"star","txt":s:"📜✨ <b>Vidar II</b> pressed the pattern of the stars into clay — the first star-marks. Now the sky can be remembered.","agent":n:4047000000000000,},{"id":n:408e680000000000,"tick":n:40caaa0000000000,"day":n:4081d00000000000,"year":n:4057c00000000000,"type":s:"season","txt":s:"❄️ A hard winter grips the world. The old will remember it; not all the young will see spring.",},{"id":n:408e700000000000,"tick":n:40caab8000000000,"day":n:4081d00000000000,"year":n:4057c00000000000,"type":s:"child","txt":s:"👶 <b>Vidar II</b> and <b>Ulv</b> have had a child, <b>Freja II</b> — generation 5. They inherit traits from both.","agent":n:4051c00000000000,"x":n:40437ce13f2585f7,"y":n:4044c33e0e4c8abe,"causes":[s:"agent:46",s:"agent:28",],},{"id":n:408e780000000000,"tick":n:40caac0000000000,"day":n:4081d00000000000,"year":n:4057c00000000000,"type":s:"taught","txt":s:"<b>Ylva II</b> taught <b>Liv II</b> the secret of Ask's silo. The knowledge spreads.","tech":s:"granary",},{"id":n:408e800000000000,"tick":n:40caac8000000000,"day":n:4081d00000000000,"year":n:4057c00000000000,"type":s:"taught","txt":s:"<b>Signe II</b> taught <b>Ulv II</b> the secret of Ask's hearth. The knowledge spreads.","tech":s:"kiln",},{"id":n:408e880000000000,"tick":n:40cab30000000000,"day":n:4081d00000000000,"year":n:4057c00000000000,"type":s:"child","txt":s:"👶 <b>Otto</b> and <b>Ask II</b> have had a child, <b>Kare II</b> — generation 6. They inherit traits from both.","agent":n:4052000000000000,"x":n:4041fa1b5fb50d93,"y":n:403fd960c27440d0,"causes":[s:"agent:24",s:"agent:32",],},{"id":n:408e900000000000,"tick":n:40cab80000000000,"day":n:4081d80000000000,"year":n:4058000000000000,"type":s:"season","txt":s:"🌸 Spring returns. The survivors count each other, and begin again.",},{"id":n:408e980000000000,"tick":n:40cab80000000000,"day":n:4081d80000000000,"year":n:4058000000000000,"type":s:"journey","txt":s:"🚶 <b>Idun II</b> set out for Runestead. Ideas travel on foot.","agent":n:4045800000000000,"x":n:4047b6361d701ffb,"y":n:403fd6ebfb0ef24f,},{"id":n:408ea00000000000,"tick":n:40cab80000000000,"day":n:4081d80000000000,"year":n:4058000000000000,"type":s:"tradition","txt":s:"🏘️ In Runestead, pouring water over the fallen prey is now simply what one does. <b>Pouring water over the fallen prey</b> has become a tradition.","custom":s:"c5","x":n:403e5a7031830b7a,"y":n:4043b7da751bb8dd,},{"id":n:408ea80000000000,"tick":n:40cab80000000000,"day":n:4081d80000000000,"year":n:4058000000000000,"type":s:"violence","txt":s:"🔥⚔️ Driven by a failing harvest, the people of <b>Frejaheim</b> fell upon <b>Ronjastead</b> — a raid for grain and goods. They took what they could carry.","x":n:401694c57b07baee,"y":n:402e6c5a92f0d5d4,"label":s:"WAR","causes":[s:"cause:scarcity",],},{"id":n:408eb00000000000,"tick":n:40cab80000000000,"day":n:4081d80000000000,"year":n:4058000000000000,"type":s:"leader","txt":s:"👑 In <b>Frejaheim</b>, the people have begun to listen when <b>Embla II</b> speaks — prestige has hardened into leadership. No one voted; it is simply so.","village":s:"Frejaheim","a