 with copper — and failed. But failure teaches.","agent":n:4031000000000000,},{"id":n:408fc80000000000,"tick":n:40cb268000000000,"day":n:4082200000000000,"year":n:4058400000000000,"type":s:"child","txt":s:"👶 <b>Torv II</b> and <b>Tuva II</b> have had a child, <b>Halvar II</b> — generation 6. They inherit traits from both.","agent":n:4052800000000000,"x":n:403f308a4a832788,"y":n:403a9f68221ca4f6,"causes":[s:"agent:34",s:"agent:47",],},{"id":n:408fd00000000000,"tick":n:40cb290000000000,"day":n:4082200000000000,"year":n:4058400000000000,"type":s:"custom","txt":s:"🌿 <b>Torv II</b> began placing a stone on the hut wall — no one told them to. Others may follow. <i>(Placing a stone on the hut wall)</i>","custom":s:"c10","agent":n:4050000000000000,"x":n:404199ccc37cecce,"y":n:403937b105f0a84e,"label":s:"A CUSTOM APPEARS",},{"id":n:408fd80000000000,"tick":n:40cb290000000000,"day":n:4082200000000000,"year":n:4058400000000000,"type":s:"mutation","txt":s:"🧬 <b>Torv II</b> does it differently: placing a stone on the hut wall instead of pouring water over the fallen prey. A tradition drifts.","custom":s:"c10",},{"id":n:408fe00000000000,"tick":n:40cb2a8000000000,"day":n:4082200000000000,"year":n:4058400000000000,"type":s:"hoard","txt":s:"🏺 <b>Tuva II</b> has begun laying up stores beyond any need. The pile grows — and eyes have begun to follow it.","agent":n:4047800000000000,"x":n:403e6df450e54442,"y":n:40385e4ad24a17c9,"causes":[s:"agent:47",],},{"id":n:408fe80000000000,"tick":n:40cb2c8000000000,"day":n:4082200000000000,"year":n:4058400000000000,"type":s:"imitated","txt":s:"<b>Sixten II</b> has begun pouring water over the fallen prey, the way Ronja II does. The custom spreads.","custom":s:"c5",},{"id":n:408ff00000000000,"tick":n:40cb2d0000000000,"day":n:4082280000000000,"year":n:4058400000000000,"type":s:"taught","txt":s:"<b>Vera II</b> taught <b>Rune II</b> the secret of Ask's longbow. The knowledge spreads.","tech":s:"bow",},{"id":n:408ff80000000000,"tick":n:40cb2e8000000000,"