il. The knowledge spreads.","tech":s:"sailing",},{"id":n:40901c0000000000,"tick":n:40cb448000000000,"day":n:4082300000000000,"year":n:4058400000000000,"type":s:"star","txt":s:"📜✨ <b>Alve II</b> pressed the pattern of the stars into clay — the first star-marks. Now the sky can be remembered.","agent":n:4048000000000000,},{"id":n:4090200000000000,"tick":n:40cb480000000000,"day":n:4082380000000000,"year":n:4058800000000000,"type":s:"journey","txt":s:"🚶 <b>Idun II</b> set out for Frejaheim. Ideas travel on foot.","agent":n:4045800000000000,"x":n:4042460d7df80c64,"y":n:4040ef96d7d4accc,},{"id":n:4090240000000000,"tick":n:40cb480000000000,"day":n:4082380000000000,"year":n:4058800000000000,"type":s:"death","txt":s:"<b>Embla II the Voice of Frejaheim</b> fell in the raid on Frejaheim. Much knowledge died with them — unless someone learned in time.","agent":n:4040800000000000,"x":n:404d17e8e4ddd787,"y":n:403d64b413f95f4b,"cause":s:"violence","causes":[s:"cause:violence",s:"agent:17",s:"cause:war",],},{"id":n:4090280000000000,"tick":n:40cb480000000000,"day":n:4082380000000000,"year":n:4058800000000000,"type":s:"violence","txt":s:"🔥⚔️ Driven by a failing harvest, the people of <b>Ronjastead</b> fell upon <b>Frejaheim</b> — a raid for grain and goods. 1 lay dead (1 of Frejaheim, 0 of Ronjastead).","x":n:4049e9c4e613f49e,"y":n:404206087fe9cc35,"label":s:"WAR","causes":[s:"cause:scarcity",],},{"id":n:40902c0000000000,"tick":n:40cb480000000000,"day":n:4082380000000000,"year":n:4058800000000000,"type":s:"leader","txt":s:"🕯️ <b>Frejaheim</b> is without a leader — <b>Embla II</b>'s voice is gone, and no one yet speaks for all.","village":s:"Frejaheim","x":n:401694c57b07baee,"y":n:402e6c5a92f0d5d4,"causes":[s:"ev:982",],},{"id":n:4090300000000000,"tick":n:40cb490000000000,"day":n:4082380000000000,"year":n:4058800000000000,"type":s:"taught","txt":s:"<b>Idun II</b> taught <b>Eira II</b> the secret of Embla's seedcraft. The knowledge spreads.","tech":s:"farming",},{"id":n:409034000000000