00000,"tick":n:40d0068000000000,"day":n:4085680000000000,"year":n:405c800000000000,"type":s:"customLost","txt":s:"🕯️ No one remembers Singing under the old tree at dusk anymore. A piece of who they were is gone.","custom":s:"c13",},{"id":n:4098600000000000,"tick":n:40d007c000000000,"day":n:4085680000000000,"year":n:405c800000000000,"type":s:"mutation","txt":s:"🧬 <b>Eira II</b> does it differently: painting a mark on an old tree when something new is made instead of believing the living trees remember the axe. A tradition drifts.","custom":s:"c2",},{"id":n:4098640000000000,"tick":n:40d0080000000000,"day":n:4085680000000000,"year":n:405cc00000000000,"type":s:"quirk","txt":s:"🙂 <b>Vidar II</b> always takes the long way home, even in rain. Once begun, never stopped.","agent":n:4053000000000000,"x":n:404a6e191ca386c9,"y":n:4040bc138339234c,},{"id":n:4098680000000000,"tick":n:40d0080000000000,"day":n:4085680000000000,"year":n:405cc00000000000,"type":s:"leader","txt":s:"🕯️ <b>Runestead</b> is without a leader — <b>Halvar</b>'s voice is gone, and no one yet speaks for all.","village":s:"Runestead","x":n:403e5a7031830b7a,"y":n:4043b7da751bb8dd,"causes":[s:"ev:1002",],},{"id":n:40986c0000000000,"tick":n:40d0080000000000,"day":n:4085680000000000,"year":n:405cc00000000000,"type":s:"leader","txt":s:"🕯️ <b>Majaheim</b> is without a leader — <b>Sixten</b>'s voice is gone, and no one yet speaks for all.","village":s:"Majaheim","x":n:4044ec11de87a577,"y":n:4037e90f53b2617b,"causes":[s:"ev:1385",],},{"id":n:4098700000000000,"tick":n:40d0088000000000,"day":n:4085680000000000,"year":n:405cc00000000000,"type":s:"taught","txt":s:"<b>Selma II</b> taught <b>Signe II</b> the secret of Ask's the year-wheel. The knowledge spreads.","tech":s:"calendar",},{"id":n:4098740000000000,"tick":n:40d0090000000000,"day":n:4085680000000000,"year":n:405cc00000000000,"type":s:"hunt","txt":s:"🎣 <b>Vidar II</b> pulled silver from the water.","agent":n:4047000000000000,"x":n:4042822ca83ea963,"y":n:403eeab7cd3