p. It died quietly, as most things do.","custom":s:"c26",},{"id":n:409b8c0000000000,"tick":n:40d0b98000000000,"day":n:4086500000000000,"year":n:405dc00000000000,"type":s:"taught","txt":s:"<b>Saga II</b> taught <b>Disa II</b> the secret of Ask's the sail. The knowledge spreads.","tech":s:"sailing",},{"id":n:409b900000000000,"tick":n:40d0b98000000000,"day":n:4086500000000000,"year":n:405dc00000000000,"type":s:"steal","txt":s:"🥀 Hunger owned the hand: <b>Halvar II</b> wrenched food from <b>Loke II</b>.","agent":n:4046000000000000,"victim":n:404a000000000000,"x":n:4042f2b81b514ddc,"y":n:403b5f8366ba78da,"cause":s:"desperation","causes":[s:"ev:1759",s:"agent:52",s:"cause:desperation",s:"cause:winter",],},{"id":n:409b940000000000,"tick":n:40d0b98000000000,"day":n:4086500000000000,"year":n:405dc00000000000,"type":s:"taught","txt":s:"<b>Tuva II</b> taught <b>Eira II</b> the secret of Embla's cleaver. The knowledge spreads.","tech":s:"axe",},{"id":n:409b980000000000,"tick":n:40d0bc4000000000,"day":n:4086580000000000,"year":n:405e000000000000,"type":s:"hunt","txt":s:"🎣 <b>Torv II</b> pulled silver from the water.","agent":n:4057800000000000,"x":n:40434c89bdf6e72c,"y":n:403dec87544abc03,},{"id":n:409b9c0000000000,"tick":n:40d0bc4000000000,"day":n:4086580000000000,"year":n:405e000000000000,"type":s:"taught","txt":s:"<b>Kare II</b> taught <b>Rune II</b> the secret of Eira's the tale. The knowledge spreads.","tech":s:"storytelling",},{"id":n:409ba00000000000,"tick":n:40d0be4000000000,"day":n:4086580000000000,"year":n:405e000000000000,"type":s:"hut","txt":s:"🛖 <b>Torv II</b> built a hut.","x":n:40351e38c78418f7,"y":n:404229762c70c20b,},{"id":n:409ba40000000000,"tick":n:40d0bfc000000000,"day":n:4086580000000000,"year":n:405e000000000000,"type":s:"child","txt":s:"👶 <b>Kare II</b> and <b>Rune II</b> have had a child, <b>Signe II</b> — generation 7. They inherit traits from both.","agent":n:4060e00000000000,"x":n:4041e4a4097a730f,"y":n:40447a9d9d729632,"causes":[s:"agent:72",s:"agent:70",],},{"id":n:409ba80000000000,"tick":n:40d0c00000000000,"day":n:4086580000000000,"year":n:405e000000000000,"type":s:"taught","txt":s:"<b>Bjorn II</b> taught <b>Alve II</b> the secret of Halvar's red metal. The knowledge spreads.","tech":s:"copper",},{"id":n:409bac0000000000,"tick":n:40d0c10000000000,"day":n:4086600000000000,"year":n:405e000000000000,"type":s:"taught","txt":s:"<b>Eira II</b> taught <b>Tuva II</b> the secret of Embla's mudbrick. The knowledge spreads.","tech":s:"brick",},{"id":n:409bb00000000000,"tick":n:40d0c3c000000000,"day":n:4086600000000000,"year":n:405e000000000000,"type":s:"hunt","txt":s:"🎣 <b>Ulv II</b> pulled silver from the water.","agent":n:405d800000000000,"x":n:40442112b6b2340e,"y":n:403ef1fb7f87ad20,},{"id":n:409bb40000000000,"tick":n:40d0c44000000000,"day":n:4086600000000000,"year":n:405e000000000000,"type":s:"taught","txt":s:"<b>Ronja II</b> taught <b>Sten II</b> the secret of Ask's the year-wheel. The knowledge spreads.","tech":s:"calendar",},{"id":n:409bb80000000000,"tick":n:40d0c5c000000000,"day":n:4086600000000000,"year":n:405e000000000000,"type":s:"child","txt":s:"👶 <b>Falk II</b> and <b>Nanna II</b> have had a child, <b>Vidar II</b> — generation 8. They inherit traits from both.","agent":n:4061000000000000,"x":n:404b78998f9a9226,"y":n:404850f10b299ba7,"causes":[s:"agent:56",s:"agent:87",],},{"id":n:409bbc0000000000,"tick":n:40d0c60000000000,"day":n:4086600000000000,"year":n:405e000000000000,"type":s:"child","txt":s:"👶 <b>Saga II</b> and <b>Alve II</b> have had a child, <b>Tuva II</b> — generation 6. They inherit traits from both.","agent":n:4061200000000000,"x":n:403e0285a81f5cfd,"y":n:403a3c1714124f21,"causes":[s:"agent:69",s:"agent:48",],},{"id":n:409bc00000000000,"tick":n:40d0c7c000000000,"day":n:4086680000000000,"year":n:405e000000000000,"type":s:"sharing","txt":s:"🍞 <b>Tuva II</b> shared food with <b>Disa II</b> — The Hearth-Gift holds. Those who keep the same ways do not let each other starve.","x":n:4042e50bf97bc04b,"y":n:4041a3519db85890,"agent":n:405ac00000000000,"causes":[s:"agent:107",s:"agent:89",],},{"id":n:409bc40000000000,"tick":n:40d0ca4000000000,"day":n:4086680000000000,"year":n:405e000000000000,"type":s:"moved","txt":s:"<b>Nanna II</b> moved into an abandoned hut.",},{"id":n:409bc80000000000,"tick":n:40d0ca8000000000,"day":n:4086680000000000,"year":n:405e000000000000,"type":s:"death","txt":s:"<b>Disa II</b> starved to death. Much knowledge died with them — unless someone learned in time.","agent":n:404d800000000000,"x":n:40434bb1128aec68,"y":n:4043ed53d7b0b28c,"cause":s:"starvation","causes":[s:"cause:starvation",],},{"id":n:409bcc0000000000,"tick":n:40d0ca8000000000,"day":n:4086680000000000,"year":n:405e000000000000,"type":s:"raid","txt":s:"⚔️ <b>Bjorn II</b> set upon <b>Sten II</b> and seized goods — the gap was cheaper to close by force.","agent":n:4051000000000000,"victim":n:4042000000000000,"x":n:4040d4bd2eed6728,"y":n:403ab90e645b977a,"cause":s:"greed","causes":[s:"ev:774",s:"agent:36",s:"cause:greed",],},{"id":n:409bd00000000000,"tick":n:40d0ca8000000000,"day":n:4086680000000000,"year":n:405e000000000000,"type":s:"customLost","txt":s:"🕯️ No one remembers Telling stories by the water at dusk anymore. A piece of who they were is gone.","custom":s:"c24",},{"id":n:409bd40000000000,"tick":n:40d0cc8000000000,"day":n:4086700000000000,"year":n:405e000000000000,"type":s:"child","txt":s:"👶 <b>Eira II</b> and <b>Saga II</b> have had a child, <b>Alve II</b> — generation 7. They inherit traits from both.","agent":n:4061400000000000,"x":n:404471b9edac4d0f,"y":n:404061d5f3077330,"causes":[s:"agent:61",s:"agent:39",],},{"id":n:409bd80000000000,"tick":n:40d0cc8000000000,"day":n:4086700000000000,"year":n:405e000000000000,"type":s:"failed","txt":s:"<b>Otto II</b> tried something with copper — and failed. But failure teaches.","agent":n:4055000000000000,},{"id":n:409bdc0000000000,"tick":n:40d0ccc000000000,"day":n:4086700000000000,"year":n:405e000000000000,"type":s:"taught","txt":s:"