 spreads.","tech":s:"spear",},{"id":n:409bfc0000000000,"tick":n:40d0d5c000000000,"day":n:4086780000000000,"year":n:405e000000000000,"type":s:"taught","txt":s:"<b>Ylva II</b> taught <b>Bjorn II</b> the secret of Ask's stone well. The knowledge spreads.","tech":s:"well",},{"id":n:409c000000000000,"tick":n:40d0d84000000000,"day":n:4086780000000000,"year":n:405e000000000000,"type":s:"taught","txt":s:"<b>Saga II</b> taught <b>Halvar II</b> the secret of Embla's seedcraft. The knowledge spreads.","tech":s:"farming",},{"id":n:409c040000000000,"tick":n:40d0d90000000000,"day":n:4086800000000000,"year":n:405e000000000000,"type":s:"season","txt":s:"❄️ Winter closes over the world. The stores will decide who sees spring.",},{"id":n:409c080000000000,"tick":n:40d0dd8000000000,"day":n:4086800000000000,"year":n:405e000000000000,"type":s:"star","txt":s:"📜✨ <b>Falk II</b> pressed the pattern of the stars into clay — the first star-marks. Now the sky can be remembered.","agent":n:4055800000000000,},{"id":n:409c0c0000000000,"tick":n:40d0de4000000000,"day":n:4086800000000000,"year":n:405e000000000000,"type":s:"star","txt":s:"📜✨ <b>Selma II</b> pressed the pattern of the stars into clay — the first star-marks. Now the sky can be remembered.","agent":n:4055400000000000,},{"id":n:409c100000000000,"tick":n:40d0de8000000000,"day":n:4086880000000000,"year":n:405e000000000000,"type":s:"star","txt":s:"✨ <b>Saga II</b> lay awake in the dark and watched the lights that do not fall.","agent":n:4058c00000000000,"x":n:4043e01377032b45,"y":n:404092e71b075432,},{"id":n:409c140000000000,"tick":n:40d0df8000000000,"day":n:4086880000000000,"year":n:405e000000000000,"type":s:"failed","txt":s:"<b>Disa II</b> tried something with sand — and failed. But failure teaches.","agent":n:4056400000000000,},{"id":n:409c180000000000,"tick":n:40d0e00000000000,"day":n:4086880000000000,"year":n:405e400000000000,"type":s:"season","txt":s:"🌸 Spring returns. The survivors count each other, and begin again.",},{"id":n:409c1c0000000000,"tick":n:40d0e00000000000,"day":n:4086880000000000,"year":n:405e400000000000,"type":s:"journey","txt":s:"🚶 <b>Sten II</b> set out for Runestead. Ideas travel on foot.","agent":n:4050800000000000,"x":n:40420194417884db,"y":n:403b0dfff06532b6,},{"id":n:409c200000000000,"tick":n:40d0e00000000000,"day":n:4086880000000000,"year":n:405e400000000000,"type":s:"quirk","txt":s:"🙂 <b>Torv II</b> stops at the same strange stone every day, and looks at it. Once begun, never stopped.","agent":n:4041000000000000,"x":n:403e61d9b7cd0e08,"y":n:40407382c56a6d6f,},{"id":n:409c240000000000,"tick":n:40d0e0c000000000,"day":n:4086880000000000,"year":n:405e400000000000,"type":s:"raid","txt":s:"⚔️ <b>Otto</b> set upon <b>Torv II the Voice of Frejaheim</b> and seized goods — the gap was cheaper to close by force.","agent":n:4038000000000000,"victim":n:4041000000000000,"x":n:403dac5679bb80ff,"y":n:403da0593d225180,"cause":s:"greed","causes":[s:"ev:847",s:"agent:34",s:"cause:greed",],},{"id":n:409c280000000000,"tick":n:40d0e18000000000,"day":n:4086880000000000,"year":n:405e400000000000,"type":s:"hoard","txt":s:"🏺 <b>Otto II</b> has begun laying up stores beyond any need. The pile grows — and eyes have begun to follow it.","agent":n:4055000000000000,"x":n:404144d132009a79,"y":n:403cb48827a2d283,"causes":[s:"agent:84",],},{"id":n:409c2c0000000000,"tick":n:40d0e28000000000,"day":n:4086880000000000,"year":n:405e400000000000,"type":s:"feud","txt":s:"🩸 <b>Torv II the Voice of Frejaheim</b> came for <b>Otto</b> — an old wrong, not forgotten, paid back in goods and bruises.","agent":n:4041000000000000,"victim":n:4038000000000000,"x":n:403ccc838f7ca7a2,"y":n:403ed323e0447476,"cause":s:"honor","causes":[s:"ev:1801",s:"agent:24",s:"cause:grudge",],},{"id":n:409c300000000000,"tick":n:40d0e28000000000,"day":n:4086880000000000,"year":n:405e400000000000,"type":s:"death","txt":s:"<b>Otto</b> was killed by <b>Torv II the Voice of Frejaheim</b> in a fight. Much knowledge died with them — unless someon