,"type":s:"field","txt":s:"🌾 <b>Ylva II</b> brings in the harvest from Ylva II's field. Winter holds less fear now.","agent":n:405fc00000000000,"x":n:4043800000000000,"y":n:403b000000000000,},{"id":n:409fec0000000000,"tick":n:40d1aa4000000000,"day":n:4087900000000000,"year":n:405f800000000000,"type":s:"hut","txt":s:"🛖 <b>Tuva II</b> built a hut.","x":n:40416ba231abd302,"y":n:40416e54e7191b08,},{"id":n:409ff00000000000,"tick":n:40d1aa8000000000,"day":n:4087980000000000,"year":n:405f800000000000,"type":s:"hoard","txt":s:"🏺 <b>Ylva II</b> has begun laying up stores beyond any need. The pile grows — and eyes have begun to follow it.","agent":n:4058400000000000,"x":n:404207109db11614,"y":n:4040245f24b7ab7b,"causes":[s:"agent:97",],},{"id":n:409ff40000000000,"tick":n:40d1aac000000000,"day":n:4087980000000000,"year":n:405f800000000000,"type":s:"star","txt":s:"✨ <b>Falk II</b> lay awake in the dark and watched the lights that do not fall.","agent":n:405d000000000000,"x":n:40414ec05777c936,"y":n:403ba1a937e06f00,},{"id":n:409ff80000000000,"tick":n:40d1aac000000000,"day":n:4087980000000000,"year":n:405f800000000000,"type":s:"taught","txt":s:"<b>Nanna II</b> taught <b>Selma II</b> the secret of Ask's lenswork. The knowledge spreads.","tech":s:"glass",},{"id":n:409ffc0000000000,"tick":n:40d1ab0000000000,"day":n:4087980000000000,"year":n:405f800000000000,"type":s:"taught","txt":s:"<b>Kare II</b> taught <b>Sixten II</b> the secret of Embla's braid. The knowledge spreads.","tech":s:"rope",},{"id":n:40a0000000000000,"tick":n:40d1ab4000000000,"day":n:4087980000000000,"year":n:405f800000000000,"type":s:"taught","txt":s:"<b>Eira II</b> taught <b>Halvar II</b> the secret of Embla's mudbrick. The knowledge spreads.","tech":s:"brick",},{"id":n:40a0020000000000,"tick":n:40d1ad0000000000,"day":n:4087980000000000,"year":n:405f800000000000,"type":s:"taught","txt":s:"<b>Vera II</b> taught <b>Torv II</b> the secret of Eira's the tale. The knowledge spreads.","tech":s:"storytelling",},{"id":n:40a0040000000000,"tick":n:40d1b10000000000,"day":n:4087a00000000000,"year":n:405f800000000000,"type":s:"season","txt":s:"❄️ Winter closes over the world. The stores will decide who sees spring.",},{"id":n:40a0060000000000,"tick":n:40d1b38000000000,"day":n:4087a00000000000,"year":n:405f800000000000,"type":s:"taught","txt":s:"<b>Vera II</b> taught <b>Ylva II</b> the secret of Eira's millhouse. The knowledge spreads.","tech":s:"mill",},{"id":n:40a0080000000000,"tick":n:40d1b40000000000,"day":n:4087a00000000000,"year":n:405f800000000000,"type":s:"taught","txt":s:"<b>Torv II</b> taught <b>Orm II</b> the secret of Eira's the tale. The knowledge spreads.","tech":s:"storytelling",},{"id":n:40a00a0000000000,"tick":n:40d1b40000000000,"day":n:4087a00000000000,"year":n:405f800000000000,"type":s:"taught","txt":s:"<b>Ronja II</b> taught <b>Maja II</b> the secret of Ask's fishing line. The knowledge spreads.","tech":s:"fishing",},{"id":n:40a00c0000000000,"tick":n:40d1b64000000000,"day":n:4087a00000000000,"year":n:405f800000000000,"type":s:"child","txt":s:"👶 <b>Bjorn II</b> and <b>Ulv II</b> have had a child, <b>Bjorn II</b> — generation 7. They inherit traits from both.","agent":n:4063c00000000000,"x":n:4024c317bdf66f21,"y":n:40494e0c9c075807,"causes":[s:"agent:68",s:"agent:88",],},{"id":n:40a00e0000000000,"tick":n:40d1b70000000000,"day":n:4087a80000000000,"year":n:405f800000000000,"type":s:"sharing","txt":s:"🍞 <b>Liv II</b> shared food with <b>Loke II</b> — The Hearth-Gift holds. Those who keep the same ways do not let each other starve.","x":n:404263d34bcdbedd,"y":n:4041653f3347dbf0,"agent":n:4057c00000000000,"causes":[s:"agent:95",s:"agent:82",],},{"id":n:40a0100000000000,"tick":n:40d1b74000000000,"day":n:4087a80000000000,"year":n:405f800000000000,"type":s:"star","txt":s:"✨ <b>Nanna II</b> lay awake in the dark and watched the lights that do not fall.","agent":n:405d400000000000,"x":n:40422ebaaae9d98d,"y":n:40426b636c34ff4d,},{"id":n:40a0120000000000,"tick":n:40d1b80000000000,"d