rs into clay — the first star-marks. Now the sky can be remembered.","agent":n:4064a00000000000,},{"id":n:40a6420000000000,"tick":n:40d45bc000000000,"day":n:408b280000000000,"year":n:4062200000000000,"type":s:"hoard","txt":s:"🏺 <b>Tuva II</b> has begun laying up stores beyond any need. The pile grows — and eyes have begun to follow it.","agent":n:4064e00000000000,"x":n:4030a2a2d230b26b,"y":n:4041ee509a23ba34,"causes":[s:"agent:167",],},{"id":n:40a6440000000000,"tick":n:40d45c4000000000,"day":n:408b280000000000,"year":n:4062200000000000,"type":s:"raid","txt":s:"⚔️ <b>Alve II</b> set upon <b>Sten II</b> and seized goods — the gap was cheaper to close by force.","agent":n:4065000000000000,"victim":n:4050800000000000,"x":n:4040f6bc3e0da978,"y":n:4036a1b3168a7d1b,"cause":s:"greed","causes":[s:"ev:1433",s:"agent:66",s:"cause:greed",],},{"id":n:40a6460000000000,"tick":n:40d45c8000000000,"day":n:408b300000000000,"year":n:4062200000000000,"type":s:"star","txt":s:"📜✨ <b>Nanna II</b> pressed the pattern of the stars into clay — the first star-marks. Now the sky can be remembered.","agent":n:4066200000000000,},{"id":n:40a6480000000000,"tick":n:40d45d0000000000,"day":n:408b300000000000,"year":n:4062200000000000,"type":s:"taught","txt":s:"<b>Selma II</b> taught <b>Bjorn II</b> the secret of Ask's number. The knowledge spreads.","tech":s:"numbers",},{"id":n:40a64a0000000000,"tick":n:40d45d0000000000,"day":n:408b300000000000,"year":n:4062200000000000,"type":s:"season","txt":s:"❄️ Winter closes over the world. The stores will decide who sees spring.",},{"id":n:40a64c0000000000,"tick":n:40d45d4000000000,"day":n:408b300000000000,"year":n:4062200000000000,"type":s:"child","txt":s:"👶 <b>Alve II</b> and <b>Eira II</b> have had a child, <b>Idun II</b> — generation 7. They inherit traits from both.","agent":n:4068200000000000,"x":n:403bd30f0482d4a6,"y":n:403b1bda868cbaf4,"causes":[s:"agent:78",s:"agent:121",],},{"id":n:40a64e0000000000,"tick":n:40d45e4000000000,"day":n:408b300000000000,"year":n:4062200000000000,"type":s:"taught","txt":s:"<b>Idun II</b> taught <b>Kare II</b> the secret of Embla's the loom. The knowledge spreads.","tech":s:"weaving",},{"id":n:40a6500000000000,"tick":n:40d45f4000000000,"day":n:408b300000000000,"year":n:4062200000000000,"type":s:"steal","txt":s:"🥀 Need drove the hand: <b>Ask II</b> took what could be carried from <b>Eira II the Voice of Majaheim</b>.","agent":n:4063000000000000,"victim":n:404e800000000000,"x":n:4030862e8d9f2734,"y":n:403f12bbc5990996,"cause":s:"desperation","causes":[s:"ev:2853",s:"agent:61",s:"cause:desperation",s:"cause:winter",],},{"id":n:40a6520000000000,"tick":n:40d45fc000000000,"day":n:408b300000000000,"year":n:4062200000000000,"type":s:"steal","txt":s:"🥀 Need drove the hand: <b>Sten II</b> took what could be carried from <b>Eira II the Voice of Majaheim</b>.","agent":n:405f800000000000,"victim":n:404e800000000000,"x":n:40346bd07c969a2f,"y":n:403e889639ef3ae0,"cause":s:"desperation","causes":[s:"ev:2853",s:"agent:61",s:"cause:desperation",s:"cause:winter",],},{"id":n:40a6540000000000,"tick":n:40d4618000000000,"day":n:408b300000000000,"year":n:4062200000000000,"type":s:"child","txt":s:"👶 <b>Embla II</b> and <b>Bjorn II</b> have had a child, <b>Halvar II</b> — generation 8. They inherit traits from both.","agent":n:4068400000000000,"x":n:4042d202cd7add73,"y":n:403ec6ac7ecfc963,"causes":[s:"agent:153",s:"agent:98",],},{"id":n:40a6560000000000,"tick":n:40d4640000000000,"day":n:408b380000000000,"year":n:4062400000000000,"type":s:"journey","txt":s:"🚶 <b>Nanna II</b> set out for Frejaheim. Ideas travel on foot.","agent":n:4062600000000000,"x":n:4042a2b452b025b7,"y":n:403ee6d052468a77,},{"id":n:40a6580000000000,"tick":n:40d4640000000000,"day":n:408b380000000000,"year":n:4062400000000000,"type":s:"violence","txt":s:"🔥⚔️ Driven by a failing harvest, the people of <b>Frejaheim</b> fell upon <b>Ronjastead</b> — a raid for grain and goods. They took what they could carry.","x":n:401694c57b07baee,"y":n:402e6c5a92f0d5d4,"label":s:"WAR","causes":[s:"cause:scarcity",],},{"id":n:40a65a0000000000,"tick":n:40d4640000000000,"day":n:408b380000000000,"year":n:4062400000000000,"type":s:"leader","txt":s:"🕯️ <b>Frejaheim</b> is without a leader — <b>Loke II</b>'s voice is gone, and no one yet speaks for all.","village":s:"Frejaheim","x":n:401694c57b07baee,"y":n:402e6c5a92f0d5d4,"causes":[s:"ev:2823",],},{"id":n:40a65c0000000000,"tick":n:40d4640000000000,"day":n:408b380000000000,"year":n:4062400000000000,"type":s:"tribute","txt":s:"🧺 In <b>Alveheim</b>, 13 households laid a share at <b>Liv II the Voice of Alveheim</b>'s door. So surplus flows upward, and standing becomes wealth.","village":s:"Alveheim","agent":n:4050400000000000,"x":n:403accb07cb47926,"y":n:403b37b6657cab98,"causes":[s:"agent:65",s:"ev:2794",],},{"id":n:40a65e0000000000,"tick":n:40d4640000000000,"day":n:408b380000000000,"year":n:4062400000000000,"type":s:"knowledgeLost","txt":s:"🕯️ In <b>Runestead</b>, Halvar's red metal is lost — the land cannot feed the craft, or the last who knew it is gone. Until it is brought back or rediscovered.","tech":s:"copper","x":n:403e5a7031830b7a,"y":n:4043b7da751bb8dd,"village":s:"Runestead",},{"id":n:40a6600000000000,"tick":n:40d4640000000000,"day":n:408b380000000000,"year":n:4062400000000000,"type":s:"knowledgeLost","txt":s:"🕯️ In <b>Frejaheim</b>, Halvar's red metal is lost — the land cannot feed the craft, or the last who knew it is gone. Until it is brought back or rediscovered.","tech":s:"copper","x":n:401694c57b07baee,"y":n:402e6c5a92f0d5d4,"village":s:"Frejaheim",},{"id":n:40a6620000000000,"tick":n:40d4640000000000,"day":n:408b380000000000,"year":n:4062400000000000,"type":s:"knowledgeLost","txt":s:"🕯️ In <b>Alveheim</b>, Halvar's red metal is lost — the land cannot feed the craft, or the last who knew it is gone. Until it is brought back or rediscovered.","tech":s:"copper","x":n:403accb07cb47926,"y":n:403b37b6657cab98,"village":s:"Alveheim",},{"id":n:40a6640000000000,"tick":n:40d4640000000000,"day":n:408b380000000000,"year":n:4062400000000000,"type":s:"death","txt":s:"<b>Vidar II</b> was taken by the fever that walks where many live close. Much knowledge died with them — unless someone learned in time.","agent":n:405a800000000000,"x":n:40456e9d65f46c7d,"y":n:403be2b24e06ef6d,"cause":s:"sickness","causes":[s:"cause:sickness",],},{"id":n:40a6660000000000,"tick":n:40d4644000000000,"day":n:408b380000000000,"year":n:4062400000000000,"type":s:"moved","txt":s:"<b>Orm II</b> moved into an abandoned hut.",},{"id":n:40a6680000000000,"tick":n:40d4644000000000,"day":n:408b380000000000,"year":n:4062400000000000,"type":s:"raid","txt":s:"⚔️ <b>Sten II</b> set upon <b>Sten II</b> and seized goods — the gap was cheaper to close by force.","agent":n:405f800000000000,"victim":n:4042000000000000,"x":n:4034154c84907cd3,"y":n:40410f0ef9d7b565,"cause":s:"greed","causes":[s:"ev:774",s:"agent:36",s:"cause:greed",],},{"id":n:40a66a0000000000,"tick":n:40d465c000000000,"day":n:408b380000000000,"year":n:4062400000000000,"type":s:"raid","txt":s:"⚔️ <b>Orm II</b> set upon <b>Nanna II</b> and seized goods — the gap was cheaper to close by force.","agent":n:404e000000000000,"victim":n:405d400000000000,"x":n:401ba523d6f8670e,"y":n:40268ff6191e8515,"cause":s:"greed","causes":[s:"ev:2503",s:"agent:117",s:"cause:greed",],},{"id":n:40a66c0000000000,"tick":n:40d466c000000000,"day":n:408b380000000000,"year":n:4062400000000000,"type":s:"trade","txt":s:"🤝 <b>Maja II</b> and <b>Kare II</b> struck a fair trade across village lines.","agent":n:4054400000000000,"x":n:403165f84bab58a2,"y":n:40412ac53be3f60b,},{"id":n:40a66e0000000000,"tick":n:40d4670000000000,"day":n:408b380000000000,"year":n:4062400000000000,"type":s:"hunt","txt":s:"🎣 <b>Ulv II</b> pulled silver from the water.","agent":n:405d800000000000,"x":n:403e6887ce7443b3,"y":n:4040c6752b47ea2e,},{"id":n:40a6700000000000,"tick":n:40d4678000000000,"day":n:408b380000000000,"year":n:4062400000000000,"type":s:"sharing","txt":s:"🍞 <b>Freja II</b> shared food with <b>Nanna II</b> — The Full Bowl Custom holds. Those who keep the same ways do not let each other starve.","x":n:401f52f4db7daff8,"y":n:4025528bf7994d49,"agent":n:4051c00000000000,"causes":[s:"agent:71",s:"agent:57",],},{"id":n:40a6720000000000,"tick":n:40d467c000000000,"day":n:408b380000000000,"year":n:4062400000000000,"type":s:"failed","txt":s:"<b>Kare II</b> tried something with what was at hand — and failed. But failure teaches.","agent":n:4059800000000000,},{"id":n:40a6740000000000,"tick":n:40d4680000000000,"day":n:408b380000000000,"year":n:4062400000000000,"type":s:"mutation","txt":s:"🧬 <b>Rune II</b> does it differently: laying flowers on the hut wall instead of believing the stars are the eyes of the ancestors, so the dead are never wholly gone. A tradition drifts.","custom":s:"c29",},{"id":n:40a6760000000000,"tick":n:40d4684000000000,"day":n:408b380000000000,"year":n:4062400000000000,"type":s:"star","txt":s:"📜✨ <b>Disa II</b> pressed the pattern of the stars into clay — the first star-marks. Now the sky can be remembered.","agent":n:4066600000000000,},{"id":n:40a6780000000000,"tick":n:40d468c000000000,"day":n:408b400000000000,"year":n:4062400000000000,"type":s:"star","txt":s:"✨ <b>Embla II</b> lay awake in the dark and watched the lights that do not fall.","agent":n:4066e00000000000,"x":n:4035f5200a551a04,"y":n:402ca0ed925efece,},{"id":n:40a67a0000000000,"tick":n:40d469c000000000,"day":n:408b400000000000,"year":n:4062400000000000,"type":s:"raid","txt":s:"⚔️ <b>Nanna II</b> set upon <b>Sixten II</b> and seized goods — the gap was cheaper to close by force.","agent":n:4062600000000000,"victim":n:4049000000000000,"x":n:40428cc574659416,"y":n:403f2870f853c363,"cause":s:"greed","causes":[s:"ev:1279",s:"agent:50",s:"cause:greed",],},{"id":n:40a67c0000000000,"tick":n:40d469c000000000,"day":n:408b400000000000,"year":n:4062400000000000,"type":s:"steal","txt":s:"🥀 Hunger owned the hand: <b>Selma II</b> wrenched food from <b>Maja II</b>.",