nna II the Voice of Ronjastead</b>.","agent":n:4055c00000000000,"x":n:4044e475795f8961,"y":n:4041c9b34599ce2f,},{"id":n:40aaaa0000000000,"tick":n:40d7340000000000,"day":n:408ef80000000000,"year":n:4064c00000000000,"type":s:"leader","txt":s:"🕯️ <b>Alveheim</b> is without a leader — <b>Liv II</b>'s voice is gone, and no one yet speaks for all.","village":s:"Alveheim","x":n:403accb07cb47926,"y":n:403b37b6657cab98,"causes":[s:"ev:2794",],},{"id":n:40aaac0000000000,"tick":n:40d7340000000000,"day":n:408ef80000000000,"year":n:4064c00000000000,"type":s:"tribute","txt":s:"🧺 In <b>Majaheim</b>, 15 households laid a share at <b>Falk II the Voice of Majaheim</b>'s door. So surplus flows upward, and standing becomes wealth.","village":s:"Majaheim","agent":n:404c000000000000,"x":n:4044ec11de87a577,"y":n:4037e90f53b2617b,"causes":[s:"agent:56",s:"ev:3348",],},{"id":n:40aaae0000000000,"tick":n:40d7340000000000,"day":n:408ef80000000000,"year":n:4064c00000000000,"type":s:"death","txt":s:"<b>Rune II</b> was taken by the fever that walks where many live close. Much knowledge died with them — unless someone learned in time.","agent":n:4051800000000000,"x":n:403e65decde4bce7,"y":n:403e4ba410ba957a,"cause":s:"sickness","causes":[s:"cause:sickness",],},{"id":n:40aab00000000000,"tick":n:40d7340000000000,"day":n:408ef80000000000,"year":n:4064c00000000000,"type":s:"customBack","txt":s:"🌱 <b>Sixten II</b> has revived The Unseen Wills — an old way returns.","custom":s:"c27",},{"id":n:40aab20000000000,"tick":n:40d7350000000000,"day":n:408ef80000000000,"year":n:4064c00000000000,"type":s:"hunt","txt":s:"🎣 <b>Vidar II</b> pulled silver from the water.","agent":n:4068800000000000,"x":n:4049bad1627358c0,"y":n:4047c8cf77b080cf,},{"id":n:40aab40000000000,"tick":n:40d73a4000000000,"day":n:408f000000000000,"year":n:4064c00000000000,"type":s:"imitated","txt":s:"<b>Eira II</b> has begun that spilling the blood of your own is forbidden, the way Maja II does. The custom spreads.","custom":s:"c38",},{"id":n:4