":s:"death","txt":s:"<b>Kare II</b> died of old age at 80. Much knowledge died with them — unless someone learned in time.","agent":n:4052000000000000,"x":n:404045ff26eb5abd,"y":n:404457e004df6b47,"cause":s:"age","causes":[s:"cause:age",],},{"id":n:40abe00000000000,"tick":n:40d899c000000000,"day":n:4090680000000000,"year":n:4065e00000000000,"type":s:"moved","txt":s:"<b>Torv II</b> moved into an abandoned hut.",},{"id":n:40abe20000000000,"tick":n:40d89ac000000000,"day":n:40906c0000000000,"year":n:4065e00000000000,"type":s:"tabooBroken","txt":s:"⚡ <b>Halvar II</b> has broken The Ban of the Living Trees — gathering wood to survive. Guilt follows; so may division.","custom":s:"c32","agent":n:4068400000000000,"x":n:404a99eea5a2d333,"y":n:40480e42ac9c74d3,},{"id":n:40abe40000000000,"tick":n:40d89ac000000000,"day":n:40906c0000000000,"year":n:4065e00000000000,"type":s:"epithet","txt":s:"✨ From that day on, <b>Halvar II</b> was known as <b>Halvar II the Oathbreaker</b>.","agent":n:4068400000000000,"x":n:404a99eea5a2d333,"y":n:40480e42ac9c74d3,},{"id":n:40abe60000000000,"tick":n:40d89ac000000000,"day":n:40906c0000000000,"year":n:4065e00000000000,"type":s:"rebel","txt":s:"<b>Halvar II</b> no longer keeps The Ban of the Living Trees. A rebel — or the first of a new way.","custom":s:"c32",},{"id":n:40abe80000000000,"tick":n:40d89ac000000000,"day":n:40906c0000000000,"year":n:4065e00000000000,"type":s:"hut","txt":s:"🛖 <b>Halvar II</b> built a hut.","x":n:404a99eea5a2d333,"y":n:40480e42ac9c74d3,},{"id":n:40abea0000000000,"tick":n:40d89b0000000000,"day":n:40906c0000000000,"year":n:4065e00000000000,"type":s:"taught","txt":s:"<b>Ulv II</b> taught <b>Selma II</b> the secret of Embla II's reasoned thought. The knowledge spreads.","tech":s:"philosophy",},{"id":n:40abec0000000000,"tick":n:40d89b4000000000,"day":n:40906c0000000000,"year":n:4065e00000000000,"type":s:"moved","txt":s:"<b>Tuva II</b> moved into an abandoned hut.",},{"id":n:40abee0000000000,"tick":n:40d89c0000000000,"day":n:40906c0000000000,"year":n:4066000000000000,"type":s:"journey","txt":s:"🚶 <b>Disa II</b> set out for Runestead. Ideas travel on foot.","agent":n:4066600000000000,"x":n:40439d733bf1cd3c,"y":n:4040a67c20aafe89,},{"id":n:40abf00000000000,"tick":n:40d89c0000000000,"day":n:40906c0000000000,"year":n:4066000000000000,"type":s:"quirk","txt":s:"🙂 <b>Embla II</b> whistles every morning, whether the morning deserves it or not. It began the year Signe II died. It has not stopped since.","agent":n:4063200000000000,"x":n:404a6302628b9431,"y":n:40416f31b6038111,},{"id":n:40abf20000000000,"tick":n:40d89c0000000000,"day":n:40906c0000000000,"year":n:4066000000000000,"type":s:"violence","txt":s:"🔥⚔️ Driven by a failing harvest, the people of <b>Ronjastead</b> fell upon <b>Majaheim</b> — a raid for grain and goods. They took what they could carry.","x":n:4049e9c4e613f49e,"y":n:404206087fe9cc35,"label":s:"WAR","causes":[s:"cause:scarcity",],},{"id":n:40abf40000000000,"tick":n:40d89c0000000000,"day":n:40906c0000000000,"year":n:4066000000000000,"type":s:"leader","txt":s:"🕯️ <b>Frejaheim</b> is without a leader — <b>Nanna II</b>'s voice is gone, and no one yet speaks for all.","village":s:"Frejaheim","x":n:401694c57b07baee,"y":n:402e6c5a92f0d5d4,"causes":[s:"ev:2902",],},{"id":n:40abf60000000000,"tick":n:40d89e4000000000,"day":n:40906c0000000000,"year":n:4066000000000000,"type":s:"tech","txt":s:"🧱 <b>Nanna II</b> dressed and fitted stone so it stood without mortar — <b>Nanna II's dry-stone</b> (Masonry) has been invented! <i>Buildings that outlive their builders — the seed of monuments.</i>","tech":s:"masonry","agent":n:4062600000000000,"x":n:40422617781e4d06,"y":n:403e7afa7c587eca,"causes":[s:"ev:54",],},{"id":n:40abf80000000000,"tick":n:40d8a30000000000,"day":n:4090700000000000,"year":n:4066000000000000,"type":s:"failed","txt":s:"<b>Alve II</b> tried something with stone — and failed. But failure teaches.","agent":n:4065000000000000,},{"id":n:40abfa0000000000,"tick":n:40d8a54000000000,"day":n:4090700000000000,"year":n:4066000000000000,"type":s:"hoard","txt":s:"🏺 <b>Orm II</b> has begun laying up stores beyond any need. The pile grows — and eyes have begun to follow it.","agent":n:406a400000000000,"x":n:404e73d144939750,"y":n:4041cff123cb4b87,"causes":[s:"agent:210",],},{"id":n:40abfc0000000000,"tick":n:40d8a5c000000000,"day":n:4090700000000000,"year":n:4066000000000000,"type":s:"failed","txt":s:"<b>Alve II</b> tried something with stone — and failed. But failure teaches.","agent":n:4065000000000000,},{"id":n:40abfe0000000000,"tick":n:40d8a5c000000000,"day":n:4090700000000000,"year":n:4066000000000000,"type":s:"hoard","txt":s:"🏺 <b>Eira II</b> has begun laying up stores beyond any need. The pile grows — and eyes have begun to follow it.","agent":n:406a600000000000,"x":n:403f34a11104d208,"y":n:4040715df29fb33e,"causes":[s:"agent:211",],},{"id":n:40ac000000000000,"tick":n:40d8a60000000000,"day":n:4090700000000000,"year":n:4066000000000000,"type":s:"star","txt":s:"🌌 Under the Watchers, the people gather in the dark and turn their faces to the stars.","agent":n:4069000000000000,"x":n:404f5528afad5c2f,"y":n:40415ca27902a5fe,},{"id":n:40ac020000000000,"tick":n:40d8a68000000000,"day":n:4090740000000000,"year":n:4066000000000000,"type":s:"taught","txt":s:"<b>Vidar II</b> taught <b>Freja II</b> the secret of Eira's millhouse. The knowledge spreads.","tech":s:"mill",},{"id":n:40ac040000000000,"tick":n:40d8ac4000000000,"day":n:4090740000000000,"year":n:4066000000000000,"type":s:"taught","txt":s:"<b>Kare II</b> taught <b>Alve II</b> the secret of Nanna II's dry-stone. The knowledge spreads.","tech":s:"masonry",},{"id":n:40ac060000000000,"tick":n:40d8acc000000000,"day":n:4090780000000000,"year":n:4066000000000000,"type":s:"failed","txt":s:"<b>Sixten II</b> tried something with stone — and failed. But failure teaches.","agent":n:4061800000000000,},{"id":n:40ac080000000000,"tick":n:40d8b20000000000,"day":n:4090780000000000,"year":n:4066000000000000,"type":s:"star","tx