,"year":n:4066600000000000,"type":s:"death","txt":s:"<b>Ylva II</b> was taken by the fever that walks where many live close. Much knowledge died with them — unless someone learned in time.","agent":n:4063a00000000000,"x":n:4053b4ca60840cd8,"y":n:4043557a6367aa4c,"cause":s:"sickness","causes":[s:"cause:sickness",],},{"id":n:40ac360000000000,"tick":n:40d90c8000000000,"day":n:4090b80000000000,"year":n:4066600000000000,"type":s:"steal","txt":s:"🥀 Hunger owned the hand: <b>Maja II</b> wrenched food from <b>Eira II</b>.","agent":n:4061a00000000000,"victim":n:4062e00000000000,"x":n:40427499bab7a1b8,"y":n:4041773bf5d05cad,"cause":s:"desperation","causes":[s:"ev:3607",s:"agent:151",s:"cause:desperation",],},{"id":n:40ac380000000000,"tick":n:40d90f0000000000,"day":n:4090b80000000000,"year":n:4066600000000000,"type":s:"steal","txt":s:"🥀 Need drove the hand: <b>Embla II</b> took what could be carried from <b>Nanna II the Voice of Ronjastead</b>.","agent":n:4063200000000000,"victim":n:4055c00000000000,"x":n:40442b9810d60787,"y":n:4045ca15e76a38cb,"cause":s:"desperation","causes":[s:"ev:3607",s:"agent:87",s:"cause:desperation",],},{"id":n:40ac3a0000000000,"tick":n:40d9124000000000,"day":n:4090b80000000000,"year":n:4066600000000000,"type":s:"death","txt":s:"<b>Tuva II</b> died of old age at 59. Much knowledge died with them — unless someone learned in time.","agent":n:4061200000000000,"x":n:4045763bec9a1f1d,"y":n:403d3fa2a79fa5b8,"cause":s:"age","causes":[s:"cause:age",],},{"id":n:40ac3c0000000000,"tick":n:40d9124000000000,"day":n:4090b80000000000,"year":n:4066600000000000,"type":s:"customLost","txt":s:"🕯️ No one remembers Laying flowers on the grave anymore. A piece of who they were is gone.","custom":s:"c19",},{"id":n:40ac3e0000000000,"tick":n:40d9250000000000,"day":n:4090c80000000000,"year":n:4066600000000000,"type":s:"season","txt":s:"❄️ A hard winter grips the world. The old will remember it; not all the young will see spring.",},{"id":n:40ac400000000000,"tick":n:40d92a8000000000,"day":n:4090cc0000000000,"year":n:4066600000000000,"type":s:"moved","txt":s:"<b>Bjorn II</b> moved into an abandoned hut.",},{"id":n:40ac420000000000,"tick":n:40d92c0000000000,"day":n:4090cc0000000000,"year":n:4066800000000000,"type":s:"death","txt":s:"<b>Orm II</b> fell in the raid on Runestead. Much knowledge died with them — unless someone learned in time.","agent":n:4056800000000000,"x":n:4043a1aaea949236,"y":n:404274a927dcdd93,"cause":s:"violence","causes":[s:"cause:violence",s:"agent:166",s:"cause:war",],},{"id":n:40ac440000000000,"tick":n:40d92c0000000000,"day":n:4090cc0000000000,"year":n:4066800000000000,"type":s:"legend","txt":s:"🕊️ Orm II is gone. But someone still leaves a flower where no one sees. No one asks why it began.","agent":n:4056800000000000,},{"id":n:40ac460000000000,"tick":n:40d92c0000000000,"day":n:4090cc0000000000,"year":n:4066800000000000,"type":s:"death","txt":s:"<b>Vera II</b> fell in the raid on Runestead. Much knowledge died with them — unless someone learned in time.","agent":n:4065a00000000000,"x":n:4050963e0bfa5658,"y":n:404718122487dd4c,"cause":s:"violence","causes":[s:"cause:violence",s:"agent:94",s:"cause:war",],},{"id":n:40ac480000000000,"tick":n:40d92c0000000000,"day":n:4090cc0000000000,"year":n:4066800000000000,"type":s:"violence","txt":s:"🔥⚔️ Driven by a failing harvest, the people of <b>Ronjastead</b> fell upon <b>Runestead</b> — a raid for grain and goods. 2 lay dead (1 of Runestead, 1 of Ronjastead).","x":n:4049e9c4e613f49e,"y":n:404206087fe9cc35,"label":s:"WAR","causes":[s:"cause:scarcity",],},{"id":n:40ac4a0000000000,"tick":n:40d92c0000000000,"day":n:4090cc0000000000,"year":n:4066800000000000,"type":s:"death","txt":s:"<b>Tuva II</b> was taken by the fever that walks where many live close. Much knowledge died with them — unless someone learned in time.","agent":n:4064e00000000000,"x":n:4042cad127148e83,"y":n:403a8526a7fe75c6,"cause":s:"sickness","causes":[s:"cause:sickness",],},{"id":n:40ac4c0000000000,"tick":n:40d92c