":n:40df550000000000,"day":n:4094e80000000000,"year":n:406be00000000000,"type":s:"season","txt":s:"❄️ Winter closes over the world. The stores will decide who sees spring.",},{"id":n:40b0670000000000,"tick":n:40df5c0000000000,"day":n:4094ec0000000000,"year":n:406c000000000000,"type":s:"journey","txt":s:"🚶 <b>Sixten II</b> set out for Runestead. Ideas travel on foot.","agent":n:406cc00000000000,"x":n:4039be2ea48db9cd,"y":n:4034b349aaa8a2c2,},{"id":n:40b0680000000000,"tick":n:40df5c0000000000,"day":n:4094ec0000000000,"year":n:406c000000000000,"type":s:"quirk","txt":s:"🙂 <b>Otto II</b> picks a flower every spring and puts it somewhere no one sees. It began the year Ronja II died. It has not stopped since.","agent":n:406d400000000000,"x":n:404009d92622b7b5,"y":n:403932f57a26859d,},{"id":n:40b0690000000000,"tick":n:40df5c0000000000,"day":n:4094ec0000000000,"year":n:406c000000000000,"type":s:"tribute","txt":s:"🧺 In <b>Majaheim</b>, 5 households laid a share at <b>Bjorn II the Voice of Majaheim</b>'s door. So surplus flows upward, and standing becomes wealth.","village":s:"Majaheim","agent":n:4067800000000000,"x":n:4044ec11de87a577,"y":n:4037e90f53b2617b,"causes":[s:"agent:188",s:"ev:4156",],},{"id":n:40b06a0000000000,"tick":n:40df5cc000000000,"day":n:4094ec0000000000,"year":n:406c000000000000,"type":s:"taught","txt":s:"<b>Loke II</b> taught <b>Liv II</b> the secret of Ask's roller. The knowledge spreads.","tech":s:"wheel",},{"id":n:40b06b0000000000,"tick":n:40df5fc000000000,"day":n:4094ec0000000000,"year":n:406c000000000000,"type":s:"taught","txt":s:"<b>Loke II</b> taught <b>Eira II</b> the secret of Eira's the tale. The knowledge spreads.","tech":s:"storytelling",},{"id":n:40b06c0000000000,"tick":n:40df60c000000000,"day":n:4094f00000000000,"year":n:406c000000000000,"type":s:"taught","txt":s:"<b>Sixten II</b> taught <b>Ulv II</b> the secret of Ask II's written music. The knowledge spreads.","tech":s:"composition",},{"id":n:40b06d0000000000,"tick":n:40df634000000000,"day":n:4094f00000000000,"year":n:406c000000000000,"type":s:"child","txt":s:"👶 <b>Maja II</b> and <b>Otto II</b> have had a child, <b>Sten II</b> — generation 10. They inherit traits from both.","agent":n:406ec00000000000,"x":n:40410ea21d9de6fd,"y":n:403be93d7327db12,"causes":[s:"agent:231",s:"agent:234",],},{"id":n:40b06e0000000000,"tick":n:40df660000000000,"day":n:4094f00000000000,"year":n:406c000000000000,"type":s:"star","txt":s:"🌌 Under the Watchers, the people gather in the dark and turn their faces to the stars.","agent":n:406c800000000000,"x":n:4041940e3c27833f,"y":n:404154a10ea70c39,},{"id":n:40b06f0000000000,"tick":n:40df6c0000000000,"day":n:4094f40000000000,"year":n:406c000000000000,"type":s:"child","txt":s:"👶 <b>Alve II</b> and <b>Vidar II</b> have had a child, <b>Ylva II</b> — generation 11. They inherit traits from both.","agent":n:406ee00000000000,"x":n:4040d74011f6b672,"y":n:4042605648343f6f,"causes":[s:"agent:228",s:"agent:226",],},{"id":n:40b0700000000000,"tick":n:40df6c4000000000,"day":n:4094f40000000000,"year":n:406c000000000000,"type":s:"child","txt":s:"👶 <b>Sixten II</b> and <b>Sten II</b> have had a child, <b>Bjorn II</b> — generation 11. They inherit traits from both.","agent":n:406f000000000000,"x":n:403e7b579515a9e1,"y":n:403eb570ecaaf05b,"causes":[s:"agent:230",s:"agent:216",],},{"id":n:40b0710000000000,"tick":n:40df718000000000,"day":n:4094f80000000000,"year":n:406c000000000000,"type":s:"imitated","txt":s:"<b>Ylva II</b> has begun believing the world repeats and can be understood, the way Vidar II does. The custom spreads.","custom":s:"c3",},{"id":n:40b0720000000000,"tick":n:40df760000000000,"day":n:4094fc0000000000,"year":n:406c000000000000,"type":s:"taught","txt":s:"<b>Falk II</b> taught <b>Embla II</b> the secret of Nanna II's dry-stone. The knowledge spreads.","tech":s:"masonry",},{"id":n:40b0730000000000,"tick":n:40df780000000000,"day":n:4094fc0000000000,"year":n:406c000000000000,"type":s:"taught","txt":s:"<b>Bjorn II</b> taught <b>Orm II</