:4097500000000000,"year":n:406f200000000000,"type":s:"child","txt":s:"👶 <b>Kare II</b> and <b>Eira II</b> have had a child, <b>Rune II</b> — generation 12. They inherit traits from both.","agent":n:4071800000000000,"x":n:40402eec5f63fd81,"y":n:4040fbf9d8f7db62,"causes":[s:"agent:252",s:"agent:241",],},{"id":n:40b2080000000000,"tick":n:40e17c2000000000,"day":n:4097540000000000,"year":n:406f200000000000,"type":s:"death","txt":s:"<b>Rune II</b> died of old age at 63. Much knowledge died with them — unless someone learned in time.","agent":n:406b800000000000,"x":n:404b87ae8ac755c8,"y":n:40417b1ff622277f,"cause":s:"age","causes":[s:"cause:age",],},{"id":n:40b2090000000000,"tick":n:40e17de000000000,"day":n:4097540000000000,"year":n:406f200000000000,"type":s:"death","txt":s:"<b>Freja II the Voice of Majaheim</b> died of old age at 63. Much knowledge died with them — unless someone learned in time.","agent":n:406ba00000000000,"x":n:404fddcd8d079a2d,"y":n:4041aa9cb027a191,"cause":s:"age","causes":[s:"cause:age",],},{"id":n:40b20a0000000000,"tick":n:40e17de000000000,"day":n:4097540000000000,"year":n:406f200000000000,"type":s:"legend","txt":s:"🕊️ Freja II the Voice of Majaheim is gone. But someone still names things that need no names. No one asks why it began.","agent":n:406ba00000000000,},{"id":n:40b20b0000000000,"tick":n:40e17e8000000000,"day":n:4097580000000000,"year":n:406f200000000000,"type":s:"season","txt":s:"❄️ A hard winter grips the world. The old will remember it; not all the young will see spring.",},{"id":n:40b20c0000000000,"tick":n:40e17f0000000000,"day":n:4097580000000000,"year":n:406f200000000000,"type":s:"taught","txt":s:"<b>Bjorn II</b> taught <b>Selma II</b> the secret of Ask's script. The knowledge spreads.","tech":s:"writing",},{"id":n:40b20d0000000000,"tick":n:40e181c000000000,"day":n:40975c0000000000,"year":n:406f200000000000,"type":s:"custom","txt":s:"🌿 <b>Liv II</b> began drumming under the old tree as the light fades — no one told them to. Others may