0000000000,"year":n:406f800000000000,"type":s:"death","txt":s:"<b>Ylva II the Voice of Ronjastead</b> died of old age at 71. Much knowledge died with them — unless someone learned in time.","agent":n:406b200000000000,"x":n:40453284ad9c2dd2,"y":n:4041ee20e09572b9,"cause":s:"age","causes":[s:"cause:age",],},{"id":n:40b2320000000000,"tick":n:40e1b2c000000000,"day":n:40979c0000000000,"year":n:406f800000000000,"type":s:"hoard","txt":s:"🏺 <b>Halvar II</b> has begun laying up stores beyond any need. The pile grows — and eyes have begun to follow it.","agent":n:406fc00000000000,"x":n:403f38e8c8a14b6d,"y":n:40423361bb9d6f85,"causes":[s:"agent:254",],},{"id":n:40b2330000000000,"tick":n:40e1b3a000000000,"day":n:40979c0000000000,"year":n:406f800000000000,"type":s:"hoard","txt":s:"🏺 <b>Maja II</b> has begun laying up stores beyond any need. The pile grows — and eyes have begun to follow it.","agent":n:4070500000000000,"x":n:40493364c0fb3a55,"y":n:4044ae4f5614a84c,"causes":[s:"agent:261",],},{"id":n:40b2340000000000,"tick":n:40e1b3c000000000,"day":n:40979c0000000000,"year":n:406f800000000000,"type":s:"conversion","txt":s:"<b>Sten II</b> has left Planting a seed by the fallen prey for Pouring water over the fallen prey. Minds change; so do worlds.","custom":s:"c5","from":s:"c36",},{"id":n:40b2350000000000,"tick":n:40e1b48000000000,"day":n:4097a00000000000,"year":n:406f800000000000,"type":s:"season","txt":s:"❄️ Winter closes over the world. The stores will decide who sees spring.",},{"id":n:40b2360000000000,"tick":n:40e1b62000000000,"day":n:4097a00000000000,"year":n:406f800000000000,"type":s:"taught","txt":s:"<b>Rune II</b> taught <b>Ylva II</b> the secret of Ask's the healer. The knowledge spreads.","tech":s:"medicine",},{"id":n:40b2370000000000,"tick":n:40e1b62000000000,"day":n:4097a00000000000,"year":n:406f800000000000,"type":s:"moved","txt":s:"<b>Vera II</b> moved into an abandoned hut.",},{"id":n:40b2380000000000,"tick":n:40e1b68000000000,"day":n:4097a00000000000,"year":n:406f