astead</b> is without a leader — <b>Ylva II</b>'s voice is gone, and no one yet speaks for all.","village":s:"Ronjastead","x":n:4049e9c4e613f49e,"y":n:404206087fe9cc35,"causes":[s:"ev:4482",],},{"id":n:40b23f0000000000,"tick":n:40e1b80000000000,"day":n:4097a40000000000,"year":n:406fa00000000000,"type":s:"leader","txt":s:"👑 In <b>Majaheim</b>, the people have begun to listen when <b>Orm II</b> speaks — prestige has hardened into leadership. No one voted; it is simply so.","village":s:"Majaheim","agent":n:406e000000000000,"x":n:4044ec11de87a577,"y":n:4037e90f53b2617b,"label":s:"A LEADER IS RECOGNIZED","causes":[s:"agent:240",],},{"id":n:40b2400000000000,"tick":n:40e1b80000000000,"day":n:4097a40000000000,"year":n:406fa00000000000,"type":s:"epithet","txt":s:"✨ From that day on, <b>Orm II</b> was known as <b>Orm II the Voice of Majaheim</b>.","agent":n:406e000000000000,"x":n:404da6d8cbf57739,"y":n:403d7489d73aaac4,},{"id":n:40b2410000000000,"tick":n:40e1b96000000000,"day":n:4097a40000000000,"year":n:406fa00000000000,"type":s:"child","txt":s:"👶 <b>Saga II</b> and <b>Signe II</b> have had a child, <b>Halvar II</b> — generation 12. They inherit traits from both.","agent":n:4071c00000000000,"x":n:404379badbb45fc1,"y":n:403e20201eb0d477,"causes":[s:"agent:249",s:"agent:255",],},{"id":n:40b2420000000000,"tick":n:40e1b9c000000000,"day":n:4097a40000000000,"year":n:406fa00000000000,"type":s:"star","txt":s:"✨ <b>Falk II</b> lay awake in the dark and watched the lights that do not fall.","agent":n:4070a00000000000,"x":n:40411da3b5fcc57f,"y":n:40389afd2ee2388f,},{"id":n:40b2430000000000,"tick":n:40e1ba2000000000,"day":n:4097a40000000000,"year":n:406fa00000000000,"type":s:"steal","txt":s:"🥀 Hunger owned the hand: <b>Liv II</b> wrenched food from <b>Rune II</b>.","agent":n:406ea00000000000,"victim":n:406f400000000000,"x":n:403ef7bb9dd56e87,"y":n:404299f738de5330,"cause":s:"desperation","causes":[s:"ev:4661",s:"agent:250",s:"cause:desperation",],},{"id":n:40b2440000000000,"tick":n:40e1