:n:4070700000000000,"type":s:"customLost","txt":s:"🕯️ No one remembers Laying flowers on the newborn's doorstep anymore. A piece of who they were is gone.","custom":s:"c26",},{"id":n:40b2ee0000000000,"tick":n:40e27a8000000000,"day":n:4098a80000000000,"year":n:4070700000000000,"type":s:"season","txt":s:"❄️ Winter closes over the world. The stores will decide who sees spring.",},{"id":n:40b2ef0000000000,"tick":n:40e27d0000000000,"day":n:4098a80000000000,"year":n:4070700000000000,"type":s:"star","txt":s:"🌌 Under the Watchers, the people gather in the dark and turn their faces to the stars.","agent":n:406fa00000000000,"x":n:403974951d3f255a,"y":n:403fd15699ee316c,},{"id":n:40b2f00000000000,"tick":n:40e27e0000000000,"day":n:4098ac0000000000,"year":n:4070800000000000,"type":s:"journey","txt":s:"🚶 <b>Ulv II</b> set out for Ronjastead. Ideas travel on foot.","agent":n:406dc00000000000,"x":n:40415ae4e18d5f80,"y":n:403c861ae76bd2ed,},{"id":n:40b2f10000000000,"tick":n:40e27e0000000000,"day":n:4098ac0000000000,"year":n:4070800000000000,"type":s:"violence","txt":s:"🔥⚔️ Driven by a failing harvest, the people of <b>Alveheim</b> fell upon <b>Ronjastead</b> — a raid for grain and goods. They took what they could carry.","x":n:403accb07cb47926,"y":n:403b37b6657cab98,"label":s:"WAR","causes":[s:"cause:scarcity",],},{"id":n:40b2f20000000000,"tick":n:40e27e0000000000,"day":n:4098ac0000000000,"year":n:4070800000000000,"type":s:"leader","txt":s:"👑 In <b>Alveheim</b>, the people have begun to listen when <b>Vidar II</b> speaks — prestige has hardened into leadership. No one voted; it is simply so.","village":s:"Alveheim","agent":n:406c400000000000,"x":n:403accb07cb47926,"y":n:403b37b6657cab98,"label":s:"A LEADER IS RECOGNIZED","causes":[s:"agent:226",],},{"id":n:40b2f30000000000,"tick":n:40e27e0000000000,"day":n:4098ac0000000000,"year":n:4070800000000000,"type":s:"epithet","txt":s:"✨ From that day on, <b>Vidar II</b> was known as <b>Vidar II the Voice of Alveheim</b>.","agent":n:406c40000