, the people gather in the dark and turn their faces to the stars.","agent":n:4071b00000000000,"x":n:4041258479508bbf,"y":n:403c1c7a4c92a7e1,},{"id":n:40b2fb0000000000,"tick":n:40e2898000000000,"day":n:4098bc0000000000,"year":n:4070800000000000,"type":s:"field","txt":s:"🌾 <b>Maja II</b> brings in the harvest from Maja II's field. Winter holds less fear now.","agent":n:4070500000000000,"x":n:4043000000000000,"y":n:403b000000000000,},{"id":n:40b2fc0000000000,"tick":n:40e28c0000000000,"day":n:4098bc0000000000,"year":n:4070800000000000,"type":s:"taught","txt":s:"<b>Halvar II</b> taught <b>Freja II</b> the secret of Ask's hearth. The knowledge spreads.","tech":s:"kiln",},{"id":n:40b2fd0000000000,"tick":n:40e28c8000000000,"day":n:4098c00000000000,"year":n:4070800000000000,"type":s:"star","txt":s:"✨ <b>Idun II</b> lay awake in the dark and watched the lights that do not fall.","agent":n:4071b00000000000,"x":n:4041258479508bbf,"y":n:403c1c7a4c92a7e1,},{"id":n:40b2fe0000000000,"tick":n:40e28c8000000000,"day":n:4098c00000000000,"year":n:4070800000000000,"type":s:"season","txt":s:"❄️ Winter closes over the world. The stores will decide who sees spring.",},{"id":n:40b2ff0000000000,"tick":n:40e2900000000000,"day":n:4098c40000000000,"year":n:4070900000000000,"type":s:"season","txt":s:"🌸 Spring returns. The survivors count each other, and begin again.",},{"id":n:40b3000000000000,"tick":n:40e2900000000000,"day":n:4098c40000000000,"year":n:4070900000000000,"type":s:"journey","txt":s:"🚶 <b>Ask II</b> set out for Runestead. Ideas travel on foot.","agent":n:406e400000000000,"x":n:404331c136ecf43a,"y":n:403f8615cbe478d0,},{"id":n:40b3010000000000,"tick":n:40e2900000000000,"day":n:4098c40000000000,"year":n:4070900000000000,"type":s:"quirk","txt":s:"🙂 <b>Freja II</b> picks a flower every spring and puts it somewhere no one sees. As Sixten II did before them. No one decided this.","agent":n:4071900000000000,"x":n:403925013b8ece36,"y":n:402fd852033bcfc5,},{"id":n:40b3020000000000,"tick":n:4