ed","txt":s:"💡 In <b>Frejaheim</b>, Ask II's written music is known again — a craft the village had lost returns to living hands.","tech":s:"composition","x":n:401694c57b07baee,"y":n:402e6c5a92f0d5d4,"village":s:"Frejaheim",},{"id":n:40b3200000000000,"tick":n:40e290a000000000,"day":n:4098c40000000000,"year":n:4070900000000000,"type":s:"taught","txt":s:"<b>Kare II</b> taught <b>Otto II</b> the secret of Ask's longbow. The knowledge spreads.","tech":s:"bow",},{"id":n:40b3210000000000,"tick":n:40e291e000000000,"day":n:4098c40000000000,"year":n:4070900000000000,"type":s:"star","txt":s:"📜✨ <b>Bjorn II</b> pressed the pattern of the stars into clay — the first star-marks. Now the sky can be remembered.","agent":n:4071600000000000,},{"id":n:40b3220000000000,"tick":n:40e291e000000000,"day":n:4098c40000000000,"year":n:4070900000000000,"type":s:"star","txt":s:"📜✨ <b>Saga II</b> pressed the pattern of the stars into clay — the first star-marks. Now the sky can be remembered.","agent":n:4071700000000000,},{"id":n:40b3230000000000,"tick":n:40e2920000000000,"day":n:4098c40000000000,"year":n:4070900000000000,"type":s:"hunt","txt":s:"🎣 <b>Embla II</b> pulled silver from the water.","agent":n:406e600000000000,"x":n:404405ae471f305c,"y":n:403be66b1495225e,},{"id":n:40b3240000000000,"tick":n:40e295a000000000,"day":n:4098cc0000000000,"year":n:4070900000000000,"type":s:"hoard","txt":s:"🏺 <b>Sten II</b> has begun laying up stores beyond any need. The pile grows — and eyes have begun to follow it.","agent":n:4071400000000000,"x":n:4041fc01efb1859b,"y":n:4041deb900451abb,"causes":[s:"agent:276",],},{"id":n:40b3250000000000,"tick":n:40e2968000000000,"day":n:4098cc0000000000,"year":n:4070900000000000,"type":s:"taught","txt":s:"<b>Vera II</b> taught <b>Tuva II</b> the secret of Nanna II's dry-stone. The knowledge spreads.","tech":s:"masonry",},{"id":n:40b3260000000000,"tick":n:40e2988000000000,"day":n:4098d00000000000,"year":n:4070900000000000,"type":s:"feud","txt":s:"🩸 <b>Orm II</b> came for <b>Kare II</b> — an old wrong, not forgotten, answered at last.","agent":n:4070e00000000000,"victim":n:406bc00000000000,"x":n:40419b2a7eaa2c19,"y":n:403bbb7a77fcd335,"cause":s:"honor","causes":[s:"ev:4866",s:"agent:222",s:"cause:grudge",],},{"id":n:40b3270000000000,"tick":n:40e29ae000000000,"day":n:4098d00000000000,"year":n:4070900000000000,"type":s:"star","txt":s:"✨ <b>Freja II</b> lay awake in the dark and watched the lights that do not fall.","agent":n:4071900000000000,"x":n:403817407a7b4474,"y":n:40361a812e0031d5,},{"id":n:40b3280000000000,"tick":n:40e29c8000000000,"day":n:4098d40000000000,"year":n:4070900000000000,"type":s:"field","txt":s:"🌾 <b>Ulv II</b> brings in the harvest from Ulv II's field. Winter holds less fear now.","agent":n:406dc00000000000,"x":n:4042800000000000,"y":n:4038000000000000,},{"id":n:40b3290000000000,"tick":n:40e29e8000000000,"day":n:4098d80000000000,"year":n:4070900000000000,"type":s:"season","txt":s:"❄️ Winter closes over the world. The stores will decide who sees spring.",},{"id":n:40b32a0000000000,"tick":n:40e29ea000000000,"day":n:4098d80000000000,"year":n:4070900000000000,"type":s:"death","txt":s:"<b>Otto II</b> starved to death. Much knowledge died with them — unless someone learned in time.","agent":n:4072600000000000,"x":n:404369b1457bfdfe,"y":n:403c619f381bafe4,"cause":s:"starvation","causes":[s:"cause:starvation",],},{"id":n:40b32b0000000000,"tick":n:40e2a10000000000,"day":n:4098d80000000000,"year":n:4070900000000000,"type":s:"taught","txt":s:"<b>Vera II</b> taught <b>Sixten II</b> the secret of Ask's hearth. The knowledge spreads.","tech":s:"kiln",},{"id":n:40b32c0000000000,"tick":n:40e2a16000000000,"day":n:4098dc0000000000,"year":n:4070900000000000,"type":s:"steal","txt":s:"🥀 Hunger owned the hand: <b>Saga II</b> wrenched food from <b>Saga II</b>.","agent":n:406f200000000000,"victim":n:4071700000000000,"x":n:404b830a90c5bc30,"y":n:4048624254d8b2ce,"cause":s:"desperation","causes":[s:"ev:4905",s:"agent:279",s:"cause:desperati