:40e2d4a000000000,"day":n:4099200000000000,"year":n:4070c00000000000,"type":s:"child","txt":s:"👶 <b>Maja II</b> and <b>Bjorn II</b> have had a child, <b>Liv II</b> — generation 13. They inherit traits from both.","agent":n:4073100000000000,"x":n:404256dbebdf4f2d,"y":n:404583cd84e42c69,"causes":[s:"agent:261",s:"agent:278",],},{"id":n:40b3a60000000000,"tick":n:40e2d4c000000000,"day":n:4099200000000000,"year":n:4070c00000000000,"type":s:"death","txt":s:"<b>Kare II</b> died of old age at 82. Much knowledge died with them — unless someone learned in time.","agent":n:406bc00000000000,"x":n:403163747ef71abb,"y":n:4039035138cffeda,"cause":s:"age","causes":[s:"cause:age",],},{"id":n:40b3a70000000000,"tick":n:40e2d6a000000000,"day":n:4099200000000000,"year":n:4070c00000000000,"type":s:"taught","txt":s:"<b>Alve II</b> taught <b>Vidar II</b> the secret of Rune II's the highway. The knowledge spreads.","tech":s:"road",},{"id":n:40b3a80000000000,"tick":n:40e2d6e000000000,"day":n:4099200000000000,"year":n:4070c00000000000,"type":s:"moved","txt":s:"<b>Bjorn II</b> moved into an abandoned hut.",},{"id":n:40b3a90000000000,"tick":n:40e2d70000000000,"day":n:4099200000000000,"year":n:4070c00000000000,"type":s:"child","txt":s:"👶 <b>Rune II</b> and <b>Selma II</b> have had a child, <b>Sten II</b> — generation 12. They inherit traits from both.","agent":n:4073200000000000,"x":n:4042f7de03a8c2a3,"y":n:4042fd8d6ac46d58,"causes":[s:"agent:250",s:"agent:265",],},{"id":n:40b3aa0000000000,"tick":n:40e2d7a000000000,"day":n:4099240000000000,"year":n:4070c00000000000,"type":s:"taught","txt":s:"<b>Halvar II</b> taught <b>Torv II</b> the secret of Eira's the tale. The knowledge spreads.","tech":s:"storytelling",},{"id":n:40b3ab0000000000,"tick":n:40e2d80000000000,"day":n:4099240000000000,"year":n:4070d00000000000,"type":s:"season","txt":s:"🌸 Spring returns. The survivors count each other, and begin again.",},{"id":n:40b3ac0000000000,"tick":n:40e2d80000000000,"day":n:4099240000000000,"year":n:4070d00000000000,"type":s:"quirk","txt":s:"🙂 <b>Saga II</b> counts the others every evening before sleep. It began the year Halvar II died. It has not stopped since.","agent":n:406f200000000000,"x":n:404b9b014b5f6dbd,"y":n:4048983a8cfe4836,},{"id":n:40b3ad0000000000,"tick":n:40e2d80000000000,"day":n:4099240000000000,"year":n:4070d00000000000,"type":s:"death","txt":s:"<b>Bjorn II</b> fell in the raid on Majaheim. Much knowledge died with them — unless someone learned in time.","agent":n:406f000000000000,"x":n:40449935d46f2605,"y":n:403dd0b4d85c5320,"cause":s:"violence","causes":[s:"cause:violence",s:"agent:240",s:"cause:war",],},{"id":n:40b3ae0000000000,"tick":n:40e2d80000000000,"day":n:4099240000000000,"year":n:4070d00000000000,"type":s:"legend","txt":s:"🕊️ Bjorn II is gone. But someone still always takes the long way home. No one asks why it began.","agent":n:406f000000000000,},{"id":n:40b3af0000000000,"tick":n:40e2d80000000000,"day":n:4099240000000000,"year":n:4070d00000000000,"type":s:"violence","txt":s:"🔥⚔️ Driven by a failing harvest, the people of <b>Runestead</b> fell upon <b>Majaheim</b> — a raid for grain and goods. 1 lay dead (0 of Majaheim, 1 of Runestead).","x":n:403e5a7031830b7a,"y":n:4043b7da751bb8dd,"label":s:"WAR","causes":[s:"cause:scarcity",],},{"id":n:40b3b00000000000,"tick":n:40e2d80000000000,"day":n:4099240000000000,"year":n:4070d00000000000,"type":s:"leader","txt":s:"👑 In <b>Runestead</b>, the people have begun to listen when <b>Selma II</b> speaks — prestige has hardened into leadership. No one voted; it is simply so.","village":s:"Runestead","agent":n:406d600000000000,"x":n:403e5a7031830b7a,"y":n:4043b7da751bb8dd,"label":s:"A LEADER IS RECOGNIZED","causes":[s:"agent:235",],},{"id":n:40b3b10000000000,"tick":n:40e2d80000000000,"day":n:4099240000000000,"year":n:4070d00000000000,"type":s:"epithet","txt":s:"✨ From that day on, <b>Selma II</b> was known as <b>Selma II the Voice of Runestead</b>.","agent":n:406d600000000000,"x":n:40424949c40c0153,"y":n:403fb1b98fc56e8e,},{"id":n:40b3b20000000000,"tick":n:40e2d80000000000,"day":n:4099240000000000,"year":n:4070d00000000000,"type":s:"rediscovered","txt":s:"💡 In <b>Frejaheim</b>, Eira's the tale is known again — a craft the village had lost returns to living hands.","tech":s:"storytelling","x":n:401694c57b07baee,"y":n:402e6c5a92f0d5d4,"village":s:"Frejaheim",},{"id":n:40b3b30000000000,"tick":n:40e2d80000000000,"day":n:4099240000000000,"year":n:4070d00000000000,"type":s:"rediscovered","txt":s:"💡 In <b>Frejaheim</b>, Eira's ember is known again — a craft the village had lost returns to living hands.","tech":s:"fire","x":n:401694c57b07baee,"y":n:402e6c5a92f0d5d4,"village":s:"Frejaheim",},{"id":n:40b3b40000000000,"tick":n:40e2d80000000000,"day":n:4099240000000000,"year":n:4070d00000000000,"type":s:"rediscovered","txt":s:"💡 In <b>Frejaheim</b>, Ask's urn is known again — a craft the village had lost returns to living hands.","tech":s:"pottery","x":n:401694c57b07baee,"y":n:402e6c5a92f0d5d4,"village":s:"Frejaheim",},{"id":n:40b3b50000000000,"tick":n:40e2d80000000000,"day":n:4099240000000000,"year":n:4070d00000000000,"type":s:"rediscovered","txt":s:"💡 In <b>Frejaheim</b>, Embla's braid is known again — a craft the village had lost returns to living hands.","tech":s:"rope","x":n:401694c57b07baee,"y":n:402e6c5a92f0d5d4,"village":s:"Frejaheim",},{"id":n:40b3b60000000000,"tick":n:40e2d80000000000,"day":n:4099240000000000,"year":n:4070d00000000000,"type":s:"rediscovered","txt":s:"💡 In <b>Frejaheim</b>, Ask's knife is known again — a craft the village had lost returns to living hands.","tech":s:"sharp","x":n:401694c57b07baee,"y":n:402e6c5a92f0d5d4,"village":s:"Frejaheim",},{"id":n:40b3b70000000000,"tick":n:40e2d80000000000,"day":n:4099240000000000,"year":n:4070d00000000000,"type":s:"rediscovered","txt":s:"💡 In <b>Frejaheim</b>, Ask's javelin is known again — a craft the village had lost returns to living hands.","tech":s:"spear","x":n:401694c57b07baee,"y":n:402e6c5a92f0d5d4,"village":