n 15. They inherit traits from both.","agent":n:4079800000000000,"x":n:4046954c044a7951,"y":n:40423be038a86c80,"causes":[s:"agent:352",s:"agent:305",],},{"id":n:40b8bb0000000000,"tick":n:40e669e000000000,"day":n:409de40000000000,"year":n:4073f00000000000,"type":s:"child","txt":s:"👶 <b>Bjorn II</b> and <b>Signe II</b> have had a child, <b>Ronja II</b> — generation 14. They inherit traits from both.","agent":n:4079900000000000,"x":n:4043984c94c936dd,"y":n:403a7f77859c5529,"causes":[s:"agent:308",s:"agent:315",],},{"id":n:40b8bc0000000000,"tick":n:40e66a8000000000,"day":n:409de80000000000,"year":n:4073f00000000000,"type":s:"season","txt":s:"❄️ Winter closes over the world. The stores will decide who sees spring.",},{"id":n:40b8bd0000000000,"tick":n:40e66ba000000000,"day":n:409de80000000000,"year":n:4073f00000000000,"type":s:"steal","txt":s:"🥀 Hunger owned the hand: <b>Eira II</b> wrenched food from <b>Bjorn II</b>.","agent":n:4074b00000000000,"victim":n:4075200000000000,"x":n:403f4b1a767fd26f,"y":n:404043b0a343ebf4,"cause":s:"desperation","causes":[s:"ev:6332",s:"agent:338",s:"cause:desperation",s:"cause:winter",],},{"id":n:40b8be0000000000,"tick":n:40e66ba000000000,"day":n:409de80000000000,"year":n:4073f00000000000,"type":s:"taught","txt":s:"<b>Vidar II</b> taught <b>Ylva II</b> the secret of Ask's urn. The knowledge spreads.","tech":s:"pottery",},{"id":n:40b8bf0000000000,"tick":n:40e66c4000000000,"day":n:409de80000000000,"year":n:4073f00000000000,"type":s:"taught","txt":s:"<b>Idun II</b> taught <b>Orm II</b> the secret of Ask's javelin. The knowledge spreads.","tech":s:"spear",},{"id":n:40b8c00000000000,"tick":n:40e66d0000000000,"day":n:409de80000000000,"year":n:4073f00000000000,"type":s:"death","txt":s:"<b>Embla II</b> died of old age at 75. Much knowledge died with them — unless someone learned in time.","agent":n:4071100000000000,"x":n:4040d37fd6609690,"y":n:403d78aaf819bd79,"cause":s:"age","causes":[s:"cause:age",],},{"id":n:40b8c10000000000,"tick":n:40e66d0000000000,"day":n:409de80000000000,"year":n:4073f00000000000,"type":s:"customBack","txt":s:"🌱 <b>Tuva II</b> has revived Burning a twig at the grave — an old way returns.","custom":s:"c22",},{"id":n:40b8c20000000000,"tick":n:40e66d0000000000,"day":n:409de80000000000,"year":n:4073f00000000000,"type":s:"moved","txt":s:"<b>Alve II</b> moved into an abandoned hut.",},{"id":n:40b8c30000000000,"tick":n:40e66d0000000000,"day":n:409de80000000000,"year":n:4073f00000000000,"type":s:"customLost","txt":s:"🍂 Rune II burning a twig at the newborn's doorstep until the end. No one else ever took it up. It died quietly, as most things do.","custom":s:"c44",},{"id":n:40b8c40000000000,"tick":n:40e66e0000000000,"day":n:409dec0000000000,"year":n:4074000000000000,"type":s:"season","txt":s:"🌸 Spring returns. The survivors count each other, and begin again.",},{"id":n:40b8c50000000000,"tick":n:40e66e0000000000,"day":n:409dec0000000000,"year":n:4074000000000000,"type":s:"journey","txt":s:"🚶 <b>Ylva II</b> set out for Majaheim. Ideas travel on foot.","agent":n:4075100000000000,"x":n:4041349bdf289d35,"y":n:4041f70acc034735,},{"id":n:40b8c60000000000,"tick":n:40e66e0000000000,"day":n:409dec0000000000,"year":n:4074000000000000,"type":s:"quirk","txt":s:"🙂 <b>Liv II</b> stops at the same strange stone every day, and looks at it. Once begun, never stopped.","agent":n:4074f00000000000,"x":n:4047bd21458bd68a,"y":n:4043a774d0c9c4f6,},{"id":n:40b8c70000000000,"tick":n:40e66e0000000000,"day":n:409dec0000000000,"year":n:4074000000000000,"type":s:"quirk","txt":s:"🙂 <b>Otto II</b> picks a flower every spring and puts it somewhere no one sees. As Idun II did before them. No one decided this.","agent":n:4076200000000000,"x":n:404258384111b620,"y":n:4042d1d9982eee41,},{"id":n:40b8c80000000000,"tick":n:40e66e0000000000,"day":n:409dec0000000000,"year":n:4074000000000000,"type":s:"death","txt":s:"<b>Idun II</b> was taken by the fever that walks where many live close. Much knowledge died with them — unless someone learned in time.","agent":n:4073900000000000,"x":n:4043ef7305256f90,"y":n:4040ce497984cd56,"cause":s:"sickness","causes":[s:"cause:sickness",],},{"id":n:40b8c90000000000,"tick":n:40e66e0000000000,"day":n:409dec0000000000,"year":n:4074000000000000,"type":s:"legend","txt":s:"🕊️ Idun II is gone. But someone still leaves a flower where no one sees. No one asks why it began.","agent":n:4073900000000000,},{"id":n:40b8ca0000000000,"tick":n:40e66e0000000000,"day":n:409dec0000000000,"year":n:4074000000000000,"type":s:"death","txt":s:"<b>Sixten II</b> was taken by the fever that walks where many live close. Much knowledge died with them — unless someone learned in time.","agent":n:4077c00000000000,"x":n:40401bb74019bae9,"y":n:4040871ee4091931,"cause":s:"sickness","causes":[s:"cause:sickness",],},{"id":n:40b8cb0000000000,"tick":n:40e66e2000000000,"day":n:409dec0000000000,"year":n:4074000000000000,"type":s:"moved","txt":s:"<b>Ronja II</b> moved into an abandoned hut.",},{"id":n:40b8cc0000000000,"tick":n:40e66e6000000000,"day":n:409dec0000000000,"year":n:4074000000000000,"type":s:"taught","txt":s:"<b>Ulv II</b> taught <b>Tuva II</b> the secret of Embla II's the lesson. The knowledge spreads.","tech":s:"school",},{"id":n:40b8cd0000000000,"tick":n:40e671c000000000,"day":n:409df00000000000,"year":n:4074000000000000,"type":s:"taught","txt":s:"<b>Tuva II</b> taught <b>Otto II</b> the secret of Ask's the sail. The knowledge spreads.","tech":s:"sailing",},{"id":n:40b8ce0000000000,"tick":n:40e671c000000000,"day":n:409df00000000000,"year":n:4074000000000000,"type":s:"taught","txt":s:"<b>Torv II</b> taught <b>Ylva II</b> the secret of Ask's lenswork. The knowledge spreads.","tech":s:"glass",},{"id":n:40b8cf0000000000,"tick":n:40e6720000000000,"day":n:409df00000000000,"year":n:4074000000000000,"type":s:"taught","txt":s:"<b>Rune II</b> taught <b>Maja II</b> the secret of Embla's mudbrick. The knowledge spreads.","tech":s:"brick",},{"id":n:40b8d00000000000,"tick":n:40e6726000000000,"day":n:409df00000000000,"year":n:4074000000000000,"type":s:"taught","txt":s:"<b>Halvar II</b> taught <b>Sten II</b> the secret of Embla II's the lesson. The knowledge spreads.","tech":s:"school",},{"id":n:40b8d10000000000,"tick":n:40e672e000000000,"day":n:409df00000000000,"year":n:4074000000000000,"type":s:"hoard","txt":s:"🏺 <b>Ronja II</b> has begun laying up stores beyond any need. The pile grows — and eyes have begun to follow it.","agent":n:4075d00000000000,"x":n:40414ec8f3e26da3,"y":n:403d99a958837f36,"causes":[s:"agent:349",],},{"id":n:40b8d20000000000,"tick":n:40e6730000000000,"day":n:409df00000000000,"year":n:4074000000000000,"type":s:"child","txt":s:"👶 <b>Saga II</b> and <b>Halvar II</b> have had a child, <b>Sixten II</b> — generation 14. They inherit traits from both.","agent":n:4079a00000000000,"x":n:403cf23e7b5371f5,"y":n:4040c7b5bd2c53f2,"causes":[s:"agent:309",s:"agent:314",],},{"id":n:40b8d30000000000,"tick":n:40e6736000000000,"day":n:409df40000000000,"year":n:4074000000000000,"type":s:"star","txt":s:"✨ <b>Embla II</b> lay awake in the dark and watched the lights that do not fall.","agent":n:4076b00000000000,"x":n:404a8095975795b6,"y":n:404361246ff7167d,},{"id":n:40b8d40000000000,"tick":n:40e6738000000000,"day":n:409df40000000000,"year":n:4074000000000000,"type":s:"star","txt":s:"✨ <b>Torv II</b> lay awake in the dark and watched the lights that do not fall.","agent":n:4076c00000000000,"x":n:40444817cab42b02,"y":n:403d18f4453108ae,},{"id":n:40b8d50000000000,"tick":n:40e6738000000000,"day":n:409df40000000000,"year":n:4074000000000000,"type":s:"taught","txt":s:"<b>Ronja II</b> taught <b>Orm II</b> the secret of Embla II's reasoned thought. The knowledge spreads.","tech":s:"philosophy",},{"id":n:40b8d60000000000,"tick":n:40e675c000000000,"day":n:409df40000000000,"year":n:4074000000000000,"type":s:"child","txt":s:"👶 <b>Embla II</b> and <b>Torv II</b> have had a child, <b>Maja II</b> — generation 15. They inherit traits from both.","agent":n:4079b00000000000,"x":n:4