ype":s:"star","txt":s:"✨ <b>Sten II</b> lay awake in the dark and watched the lights that do not fall.","agent":n:4076e00000000000,"x":n:40455aa3c759bcf3,"y":n:403e95de0f161785,},{"id":n:40b8df0000000000,"tick":n:40e67c8000000000,"day":n:409e000000000000,"year":n:4074000000000000,"type":s:"season","txt":s:"❄️ Winter closes over the world. The stores will decide who sees spring.",},{"id":n:40b8e00000000000,"tick":n:40e67ca000000000,"day":n:409e000000000000,"year":n:4074000000000000,"type":s:"taught","txt":s:"<b>Tuva II</b> taught <b>Rune II</b> the secret of Ask's fishing line. The knowledge spreads.","tech":s:"fishing",},{"id":n:40b8e10000000000,"tick":n:40e67ec000000000,"day":n:409e000000000000,"year":n:4074000000000000,"type":s:"star","txt":s:"📜✨ <b>Orm II</b> pressed the pattern of the stars into clay — the first star-marks. Now the sky can be remembered.","agent":n:4076800000000000,},{"id":n:40b8e20000000000,"tick":n:40e67f8000000000,"day":n:409e040000000000,"year":n:4074000000000000,"type":s:"death","txt":s:"<b>Nanna II</b> died of old age at 55. Much knowledge died with them — unless someone learned in time.","agent":n:4072900000000000,"x":n:40440d56580772ca,"y":n:40414bff265e96a3,"cause":s:"age","causes":[s:"cause:age",],},{"id":n:40b8e30000000000,"tick":n:40e67f8000000000,"day":n:409e040000000000,"year":n:4074000000000000,"type":s:"moved","txt":s:"<b>Otto II</b> moved into an abandoned hut.",},{"id":n:40b8e40000000000,"tick":n:40e67fc000000000,"day":n:409e040000000000,"year":n:4074000000000000,"type":s:"imitated","txt":s:"<b>Nanna II</b> has begun humming together as the sun rises, the way Selma II does. The custom spreads.","custom":s:"c45",},{"id":n:40b8e50000000000,"tick":n:40e6800000000000,"day":n:409e040000000000,"year":n:4074100000000000,"type":s:"taught","txt":s:"<b>Sixten II</b> taught <b>Eira II</b> the secret of Ask's roller. The knowledge spreads.","tech":s:"wheel",},{"id":n:40b8e60000000000,"tick":n:40e6800000000000,"day":n:409e040000000000,"year":n:4074100000000000,"type":s:"season","txt":s:"🌸 Spring returns. The survivors count each other, and begin again.",},{"id":n:40b8e70000000000,"tick":n:40e6800000000000,"day":n:409e040000000000,"year":n:4074100000000000,"type":s:"tribute","txt":s:"🧺 In <b>Runestead</b>, 15 households laid a share at <b>Orm II the Voice of Runestead</b>'s door. So surplus flows upward, and standing becomes wealth.","village":s:"Runestead","agent":n:4070e00000000000,"x":n:403e5a7031830b7a,"y":n:4043b7da751bb8dd,"causes":[s:"agent:270",s:"ev:5775",],},{"id":n:40b8e80000000000,"tick":n:40e6802000000000,"day":n:409e040000000000,"year":n:4074100000000000,"type":s:"hunt","txt":s:"🎣 <b>Selma II</b> pulled silver from the water.","agent":n:4072700000000000,"x":n:403de86233759b62,"y":n:403d31c9ed2f220c,},{"id":n:40b8e90000000000,"tick":n:40e6806000000000,"day":n:409e040000000000,"year":n:4074100000000000,"type":s:"taught","txt":s:"<b>Halvar II</b> taught <b>Kare II</b> the secret of Ask's hearth. The knowledge spreads.","tech":s:"kiln",},{"id":n:40b8ea0000000000,"tick":n:40e6808000000000,"day":n:409e040000000000,"year":n:4074100000000000,"type":s:"taught","txt":s:"<b>Signe II</b> taught <b>Ask II</b> the secret of Ask's fishing line. The knowledge spreads.","tech":s:"fishing",},{"id":n:40b8eb0000000000,"tick":n:40e681c000000000,"day":n:409e040000000000,"year":n:4074100000000000,"type":s:"child","txt":s:"👶 <b>Rune II</b> and <b>Vidar II</b> have had a child, <b>Loke II</b> — generation 15. They inherit traits from both.","agent":n:4079c00000000000,"x":n:4042b8c5c4dce38a,"y":n:403f89f09d0d8711,"causes":[s:"agent:340",s:"agent:316",],},{"id":n:40b8ec0000000000,"tick":n:40e681e000000000,"day":n:409e040000000000,"year":n:4074100000000000,"type":s:"star","txt":s:"✨ <b>Eira II</b> watches the stars again, night after night. Something is taking shape.","agent":n:4076900000000000,},{"id":n:40b8ed0000000000,"tick":n:40e6820000000000,"day":n:409e040000000000,"year":n:4074100000000000,"type":s:"child","txt":s:"👶 <b>Otto II</b> and <b>Vera II</b> have had a child, <b>Vera II</b> — generation 14. They inherit traits from both.","agent":n:4079d00000000000,"x":n:404e49a3749adfea,"y":n:4041f6bb312b237b,"causes":[s:"agent:324",s:"agent:323",],},{"id":n:40b8ee0000000000,"tick":n:40e6820000000000,"day":n:409e040000000000,"year":n:4074100000000000,"type":s:"star","txt":s:"🌌 Under the Watchers, the people gather in the dark and turn their faces to the stars.","agent":n:4074e00000000000,"x":n:403e539a25d32c96,"y":n:40407c1354f90d02,},{"id":n:40b8ef0000000000,"tick":n:40e682c000000000,"day":n:409e080000000000,"year":n:4074100000000000,"type":s:"custom","txt":s:"🌿 <b>Orm II</b> began singing by the water as the light fades — no one told them to. Others may follow. <i>(Singing by the water at dusk)</i>","custom":s:"c46","agent":n:4076800000000000,"x":n:404bcbbe7360d3c0,"y":n:4043cbfe87fc13cf,"label":s:"A CUSTOM APPEARS",},{"id":n:40b8f00000000000,"tick":n:40e682c000000000,"day":n:409e080000000000,"year":n:4074100000000000,"type":s:"mutation","txt":s:"🧬 <b>Orm II</b> does it differently: singing by the water as the light fades instead of humming together as the sun rises. A tradition drifts.","custom":s:"c46",},{"id":n:40b8f10000000000,"tick":n:40e682e000000000,"day":n:409e080000000000,"year":n:4074100000000000,"type":s:"sharing","txt":s:"🍞 <b>Loke II</b> shared food with <b>Selma II</b> — The Full Bowl Custom holds. Those who keep the same ways do not let each other starve.","x":n:4040d0c72c9fff72,"y":n:403bae2a3a3fad5e,"agent":n:4077e00000000000,"causes":[s:"agent:382",s:"agent:385",],},{"id":n:40b8f20000000000,"tick":n:40e684e000000000,"day":n:409e080000000000,"year":n:4074100000000000,"type":s:"child","txt":s:"👶 <b>Orm II</b> and <b>Loke II</b> have had a child, <b>Otto II</b> — generation 14. They inherit traits from both.","agent":n:4079e00000000000,"x":n:404d566ecdb38af5,"y":n:40420f938c18912c,"causes":[s:"agent:330",s:"agent:322",],},{"id":n:40b8f30000000000,"tick":n:40e6