0000000,"year":n:4074200000000000,"type":s:"customBack","txt":s:"🌱 <b>Ronja II</b> has revived Telling stories by the water at dusk — an old way returns.","custom":s:"c24",},{"id":n:40b9360000000000,"tick":n:40e69d0000000000,"day":n:409e280000000000,"year":n:4074200000000000,"type":s:"mutation","txt":s:"🧬 <b>Ronja II</b> does it differently: telling stories by the water as the light fades instead of humming together as the sun rises. A tradition drifts.","custom":s:"c24",},{"id":n:40b9370000000000,"tick":n:40e69e6000000000,"day":n:409e2c0000000000,"year":n:4074200000000000,"type":s:"child","txt":s:"👶 <b>Ask II</b> and <b>Nanna II</b> have had a child, <b>Orm II</b> — generation 15. They inherit traits from both.","agent":n:407a400000000000,"x":n:404cef134bfc2528,"y":n:4040f394c79ec661,"causes":[s:"agent:332",s:"agent:327",],},{"id":n:40b9380000000000,"tick":n:40e69fc000000000,"day":n:409e2c0000000000,"year":n:4074200000000000,"type":s:"field","txt":s:"🌾 <b>Selma II</b> brings in the harvest from Selma II's field. Winter holds less fear now.","agent":n:4072700000000000,"x":n:403e000000000000,"y":n:4039000000000000,},{"id":n:40b9390000000000,"tick":n:40e69fc000000000,"day":n:409e2c0000000000,"year":n:4074200000000000,"type":s:"taught","txt":s:"<b>Otto II</b> taught <b>Liv II</b> the secret of Ask's javelin. The knowledge spreads.","tech":s:"spear",},{"id":n:40b93a0000000000,"tick":n:40e69fc000000000,"day":n:409e2c0000000000,"year":n:4074200000000000,"type":s:"taught","txt":s:"<b>Nanna II</b> taught <b>Rune II</b> the secret of Embla's the loom. The knowledge spreads.","tech":s:"weaving",},{"id":n:40b93b0000000000,"tick":n:40e69fc000000000,"day":n:409e2c0000000000,"year":n:4074200000000000,"type":s:"field","txt":s:"🌾 <b>Ylva II</b> brings in the harvest from Ylva II's field. Winter holds less fear now.","agent":n:4075100000000000,"x":n:4043800000000000,"y":n:403b000000000000,},{"id":n:40b93c0000000000,"tick":n:40e6a06000000000,"day":n:409e300000000000,"year":n:40742000