0000,"tick":n:40e6d68000000000,"day":n:409e780000000000,"year":n:4074500000000000,"type":s:"season","txt":s:"❄️ Winter closes over the world. The stores will decide who sees spring.",},{"id":n:40b9c00000000000,"tick":n:40e6d6a000000000,"day":n:409e780000000000,"year":n:4074500000000000,"type":s:"star","txt":s:"✨ <b>Selma II</b> watches the stars again, night after night. Something is taking shape.","agent":n:4078100000000000,},{"id":n:40b9c10000000000,"tick":n:40e6d6e000000000,"day":n:409e780000000000,"year":n:4074500000000000,"type":s:"tabooBroken","txt":s:"⚡ <b>Freja II</b> has broken The Ban of the Living Trees — gathering wood to survive. Guilt follows; so may division.","custom":s:"c32","agent":n:4075500000000000,"x":n:4040092ff23e2672,"y":n:4041d3059fe2f813,},{"id":n:40b9c20000000000,"tick":n:40e6d6e000000000,"day":n:409e780000000000,"year":n:4074500000000000,"type":s:"epithet","txt":s:"✨ From that day on, <b>Freja II</b> was known as <b>Freja II the Oathbreaker</b>.","agent":n:4075500000000000,"x":n:4040092ff23e2672,"y":n:4041d3059fe2f813,},{"id":n:40b9c30000000000,"tick":n:40e6d6e000000000,"day":n:409e780000000000,"year":n:4074500000000000,"type":s:"hut","txt":s:"🛖 <b>Freja II</b> built a hut.","x":n:4040092ff23e2672,"y":n:4041d3059fe2f813,},{"id":n:40b9c40000000000,"tick":n:40e6d7a000000000,"day":n:409e780000000000,"year":n:4074500000000000,"type":s:"failed","txt":s:"<b>Kare II</b> tried something with stone and clay — and failed. But failure teaches.","agent":n:4077400000000000,},{"id":n:40b9c50000000000,"tick":n:40e6d88000000000,"day":n:409e780000000000,"year":n:4074500000000000,"type":s:"taught","txt":s:"<b>Otto II</b> taught <b>Orm II</b> the secret of Ask's the healer. The knowledge spreads.","tech":s:"medicine",},{"id":n:40b9c60000000000,"tick":n:40e6d8c000000000,"day":n:409e780000000000,"year":n:4074500000000000,"type":s:"star","txt":s:"✨ <b>Otto II</b> watches the stars again, night after night. Something is taking shape.","agent":n:4078000000000000,},{"id":n:40b9c70000000000,"tick":n:40e6d96000000000,"day":n:409e7c0000000000,"year":n:4074500000000000,"type":s:"child","txt":s:"👶 <b>Vera II</b> and <b>Orm II</b> have had a child, <b>Idun II</b> — generation 14. They inherit traits from both.","agent":n:407b100000000000,"x":n:404e9698bf073a6a,"y":n:40403fcfcb6a1169,"causes":[s:"agent:323",s:"agent:330",],},{"id":n:40b9c80000000000,"tick":n:40e6da0000000000,"day":n:409e7c0000000000,"year":n:4074600000000000,"type":s:"season","txt":s:"🌸 Spring returns. The survivors count each other, and begin again.",},{"id":n:40b9c90000000000,"tick":n:40e6da0000000000,"day":n:409e7c0000000000,"year":n:4074600000000000,"type":s:"journey","txt":s:"🚶 <b>Bjorn II</b> set out for Frejaheim. Ideas travel on foot.","agent":n:4075200000000000,"x":n:403e3a55ba49cfef,"y":n:403da8e378fa74bb,},{"id":n:40b9ca0000000000,"tick":n:40e6da0000000000,"day":n:409e7c0000000000,"year":n:4074600000000000,"type":s:"quirk","txt":s:"🙂 <b>Maja II</b> whistles every morning, whether the morning deserves it or not. Once begun, never stopped.","agent":n:4075f00000000000,"x":n:4046ccc32429a493,"y":n:40414b8a32384a9e,},{"id":n:40b9cb0000000000,"tick":n:40e6da0000000000,"day":n:409e7c0000000000,"year":n:4074600000000000,"type":s:"tradition","txt":s:"🏘️ In Runestead, humming together as the sun rises is now simply what one does. <b>Humming at Dawn</b> has become a tradition.","custom":s:"c45","x":n:403e5a7031830b7a,"y":n:4043b7da751bb8dd,},{"id":n:40b9cc0000000000,"tick":n:40e6da0000000000,"day":n:409e7c0000000000,"year":n:4074600000000000,"type":s:"leader","txt":s:"👑 In <b>Ronjastead</b>, the people have begun to listen when <b>Kare II</b> speaks — prestige has hardened into leadership. No one voted; it is simply so.","village":s:"Ronjastead","agent":n:4071a00000000000,"x":n:4049e9c4e613f49e,"y":n:404206087fe9cc35,"label":s:"A LEADER IS RECOGNIZED","causes":[s:"agent:282",],},{"id":n:40b9cd0000000000,"tick":n:40e6da0000000000,"day":n:409e7c0000000000,"year":n:4074600000000000,"type":s:"epithet","txt":s:"✨ From that day on, <b>Kare II</b> was known as <b>Kare II the Voice of Ronjastead</b>.","agent":n:4071a00000000000,"x":n:404936047571ec29,"y":n:4046e4a48e72f950,},{"id":n:40b9ce0000000000,"tick":n:40e6da0000000000,"day":n:409e7c0000000000,"year":n:4074600000000000,"type":s:"tribute","txt":s:"🧺 In <b>Ronjastead</b>, 16 households laid a share at <b>Kare II the Voice of Ronjastead</b>'s door. So surplus flows upward, and standing becomes wealth.","village":s:"Ronjastead","agent":n:4071a00000000000,"x":n:4049e9c4e613f49e,"y":n:404206087fe9cc35,"causes":[s:"agent:282",s:"ev:6604",],},{"id":n:40b9cf0000000000,"tick":n:40e6da0000000000,"day":n:409e7c0000000000,"year":n:4074600000000000,"type":s:"rediscovered","txt":s:"💡 In <b>Frejaheim</b>, Eira's millhouse is known again — a craft the village had lost returns to living hands.","tech":s:"mill","x":n:401694c57b07baee,"y":n:402e6c5a92f0d5d4,"village":s:"Frejaheim",},{"id":n:40b9d00000000000,"tick":n:40e6da0000000000,"day":n:409e7c0000000000,"year":n:4074600000000000,"type":s:"rediscovered","txt":s:"💡 In <b>Frejaheim</b>, Embla's mudbrick is known again — a craft the village had lost returns to living hands.","tech":s:"brick","x":n:401694c57b07baee,"y":n:402e6c5a92f0d5d4,"village":s:"Frejaheim",},{"id":n:40b9d10000000000,"tick":n:40e6da0000000000,"day":n:409e7c0000000000,"year":n:4074600000000000,"type":s:"rediscovered","txt":s:"💡 In <b>Frejaheim</b>, Eira's the tale is known again — a craft the village had lost returns to living hands.","tech":s:"storytelling","x":n:401694c57b07baee,"y":n:402e6c5a92f0d5d4,"village":s:"Frejaheim",},{"id":n:40b9d20000000000,"tick":n:40e6da0000000000,"day":n:409e7c0000000000,"year":n:4074600000000000,"type":s:"rediscovered","txt":s:"💡 In <b>Frejaheim</b>, Eira's ember is known again — a craft the village had lost returns to living hands.","tech":s:"fire","x":n:401694c57b07baee,"y":n:402e6c5a92f0d5d4,"village":s:"Frejaheim",},{"id":n:40b9d30000000000