 II</b> and <b>Sten II</b> have had a child, <b>Signe II</b> — generation 15. They inherit traits from both.","agent":n:407b300000000000,"x":n:4046c65eaba35d4e,"y":n:40408c269ccb623d,"causes":[s:"agent:351",s:"agent:366",],},{"id":n:40b9fc0000000000,"tick":n:40e6e88000000000,"day":n:409e900000000000,"year":n:4074600000000000,"type":s:"child","txt":s:"👶 <b>Falk II</b> and <b>Disa II</b> have had a child, <b>Vidar II</b> — generation 15. They inherit traits from both.","agent":n:407b400000000000,"x":n:4050d99aa71f06e6,"y":n:404245572d3e6c1c,"causes":[s:"agent:356",s:"agent:329",],},{"id":n:40b9fd0000000000,"tick":n:40e6e88000000000,"day":n:409e900000000000,"year":n:4074600000000000,"type":s:"taught","txt":s:"<b>Sixten II</b> taught <b>Eira II</b> the secret of Eira's ember. The knowledge spreads.","tech":s:"fire",},{"id":n:40b9fe0000000000,"tick":n:40e6e88000000000,"day":n:409e900000000000,"year":n:4074600000000000,"type":s:"season","txt":s:"❄️ Winter closes over the world. The stores will decide who sees spring.",},{"id":n:40b9ff0000000000,"tick":n:40e6e92000000000,"day":n:409e900000000000,"year":n:4074600000000000,"type":s:"taught","txt":s:"<b>Ylva II</b> taught <b>Orm II</b> the secret of Ask's melody. The knowledge spreads.","tech":s:"song",},{"id":n:40ba000000000000,"tick":n:40e6e94000000000,"day":n:409e900000000000,"year":n:4074600000000000,"type":s:"taught","txt":s:"<b>Sten II</b> taught <b>Embla II</b> the secret of Eira's ember. The knowledge spreads.","tech":s:"fire",},{"id":n:40ba010000000000,"tick":n:40e6ea0000000000,"day":n:409e900000000000,"year":n:4074600000000000,"type":s:"taught","txt":s:"<b>Freja II</b> taught <b>Disa II</b> the secret of Ask's fishing line. The knowledge spreads.","tech":s:"fishing",},{"id":n:40ba020000000000,"tick":n:40e6eae000000000,"day":n:409e900000000000,"year":n:4074600000000000,"type":s:"child","txt":s:"👶 <b>Falk II</b> and <b>Kare II</b> have had a child, <b>Tuva II</b> — generation 14. They inherit traits from both.","agent