409f380000000000,"year":n:4074d00000000000,"type":s:"season","txt":s:"❄️ Winter closes over the world. The stores will decide who sees spring.",},{"id":n:40bbc70000000000,"tick":n:40e766a000000000,"day":n:409f380000000000,"year":n:4074d00000000000,"type":s:"tabooBroken","txt":s:"⚡ <b>Signe II</b> has broken The Ban of the Living Trees — gathering wood to survive. Guilt follows; so may division.","custom":s:"c32","agent":n:4075900000000000,"x":n:40495989f03061c3,"y":n:4046c4b8646f3960,},{"id":n:40bbc80000000000,"tick":n:40e766a000000000,"day":n:409f380000000000,"year":n:4074d00000000000,"type":s:"epithet","txt":s:"✨ From that day on, <b>Signe II</b> was known as <b>Signe II the Oathbreaker</b>.","agent":n:4075900000000000,"x":n:40495989f03061c3,"y":n:4046c4b8646f3960,},{"id":n:40bbc90000000000,"tick":n:40e766a000000000,"day":n:409f380000000000,"year":n:4074d00000000000,"type":s:"rebel","txt":s:"<b>Signe II</b> no longer keeps The Ban of the Living Trees. A rebel — or the first of a new way.","custom":s:"c32",},{"id":n:40bbca0000000000,"tick":n:40e766a000000000,"day":n:409f380000000000,"year":n:4074d00000000000,"type":s:"hut","txt":s:"🛖 <b>Signe II</b> built a hut.","x":n:40495989f03061c3,"y":n:4046c4b8646f3960,},{"id":n:40bbcb0000000000,"tick":n:40e766a000000000,"day":n:409f380000000000,"year":n:4074d00000000000,"type":s:"observed","txt":s:"👁️ <b>Signe II</b> noticed that fish gather in the shallows. An idea begins to form.","obs":s:"fishGather","agent":n:407d100000000000,"x":n:4043055015552370,"y":n:4040cfc3bd47d19d,},{"id":n:40bbcc0000000000,"tick":n:40e766c000000000,"day":n:409f380000000000,"year":n:4074d00000000000,"type":s:"taught","txt":s:"<b>Vidar II</b> taught <b>Nanna II</b> the secret of Ask's hearth. The knowledge spreads.","tech":s:"kiln",},{"id":n:40bbcd0000000000,"tick":n:40e7678000000000,"day":n:409f380000000000,"year":n:4074d00000000000,"type":s:"taught","txt":s:"<b>Loke II</b> taught <b>Halvar II</b> the secret of Ask's urn. The knowledge spreads.","tech":s:"pottery",},{"id":n:40bbce0000000000,"tick":n:40e7688000000000,"day":n:409f380000000000,"year":n:4074d00000000000,"type":s:"taught","txt":s:"<b>Sten II</b> taught <b>Sixten II</b> the secret of Ask II's written music. The knowledge spreads.","tech":s:"composition",},{"id":n:40bbcf0000000000,"tick":n:40e768e000000000,"day":n:409f380000000000,"year":n:4074d00000000000,"type":s:"child","txt":s:"👶 <b>Ylva II</b> and <b>Loke II</b> have had a child, <b>Maja II</b> — generation 16. They inherit traits from both.","agent":n:407d700000000000,"x":n:404347ffb01ecf91,"y":n:403a8b89a88866ca,"causes":[s:"agent:397",s:"agent:322",],},{"id":n:40bbd00000000000,"tick":n:40e7690000000000,"day":n:409f380000000000,"year":n:4074d00000000000,"type":s:"star","txt":s:"🌌 Under the Watchers, the people gather in the dark and turn their faces to the stars.","agent":n:4075500000000000,"x":n:40426ce369fa4a7a,"y":n:40403c9b0c67a448,},{"id":n:40bbd10000000000,"tick":n:40e7694000000000,"day":n:409f3c0000000000,"year":n:4074d00000000000,"type":s:"star","txt":s:"✨ <b>Maja II</b> watches the stars again, night after night. Something is taking shape.","agent":n:4079b00000000000,},{"id":n:40bbd20000000000,"tick":n:40e7694000000000,"day":n:409f3c0000000000,"year":n:4074d00000000000,"type":s:"star","txt":s:"✨ <b>Vera II</b> watches the stars again, night after night. Something is taking shape.","agent":n:4079d00000000000,},{"id":n:40bbd30000000000,"tick":n:40e7696000000000,"day":n:409f3c0000000000,"year":n:4074d00000000000,"type":s:"taught","txt":s:"<b>Eira II</b> taught <b>Ulv II</b> the secret of Ask's urn. The knowledge spreads.","tech":s:"pottery",},{"id":n:40bbd40000000000,"tick":n:40e7698000000000,"day":n:409f3c0000000000,"year":n:4074d00000000000,"type":s:"taught","txt":s:"<b>Ask II</b> taught <b>Idun II</b> the secret of Embla's mudbrick. The knowledge spreads.","tech":s:"brick",},{"id":n:40bbd50000000000,"tick":n:40e76a0000000000,"day":n:409f3c0000000000,"year":n:4074e00000000000,"type":s:"journey","txt":s:"🚶 <b>Freja II</b> set out for Runestead. Ideas travel on foot.","agent":n:4077300000000000,"x":n:404113663f19c96a,"y":n:403b18d9a77bbd03,},{"id":n:40bbd60000000000,"tick":n:40e76a0000000000,"day":n:409f3c0000000000,"year":n:4074e00000000000,"type":s:"quirk","txt":s:"🙂 <b>Freja II</b> carries a stick everywhere. It is never used for anything. Once begun, never stopped.","agent":n:4075500000000000,"x":n:40429e9c7021e414,"y":n:4040a094cf893de1,},{"id":n:40bbd70000000000,"tick":n:40e76a0000000000,"day":n:409f3c0000000000,"year":n:4074e00000000000,"type":s:"quirk","txt":s:"🙂 <b>Nanna II</b> has started humming at first light. Once begun, never stopped.","agent":n:4076500000000000,"x":n:404ba2559dc773e3,"y":n:403a1d4d551ac48a,},{"id":n:40bbd80000000000,"tick":n:40e76a0000000000,"day":n:409f3c0000000000,"year":n:4074e00000000000,"type":s:"tradition","txt":s:"🏘️ In Runestead, carrying a stick one never uses is now simply what one does. <b>The Carried Stick</b> has become a tradition.","custom":s:"c48","x":n:403e5a7031830b7a,"y":n:4043b7da751bb8dd,},{"id":n:40bbd90000000000,"tick":n:40e76a0000000000,"day":n:409f3c0000000000,"year":n:4074e00000000000,"type":s:"knowledgeLost","txt":s:"🕯️ In <b>Frejaheim</b>, Eira's the tale is lost — the land cannot feed the craft, or the last who knew it is gone. Until it is brought back or rediscovered.","tech":s:"storytelling","x":n:401694c57b07baee,"y":n:402e6c5a92f0d5d4,"village":s:"Frejaheim",},{"id":n:40bbda0000000000,"tick":n:40e76a0000000000,"day":n:409f3c0000000000,"year":n:4074e00000000000,"type":s:"knowledgeLost","txt":s:"🕯️ In <b>Frejaheim</b>, Eira's ember is lost — the land cannot feed the craft, or the last who knew it is gone. Until it is brought back or rediscovered.","tech":s:"fire","x":n:401694c57b07baee,"y":n:402e6c5a92f0d5d4,"village":s:"Frejaheim",},{"id":n:40bbdb0000000000,"tick":n:40e76a0000000000,"day":n:409f3c0000000000,"year":n:4074e00000000000,"type":s:"knowledgeLost","txt":s:"🕯️ In <b>Frejahei