. Winter holds less fear now.","agent":n:4075900000000000,"x":n:4049000000000000,"y":n:404c800000000000,},{"id":n:40bd6d0000000000,"tick":n:40e7f48000000000,"day":n:409ff40000000000,"year":n:4075500000000000,"type":s:"field","txt":s:"🌾 <b>Ask II</b> brings in the harvest from Ask II's field. Winter holds less fear now.","agent":n:4074c00000000000,"x":n:4044000000000000,"y":n:403b000000000000,},{"id":n:40bd6e0000000000,"tick":n:40e7f48000000000,"day":n:409ff40000000000,"year":n:4075500000000000,"type":s:"field","txt":s:"🌾 <b>Kare II</b> brings in the harvest from Kare II's field. Winter holds less fear now.","agent":n:4075600000000000,"x":n:4044000000000000,"y":n:403a000000000000,},{"id":n:40bd6f0000000000,"tick":n:40e7f48000000000,"day":n:409ff40000000000,"year":n:4075500000000000,"type":s:"customBack","txt":s:"🌱 <b>Vidar II</b> has revived Placing a stone on the fallen prey — an old way returns.","custom":s:"c14",},{"id":n:40bd700000000000,"tick":n:40e7f5e000000000,"day":n:409ff40000000000,"year":n:4075500000000000,"type":s:"observed","txt":s:"👁️ <b>Halvar II</b> noticed that grass fibers hold when twisted. An idea begins to form.","obs":s:"fibersTwist","agent":n:407d000000000000,"x":n:404ba5bf605d4177,"y":n:4043d754df84da71,},{"id":n:40bd710000000000,"tick":n:40e7f62000000000,"day":n:409ff40000000000,"year":n:4075500000000000,"type":s:"star","txt":s:"✨ <b>Eira II</b> lay awake in the dark and watched the lights that do not fall.","agent":n:407c300000000000,"x":n:4044a9347f5a811b,"y":n:4041e0baf3116d94,},{"id":n:40bd720000000000,"tick":n:40e7f66000000000,"day":n:409ff80000000000,"year":n:4075500000000000,"type":s:"taught","txt":s:"<b>Kare II</b> taught <b>Falk II</b> the secret of Ask's number. The knowledge spreads.","tech":s:"numbers",},{"id":n:40bd730000000000,"tick":n:40e7f68000000000,"day":n:409ff80000000000,"year":n:4075500000000000,"type":s:"season","txt":s:"❄️ Winter closes over the world. The stores will decide who sees spring.",},{"id":n:40bd740000000000,