:4076000000000000,"type":s:"violence","txt":s:"🔥⚔️ Driven by a failing harvest, the people of <b>Runestead</b> fell upon <b>Majaheim</b> — a raid for grain and goods. They took what they could carry.","x":n:403e5a7031830b7a,"y":n:4043b7da751bb8dd,"label":s:"WAR","causes":[s:"cause:grudge",s:"cause:scarcity",],},{"id":n:40bf260000000000,"tick":n:40e8ae0000000000,"day":n:40a0760000000000,"year":n:4076000000000000,"type":s:"leader","txt":s:"🕯️ <b>Runestead</b> is without a leader — <b>Bjorn II</b>'s voice is gone, and no one yet speaks for all.","village":s:"Runestead","x":n:403e5a7031830b7a,"y":n:4043b7da751bb8dd,"causes":[s:"ev:7675",],},{"id":n:40bf270000000000,"tick":n:40e8ae0000000000,"day":n:40a0760000000000,"year":n:4076000000000000,"type":s:"leader","txt":s:"👑 In <b>Runestead</b>, the people have begun to listen when <b>Disa II</b> speaks — prestige has hardened into leadership. No one voted; it is simply so.","village":s:"Runestead","agent":n:4074900000000000,"x":n:403e5a7031830b7a,"y":n:4043b7da751bb8dd,"label":s:"A LEADER IS RECOGNIZED","causes":[s:"agent:329",],},{"id":n:40bf280000000000,"tick":n:40e8ae0000000000,"day":n:40a0760000000000,"year":n:4076000000000000,"type":s:"epithet","txt":s:"✨ From that day on, <b>Disa II</b> was known as <b>Disa II the Voice of Runestead</b>.","agent":n:4074900000000000,"x":n:40400854a8a7d281,"y":n:404100b922c1928f,},{"id":n:40bf290000000000,"tick":n:40e8ae0000000000,"day":n:40a0760000000000,"year":n:4076000000000000,"type":s:"death","txt":s:"<b>Disa II</b> was taken by the fever that walks where many live close. Much knowledge died with them — unless someone learned in time.","agent":n:407a300000000000,"x":n:404441384bf8078f,"y":n:404252fb09cd38ef,"cause":s:"sickness","causes":[s:"cause:sickness",],},{"id":n:40bf2a0000000000,"tick":n:40e8ae2000000000,"day":n:40a0760000000000,"year":n:4076000000000000,"type":s:"taught","txt":s:"<b>Ylva II</b> taught <b>Halvar II</b> the secret of Ask's javelin. The knowledge spreads.","tech