y evening. No one asks why it began.","agent":n:4074700000000000,},{"id":n:40bfc30000000000,"tick":n:40e8f96000000000,"day":n:40a0a80000000000,"year":n:4076400000000000,"type":s:"moved","txt":s:"<b>Eira II</b> moved into an abandoned hut.",},{"id":n:40bfc40000000000,"tick":n:40e8f9a000000000,"day":n:40a0a80000000000,"year":n:4076400000000000,"type":s:"taught","txt":s:"<b>Saga II</b> taught <b>Saga II</b> the secret of Ask's the healer. The knowledge spreads.","tech":s:"medicine",},{"id":n:40bfc50000000000,"tick":n:40e8f9c000000000,"day":n:40a0a80000000000,"year":n:4076400000000000,"type":s:"hoard","txt":s:"🏺 <b>Freja II</b> has begun laying up stores beyond any need. The pile grows — and eyes have begun to follow it.","agent":n:407cd00000000000,"x":n:403cb759b2763447,"y":n:403d542a91f1a60a,"causes":[s:"agent:461",],},{"id":n:40bfc60000000000,"tick":n:40e8fac000000000,"day":n:40a0a80000000000,"year":n:4076400000000000,"type":s:"taught","txt":s:"<b>Embla II</b> taught <b>Ronja II</b> the secret of Eira's the tale. The knowledge spreads.","tech":s:"storytelling",},{"id":n:40bfc70000000000,"tick":n:40e8fac000000000,"day":n:40a0a80000000000,"year":n:4076400000000000,"type":s:"child","txt":s:"👶 <b>Vidar II</b> and <b>Signe II</b> have had a child, <b>Vera II</b> — generation 16. They inherit traits from both.","agent":n:407f700000000000,"x":n:4042e121fc1a2097,"y":n:403ee6765b40673c,"causes":[s:"agent:406",s:"agent:375",],},{"id":n:40bfc80000000000,"tick":n:40e8fac000000000,"day":n:40a0a80000000000,"year":n:4076400000000000,"type":s:"child","txt":s:"👶 <b>Eira II</b> and <b>Orm II</b> have had a child, <b>Otto II</b> — generation 16. They inherit traits from both.","agent":n:407f800000000000,"x":n:404df4ca1848df93,"y":n:4041ec25d7b120df,"causes":[s:"agent:421",s:"agent:360",],},{"id":n:40bfc90000000000,"tick":n:40e8fac000000000,"day":n:40a0a80000000000,"year":n:4076400000000000,"type":s:"hoard","txt":s:"🏺 <b>Bjorn II</b> has begun laying up stores beyond any need. The pile grows — and eyes have begun to follow it.","agent":n:407ca00000000000,"x":n:4050936595f3840b,"y":n:40428cce5d2bbf6f,"causes":[s:"agent:458",],},{"id":n:40bfca0000000000,"tick":n:40e8fba000000000,"day":n:40a0aa0000000000,"year":n:4076400000000000,"type":s:"hunt","txt":s:"🎣 <b>Vera II</b> pulled silver from the water.","agent":n:4077f00000000000,"x":n:4050aadcdd1655e3,"y":n:40445ed260405e5b,},{"id":n:40bfcb0000000000,"tick":n:40e8fba000000000,"day":n:40a0aa0000000000,"year":n:4076400000000000,"type":s:"hunt","txt":s:"🎣 <b>Nanna II</b> pulled silver from the water.","agent":n:4078300000000000,"x":n:403deb5b31b67e37,"y":n:40406faf1232d2b1,},{"id":n:40bfcc0000000000,"tick":n:40e8fca000000000,"day":n:40a0aa0000000000,"year":n:4076400000000000,"type":s:"failed","txt":s:"<b>Vera II</b> tried something with stone — and failed. But failure teaches.","agent":n:4079d00000000000,},{"id":n:40bfcd0000000000,"tick":n:40e8fe0000000000,"day":n:40a0aa0000000000,"year":n:4076400000000000,"type":s:"star","txt":s:"🌌 Under the Watchers, the people gather in the dark and turn their faces to the stars.","agent":n:407b300000000000,"x":n:404b5b4b63475a60,"y":n:404490775cdb0e6d,},{"id":n:40bfce0000000000,"tick":n:40e8fe0000000000,"day":n:40a0aa0000000000,"year":n:4076400000000000,"type":s:"star","txt":s:"📜✨ <b>Selma II</b> pressed the pattern of the stars into clay — the first star-marks. Now the sky can be remembered.","agent":n:407db00000000000,},{"id":n:40bfcf0000000000,"tick":n:40e8fe0000000000,"day":n:40a0aa0000000000,"year":n:4076400000000000,"type":s:"star","txt":s:"✨ <b>Orm II</b> watches the stars again, night after night. Something is taking shape.","agent":n:407e000000000000,},{"id":n:40bfd00000000000,"tick":n:40e8fe2000000000,"day":n:40a0aa0000000000,"year":n:4076400000000000,"type":s:"taught","txt":s:"<b>Tuva II</b> taught <b>Idun II</b> the secret of Ask's fishing line. The knowledge spreads.","tech":s:"fishing",},{"id":n:40bfd10000000000,"tick":n:40e9016000000000,"day":n:40a0ae0000000000,"year":n:4076400000000000,"type":s:"taught","txt":s:"<b>Idun II</b> taught <b>Signe II</b> the secret of Ask II's written music. The knowledge spreads.","tech":s:"composition",},{"id":n:40bfd20000000000,"tick":n:40e9022000000000,"day":n:40a0ae0000000000,"year":n:4076400000000000,"type":s:"taught","txt":s:"<b>Halvar II</b> taught <b>Freja II</b> the secret of Ask's melody. The knowledge spreads.","tech":s:"song",},{"id":n:40bfd30000000000,"tick":n:40e9030000000000,"day":n:40a0ae0000000000,"year":n:4076400000000000,"type":s:"field","txt":s:"🌾 <b>Ulv II the Oathbreaker</b> brings in the harvest from Ulv II's field. Winter holds less fear now.","agent":n:407a200000000000,"x":n:4042800000000000,"y":n:4038000000000000,},{"id":n:40bfd40000000000,"tick":n:40e9048000000000,"day":n:40a0b00000000000,"year":n:4076400000000000,"type":s:"season","txt":s:"❄️ Winter closes over the world. The stores will decide who sees spring.",},{"id":n:40bfd50000000000,"tick":n:40e9052000000000,"day":n:40a0b00000000000,"year":n:4076400000000000,"type":s:"taught","txt":s:"<b>Tuva II</b> taught <b>Liv II</b> the secret of Nanna II's dry-stone. The knowledge spreads.","tech":s:"masonry",},{"id":n:40bfd60000000000,"tick":n:40e9062000000000,"day":n:40a0b00000000000,"year":n:4076400000000000,"type":s:"steal","txt":s:"🥀 Need drove the hand: <b>Halvar II</b> took what could be carried from <b>Bjorn II</b>.","agent":n:407b200000000000,"victim":n:4078e00000000000,"x":n:404adcb7d5d2aa3c,"y":n:404a5a3a8d570100,"cause":s:"desperation","causes":[s:"ev:8148",s:"agent:398",s:"cause:desperation",s:"cause:winter",],},{"id":n:40bfd70000000000,"tick":n:40e9070000000000,"day":n:40a0b00000000000,"year":n:4076400000000000,"type":s:"star","txt":s:"🌌 Under the Watchers, the people gather in the dark and turn their faces to the stars.","agent":n:4077f00000000000,"x":n:405117c8e1556234,"y":n:404421b616fdbf52,},{"id":n:40bfd80000000000,"tick":n:40e9072000000000,"day":n:40a0b00000000000,"year":n:4076400000000000,"type":s:"death","txt":s:"<b>Disa II the Voice of Runestead</b> died of old age at 65. Much knowledge died with them — unless someone learned in time.","agent":n:4074900000000000,"x":n:404037c1db6776ec,"y":n:404465762db496f9,"cause":s:"age","causes":[s:"cause:age",],},{"id":n:40bfd90000000000,"tick":n:40e9072000000000,"day":n:40a0b00000000000,"year":n:4076400000000000,"type":s:"moved","txt":s:"<b>Torv II</b> moved into an abandoned hut.",},{"id":n:40bfda0000000000,"tick":n:40e9072000000000,"day":n:40a0b00000000000,"year":n:4076400000000000,"type":s:"customLost","txt":s:"🕯️ No one remembers The Unseen Wills anymore. A piece of who they were is gone.","custom":s:"c27",},{"id":n:40bfdb0000000000,"tick":n:40e9080000000000,"day":n:40a0b20000000000,"year":n:4076500000000000,"type":s:"quirk","txt":s:"🙂 <b>Selma II</b> always sits farthest from the fire. Once begun, never stopped.","agent":n:407db00000000000,"x":n:4050e5d3065dc979,"y":n:40417b714ef2fa28,},{"id":n:40bfdc0000000000,"tick":n:40e9080000000000,"day":n:40a0b20000000000,"year":n:4076500000000000,"type":s:"violence","txt":s:"🔥⚔️ Driven by a failing harvest, the people of <b>Runestead</b> fell upon <b>Majaheim</b> — a raid for grain and goods. They took what they could carry.","x":n:403e5a7031830b7a,"y":n:4043b7da751bb8dd,"label":s:"WAR","causes":[s:"cause:scarcity",],},{"id":n:40bfdd0000000000,"tick":n:40e9080000000000,"day":n:40a0b20000000000,"year":n:4076500000000000,"type":s:"leader","txt":s:"🕯️ <b>Runestead</b> is without a leader — <b>Disa II</b>'s voice is gone, and no one yet speaks for all.","village":s:"Runestead","x":n:403e5a7031830b7a,"y":n:4043b7da751bb8dd,"causes":[s:"ev:7975",],},{"id":n:40bfde0000000000,"tick":n:40e9080000000000,"day":n:40a0b20000000000,"year":n:4076500000000000,"type":s:"leader","txt":s:"👑 In <b>Runestead</b>, the people have begun to listen when <b>Vidar II</b> speaks — prestige has hardened into leadership. No one voted; it is simply so.","village":s:"Runestead","agent":n:4075a00000000000,"x":n:403e5a7031830b7a,"y":n:4043b7da751bb8dd,"label":s:"A LEADER IS RECOGNIZED","causes":[s:"agent:346",],},{"id":n:40bfdf0000000000,"tick":n:40e9080000000000,"day":n:40a0b20000000000,"year":n:4076500000000000,"type":s:"epithet","txt":s:"✨ From that day on, <b>Vidar II</b> was known as <b>Vidar II the Voice of Runestead</b>.","agent":n:4075a00000000000,"x":n:40500c9828192c50,"y":n:40419dec1bec5b95,},{"id":n:40bfe00000000000,"tick":n:40e908e000000000,"day":n:40a0b20000000000,"year":n:4076500000000000,"type":s:"hunt","txt":s:"🎣 <b>Vidar II</b> pulled silver from the water.","agent":n:4079600000000000,"x":n:4044261241068d6e,"y":n:403edf30751f0aa2,},{"id":n:40bfe10000000000,"tick":n:40e908e000000000,"day":n:40a0b20000000000,"year":n:4076500000000000,"type":s:"hoard","txt":s:"🏺 <b>Alve II</b> has begun laying up stores beyond any need. The pile grows — and eyes have begun to follow it.","agent":n:407d400000000000,"x":n:40422fd1abd2aebf,"y":n:403ac2caa5743b7c,"causes":[s:"agent:468",],},{"id":n:40bfe20000000000,"tick":n:40e909c000000000,"day":n:40a0b20000000000,"year":n:4076500000000000,"type":s:"taught","txt":s:"<b>Vidar II</b> taught <b>Otto II</b> the secret of Ask's script. The knowledge spreads.","tech":s:"writing",},{"id":n:40bfe30000000000,"tick":n:40e909c000000000,"day":n:40a0b20000000000,"year":n:4076500000000000,"type":s:"hoard","txt":s:"🏺 <b>Otto II</b> has begun laying up stores beyond any need. The pile grows — and eyes have begun to follow it.","agent":n:407da00000000000,"x":n:404b254d5129a3f2,"y":n:4043948330be7b9e,"causes":[s:"agent:474",],},{"id":n:40bfe40000000000,"tick":n:40e90a0000000000,"day":n:40a0b20000000000,"year":n:4076500000000000,"type":s:"star","txt":s:"🌌 Under the Watchers, the people gather in the dark and turn their faces to the stars.","agent":n:407b800000000000,"x":n:40442e11f606e326,"y":n:4039854f958275c5,},{"id":n:40bfe50000000000,"tick":n:40e90a0000000000,"day":n:40a0b20000000000,"year":n:4076500000000000,"type":s:"star","txt"