 on the fallen prey anymore. A piece of who they were is gone.","custom":s:"c14",},{"id":n:40c0088000000000,"tick":n:40e91f0000000000,"day":n:40a0c00000000000,"year":n:4076600000000000,"type":s:"death","txt":s:"<b>Otto II</b> died of old age at 68. Much knowledge died with them — unless someone learned in time.","agent":n:4074400000000000,"x":n:404a86ca97bc0d25,"y":n:40425421ea5a376c,"cause":s:"age","causes":[s:"cause:age",],},{"id":n:40c0090000000000,"tick":n:40e91f0000000000,"day":n:40a0c00000000000,"year":n:4076600000000000,"type":s:"moved","txt":s:"<b>Selma II</b> moved into an abandoned hut.",},{"id":n:40c0098000000000,"tick":n:40e91f0000000000,"day":n:40a0c00000000000,"year":n:4076600000000000,"type":s:"customLost","txt":s:"🕯️ No one remembers Burning a twig at the grave anymore. A piece of who they were is gone.","custom":s:"c22",},{"id":n:40c00a0000000000,"tick":n:40e91f2000000000,"day":n:40a0c00000000000,"year":n:4076600000000000,"type":s:"child","txt":s:"👶 <b>Saga II</b> and <b>Torv II</b> have had a child, <b>Disa II</b> — generation 16. They inherit traits from both.","agent":n:407fd00000000000,"x":n:40410fc886c59ed4,"y":n:404151ad799dd382,"causes":[s:"agent:429",s:"agent:424",],},{"id":n:40c00a8000000000,"tick":n:40e91f2000000000,"day":n:40a0c00000000000,"year":n:4076600000000000,"type":s:"customBack","txt":s:"🌱 <b>Saga II</b> has revived Pouring water over the newborn's doorstep — an old way returns.","custom":s:"c40",},{"id":n:40c00b0000000000,"tick":n:40e91f2000000000,"day":n:40a0c00000000000,"year":n:4076600000000000,"type":s:"hunt","txt":s:"🎣 <b>Saga II</b> pulled silver from the water.","agent":n:407e900000000000,"x":n:4041a0b22237b37d,"y":n:4041c1594b2db362,},{"id":n:40c00b8000000000,"tick":n:40e920e000000000,"day":n:40a0c20000000000,"year":n:4076600000000000,"type":s:"journey","txt":s:"🔥 <b>Torv II</b> reached Majaheim. Strangers shared a fire that night.","agent":n:407c600000000000,"x":n:4044731228267f35,"y":n:403a9a35f3bb3ef4,},{"id":n:40c00c0