>Ronja II</b> taught <b>Signe II</b> the secret of Ask's urn. The knowledge spreads.","tech":s:"pottery",},{"id":n:40c1010000000000,"tick":n:40ea142000000000,"day":n:40a1640000000000,"year":n:4077300000000000,"type":s:"custom","txt":s:"🌿 <b>Ronja II</b> began laying flowers on a flat stone — no one told them to. Others may follow. <i>(Laying flowers on a flat stone)</i>","custom":s:"c51","agent":n:4080880000000000,"x":n:4041a5bd67f0829b,"y":n:4040d72bbc131c5e,"label":s:"A CUSTOM APPEARS",},{"id":n:40c1018000000000,"tick":n:40ea142000000000,"day":n:40a1640000000000,"year":n:4077300000000000,"type":s:"mutation","txt":s:"🧬 <b>Ronja II</b> does it differently: laying flowers on a flat stone instead of believing the world repeats and can be understood. A tradition drifts.","custom":s:"c51",},{"id":n:40c1020000000000,"tick":n:40ea14c000000000,"day":n:40a1640000000000,"year":n:4077300000000000,"type":s:"child","txt":s:"👶 <b>Vidar II</b> and <b>Saga II</b> have had a child, <b>Otto II</b> — generation 17. They inherit traits from both.","agent":n:4080b00000000000,"x":n:404141aa7e1bc481,"y":n:403ad458772dcc3f,"causes":[s:"agent:466",s:"agent:459",],},{"id":n:40c1028000000000,"tick":n:40ea14c000000000,"day":n:40a1640000000000,"year":n:4077300000000000,"type":s:"child","txt":s:"👶 <b>Kare II</b> and <b>Ylva II</b> have had a child, <b>Selma II</b> — generation 17. They inherit traits from both.","agent":n:4080b80000000000,"x":n:40435e5281b46dea,"y":n:403e4aca7891e2e0,"causes":[s:"agent:492",s:"agent:457",],},{"id":n:40c1030000000000,"tick":n:40ea150000000000,"day":n:40a1640000000000,"year":n:4077300000000000,"type":s:"death","txt":s:"<b>Torv II</b> died of old age at 56. Much knowledge died with them — unless someone learned in time.","agent":n:4078a00000000000,"x":n:404318d2781d8272,"y":n:4041e960a65a68b4,"cause":s:"age","causes":[s:"cause:age",],},{"id":n:40c1038000000000,"tick":n:40ea150000000000,"day":n:40a1640000000000,"year":n:4077300000000000,"type":s:"moved","txt":s:"<b>Signe II</b> moved into an abandoned hut.",},{"id":n:40c1040000000000,"tick":n:40ea158000000000,"day":n:40a1660000000000,"year":n:4077300000000000,"type":s:"star","txt":s:"📜✨ <b>Alve II</b> pressed the pattern of the stars into clay — the first star-marks. Now the sky can be remembered.","agent":n:407f200000000000,},{"id":n:40c1048000000000,"tick":n:40ea160000000000,"day":n:40a1660000000000,"year":n:4077400000000000,"type":s:"journey","txt":s:"🚶 <b>Torv II</b> set out for Frejaheim. Ideas travel on foot.","agent":n:407e400000000000,"x":n:4042b887416ce690,"y":n:4041bb808d12fec8,},{"id":n:40c1050000000000,"tick":n:40ea160000000000,"day":n:40a1660000000000,"year":n:4077400000000000,"type":s:"violence","txt":s:"🔥⚔️ Driven by a failing harvest, the people of <b>Runestead</b> fell upon <b>Ronjastead</b> — a raid for grain and goods. They took what they could carry.","x":n:403e5a7031830b7a,"y":n:4043b7da751bb8dd,"label":s:"WAR","causes":[s:"cause:scarcity",],},{"id":n:40c1058000000000,"tick":n:40ea160000000000,"day":n:40a1660000000000,"year":n:4077400000000000,"type":s:"leader","txt":s:"👑 In <b>Runestead</b>, the people have begun to listen when <b>Nanna II the Oathbreaker</b> speaks — prestige has hardened into leadership. No one voted; it is simply so.","village":s:"Runestead","agent":n:4076500000000000,"x":n:403e5a7031830b7a,"y":n:4043b7da751bb8dd,"label":s:"A LEADER IS RECOGNIZED","causes":[s:"agent:357",],},{"id":n:40c1060000000000,"tick":n:40ea162000000000,"day":n:40a1660000000000,"year":n:4077400000000000,"type":s:"hunt","txt":s:"🎣 <b>Ylva II the Oathbreaker</b> pulled silver from the water.","agent":n:407ab00000000000,"x":n:403f03fb8d80a372,"y":n:403b5acc271a2ccb,},{"id":n:40c1068000000000,"tick":n:40ea162000000000,"day":n:40a1660000000000,"year":n:4077400000000000,"type":s:"hunt","txt":s:"🎣 <b>Orm II</b> pulled silver from the water.","agent":n:407e000000000000,"x":n:4043c2fa499cf89a,"y":n:403ebfd64ef8bbe6,},{"id":n:40c1070000000000,"tick":n:40ea162000000000,"day":n:40a1660000000000,"year":n:4077400000000000,"type":s:"taught","txt":s:"<b>Freja II</b> taught <b>Kare II</b> the secret of Ask's melody. The knowledge spreads.","tech":s:"song",},{"id":n:40c1078000000000,"tick":n:40ea16a000000000,"day":n:40a1660000000000,"year":n:4077400000000000,"type":s:"hunt","txt":s:"🎣 <b>Ask II the Oathbreaker</b> pulled silver from the water.","agent":n:407c400000000000,"x":n:4042840796a18b43,"y":n:40419fe566f29623,},{"id":n:40c1080000000000,"tick":n:40ea17c000000000,"day":n:40a1660000000000,"year":n:4077400000000000,"type":s:"star","txt":s:"📜✨ <b>Selma II</b> pressed the pattern of the stars into clay — the first star-marks. Now the sky can be remembered.","agent":n:407f900000000000,},{"id":n:40c1088000000000,"tick":n:40ea180000000000,"day":n:40a1660000000000,"year":n:4077400000000000,"type":s:"death","txt":s:"<b>Idun II</b> died of old age at 76. Much knowledge died with them — unless someone learned in time.","agent":n:4075700000000000,"x":n:4044377742afe4d4,"y":n:403f6c74b9bc1d20,"cause":s:"age","causes":[s:"cause:age",],},{"id":n:40c1090000000000,"tick":n:40ea180000000000,"day":n:40a1660000000000,"year":n:4077400000000000,"type":s:"moved","txt":s:"<b>Selma II</b> moved into an abandoned hut.",},{"id":n:40c1098000000000,"tick":n:40ea180000000000,"day":n:40a1660000000000,"year":n:4077400000000000,"type":s:"child","txt":s:"👶 <b>Ylva II</b> and <b>Ylva II</b> have had a child, <b>Falk II</b> — generation 17. They inherit traits from both.","agent":n:4080c00000000000,"x":n:404136f3679ce8da,"y":n:403a7efdac3fbdec,"causes":[s:"agent:487",s:"agent:427",],},{"id":n:40c10a0000000000,"tick":n:40ea184000000000,"day":n:40a1680000000000,"year":n:4077400000000000,"type":s:"child","txt":s:"👶 <b>Bjorn II</b> and <b>Maja II</b> have had a child, <b>Nanna II</b> — generation 17. They inherit traits from both.","agent":n:4080c80000000000,"x":n:40515390f42b85ff,"y":n:4047cbb60c2ae349,"causes":[s:"agent:428",s:"agent:471",],},{"id":n:40c10a8000000000,"tick"