16a0000000000,"year":n:4077400000000000,"type":s:"taught","txt":s:"<b>Freja II</b> taught <b>Rune II</b> the secret of Embla II's the judgment. The knowledge spreads.","tech":s:"law",},{"id":n:40c1128000000000,"tick":n:40ea1dc000000000,"day":n:40a16a0000000000,"year":n:4077400000000000,"type":s:"star","txt":s:"✨ <b>Liv II</b> lay awake in the dark and watched the lights that do not fall.","agent":n:4080180000000000,"x":n:403c0937369c3d6d,"y":n:403fca3b2661edb5,},{"id":n:40c1130000000000,"tick":n:40ea1e0000000000,"day":n:40a16a0000000000,"year":n:4077400000000000,"type":s:"star","txt":s:"🌌 Under the Watchers, the people gather in the dark and turn their faces to the stars.","agent":n:4079d00000000000,"x":n:40445a6b5be132ca,"y":n:403f54b96e1e215b,},{"id":n:40c1138000000000,"tick":n:40ea1f8000000000,"day":n:40a16c0000000000,"year":n:4077400000000000,"type":s:"hoard","txt":s:"🏺 <b>Ask II</b> has begun laying up stores beyond any need. The pile grows — and eyes have begun to follow it.","agent":n:407e200000000000,"x":n:4040ca43e2dad735,"y":n:403da07ea1db14f6,"causes":[s:"agent:482",],},{"id":n:40c1140000000000,"tick":n:40ea1f8000000000,"day":n:40a16c0000000000,"year":n:4077400000000000,"type":s:"taught","txt":s:"<b>Saga II</b> taught <b>Embla II</b> the secret of Ask's script. The knowledge spreads.","tech":s:"writing",},{"id":n:40c1148000000000,"tick":n:40ea206000000000,"day":n:40a16c0000000000,"year":n:4077400000000000,"type":s:"raid","txt":s:"⚔️ <b>Saga II</b> set upon <b>Ronja II the Oathbreaker</b> and seized goods — the gap was cheaper to close by force.","agent":n:407cb00000000000,"victim":n:4077b00000000000,"x":n:404095a4e8b330fb,"y":n:403844c45fa8356e,"cause":s:"greed","causes":[s:"ev:7230",s:"agent:379",s:"cause:greed",],},{"id":n:40c1150000000000,"tick":n:40ea218000000000,"day":n:40a16e0000000000,"year":n:4077400000000000,"type":s:"taught","txt":s:"<b>Alve II</b> taught <b>Alve II</b> the secret of Ask's urn. The knowledge spreads.","tech":s:"pottery",},{"id":