> moved into an abandoned hut.",},{"id":n:40c1198000000000,"tick":n:40ea270000000000,"day":n:40a1700000000000,"year":n:4077400000000000,"type":s:"child","txt":s:"👶 <b>Torv II</b> and <b>Freja II</b> have had a child, <b>Disa II</b> — generation 16. They inherit traits from both.","agent":n:4080d80000000000,"x":n:403d4aa7c26dddd7,"y":n:404191d0137b8d72,"causes":[s:"agent:484",s:"agent:431",],},{"id":n:40c11a0000000000,"tick":n:40ea274000000000,"day":n:40a1720000000000,"year":n:4077400000000000,"type":s:"child","txt":s:"👶 <b>Rune II</b> and <b>Eira II</b> have had a child, <b>Orm II</b> — generation 16. They inherit traits from both.","agent":n:4080e00000000000,"x":n:40436238f232d586,"y":n:4042259343bf99fa,"causes":[s:"agent:460",s:"agent:451",],},{"id":n:40c11a8000000000,"tick":n:40ea276000000000,"day":n:40a1720000000000,"year":n:4077400000000000,"type":s:"taught","txt":s:"<b>Ask II</b> taught <b>Vidar II</b> the secret of Optics. The knowledge spreads.","tech":s:"optics",},{"id":n:40c11b0000000000,"tick":n:40ea276000000000,"day":n:40a1720000000000,"year":n:4077400000000000,"type":s:"taught","txt":s:"<b>Embla II</b> taught <b>Ronja II</b> the secret of Embla II's the judgment. The knowledge spreads.","tech":s:"law",},{"id":n:40c11b8000000000,"tick":n:40ea280000000000,"day":n:40a1720000000000,"year":n:4077500000000000,"type":s:"season","txt":s:"🌸 Spring returns. The survivors count each other, and begin again.",},{"id":n:40c11c0000000000,"tick":n:40ea288000000000,"day":n:40a1720000000000,"year":n:4077500000000000,"type":s:"customBack","txt":s:"🌱 <b>Ulv II</b> has revived Placing a stone on the grave — an old way returns.","custom":s:"c39",},{"id":n:40c11c8000000000,"tick":n:40ea288000000000,"day":n:40a1720000000000,"year":n:4077500000000000,"type":s:"mutation","txt":s:"🧬 <b>Ulv II</b> does it differently: placing a stone on the grave instead of pouring water over the grave. A tradition drifts.","custom":s:"c39",},{"id":n:40c11d0000000000,"tick":n:40ea296000000000,"day":n:40a1720000000000,"year":n:4077500000000000,"type":s:"hoard","txt":s:"🏺 <b>Freja II</b> has begun laying up stores beyond any need. The pile grows — and eyes have begun to follow it.","agent":n:407eb00000000000,"x":n:40446197bfb52a82,"y":n:40427fd0a95322cb,"causes":[s:"agent:491",],},{"id":n:40c11d8000000000,"tick":n:40ea29a000000000,"day":n:40a1720000000000,"year":n:4077500000000000,"type":s:"steal","txt":s:"🥀 Hunger owned the hand: <b>Saga II</b> wrenched food from <b>Selma II</b>.","agent":n:4078f00000000000,"victim":n:407bd00000000000,"x":n:403c8d5cad522b6a,"y":n:403edb4af282198f,"cause":s:"desperation","causes":[s:"ev:8751",s:"agent:445",s:"cause:desperation",],},{"id":n:40c11e0000000000,"tick":n:40ea2a2000000000,"day":n:40a1720000000000,"year":n:4077500000000000,"type":s:"hoard","txt":s:"🏺 <b>Tuva II</b> has begun laying up stores beyond any need. The pile grows — and eyes have begun to follow it.","agent":n:407f100000000000,"x":n:40427967868d6d04,"y":n:4041bc0a1a59b530,"causes":[s:"agent:497",],},{"id":n:40c11e8000000000,"tick":n:40ea2a2000000000,"day":n:40a1720000000000,"year":n:4077500000000000,"type":s:"star","txt":s:"📜✨ <b>Falk II</b> pressed the pattern of the stars into clay — the first star-marks. Now the sky can be remembered.","agent":n:407fa00000000000,},{"id":n:40c11f0000000000,"tick":n:40ea2aa000000000,"day":n:40a1740000000000,"year":n:4077500000000000,"type":s:"child","txt":s:"👶 <b>Kare II</b> and <b>Signe II</b> have had a child, <b>Eira II</b> — generation 16. They inherit traits from both.","agent":n:4080e80000000000,"x":n:4044f2c220de6e2d,"y":n:4041e5358c0ae555,"causes":[s:"agent:462",s:"agent:465",],},{"id":n:40c11f8000000000,"tick":n:40ea2bc000000000,"day":n:40a1740000000000,"year":n:4077500000000000,"type":s:"hunt","txt":s:"🎣 <b>Maja II</b> pulled silver from the water.","agent":n:407f500000000000,"x":n:4043e2e76448d984,"y":n:4040a4f68e9f2c62,},{"id":n:40c1200000000000,"tick":n:40ea2bc000000000,"day":n:40a1740000000000,"year":n:40775000