ent":n:4083200000000000,},{"id":n:40c41f0000000000,"tick":n:40ed24a000000000,"day":n:40a3700000000000,"year":n:4079f00000000000,"type":s:"taught","txt":s:"<b>Kare II</b> taught <b>Idun II</b> the secret of Ask's stone well. The knowledge spreads.","tech":s:"well",},{"id":n:40c41f8000000000,"tick":n:40ed2a8000000000,"day":n:40a3740000000000,"year":n:4079f00000000000,"type":s:"season","txt":s:"❄️ Winter closes over the world. The stores will decide who sees spring.",},{"id":n:40c4200000000000,"tick":n:40ed2ca000000000,"day":n:40a3740000000000,"year":n:4079f00000000000,"type":s:"hunt","txt":s:"🗡️ <b>Falk II</b> brought down a deer in the deep of winter. Tonight, no one goes hungry.","agent":n:4081b00000000000,"x":n:404326348981b517,"y":n:404ee8a5195d602f,},{"id":n:40c4208000000000,"tick":n:40ed2dc000000000,"day":n:40a3760000000000,"year":n:4079f00000000000,"type":s:"steal","txt":s:"🥀 Hunger owned the hand: <b>Embla II</b> wrenched food from <b>Ulv II the Voice of Majaheim</b>.","agent":n:4080080000000000,"victim":n:407de00000000000,"x":n:4042db833d4c2f44,"y":n:403b5ca26317b00b,"cause":s:"desperation","causes":[s:"ev:10303",s:"agent:478",s:"cause:desperation",s:"cause:winter",],},{"id":n:40c4210000000000,"tick":n:40ed2e0000000000,"day":n:40a3760000000000,"year":n:407a000000000000,"type":s:"season","txt":s:"🌸 Spring returns. The survivors count each other, and begin again.",},{"id":n:40c4218000000000,"tick":n:40ed2e0000000000,"day":n:40a3760000000000,"year":n:407a000000000000,"type":s:"journey","txt":s:"🚶 <b>Sixten II</b> set out for Majaheim. Ideas travel on foot.","agent":n:4082700000000000,"x":n:404da4fb80992d1d,"y":n:4040f1ba7175ea0c,},{"id":n:40c4220000000000,"tick":n:40ed2e0000000000,"day":n:40a3760000000000,"year":n:407a000000000000,"type":s:"quirk","txt":s:"🙂 <b>Liv II</b> is always the first to fall asleep, wherever they are. Once begun, never stopped.","agent":n:4080180000000000,"x":n:403f690f291ddd5a,"y":n:403be99cc8db8f0f,},{"id":n:40c4228000000000,"tick":n:40ed2e0000000000,"day":n:40a3760000000000,"year":n:407a000000000000,"type":s:"tribute","txt":s:"🧺 In <b>Majaheim</b>, 25 households laid a share at <b>Ulv II the Voice of Majaheim</b>'s door. So surplus flows upward, and standing becomes wealth.","village":s:"Majaheim","agent":n:407de00000000000,"x":n:4044ec11de87a577,"y":n:4037e90f53b2617b,"causes":[s:"agent:478",s:"ev:10234",],},{"id":n:40c4230000000000,"tick":n:40ed2e4000000000,"day":n:40a3760000000000,"year":n:407a000000000000,"type":s:"hunt","txt":s:"🎣 <b>Eira II</b> pulled silver from the water.","agent":n:4081d80000000000,"x":n:40431af00bc007ab,"y":n:403994c1b690e176,},{"id":n:40c4238000000000,"tick":n:40ed2ec000000000,"day":n:40a3760000000000,"year":n:407a000000000000,"type":s:"hoard","txt":s:"🏺 <b>Eira II</b> has begun laying up stores beyond any need. The pile grows — and eyes have begun to follow it.","agent":n:4082c80000000000,"x":n:404fbfbb7bf271be,"y":n:40421e7d61d6e2a8,"causes":[s:"agent:601",],},{"id":n:40c4240000000000,"tick":n:40ed302000000000,"day":n:40a3760000000000,"year":n:407a000000000000,"type":s:"taught","txt":s:"<b>Orm II</b> taught <b>Liv II</b> the secret of Ask's longbow. The knowledge spreads.","tech":s:"bow",},{"id":n:40c4248000000000,"tick":n:40ed306000000000,"day":n:40a3780000000000,"year":n:407a000000000000,"type":s:"child","txt":s:"👶 <b>Orm II</b> and <b>Maja II</b> have had a child, <b>Loke II</b> — generation 19. They inherit traits from both.","agent":n:4083700000000000,"x":n:4050337f7fe13521,"y":n:40415f9a33c6b91c,"causes":[s:"agent:600",s:"agent:591",],},{"id":n:40c4250000000000,"tick":n:40ed30c000000000,"day":n:40a3780000000000,"year":n:407a000000000000,"type":s:"taught","txt":s:"<b>Kare II</b> taught <b>Alve II</b> the secret of Ask's the year-wheel. The knowledge spreads.","tech":s:"calendar",},{"id":n:40c4258000000000,"tick":n:40ed316000000000,"day":n:40a3780000000000,"year":n:407a000000000000,"type":s:"taught","txt":s:"<b>Tuva II</b> taught <b>Sixten II</b> the secret of Embla's the loom. The knowledge spreads.","tech":s:"weaving",},{"id":n:40c4260000000000,"tick":n:40ed330000000000,"day":n:40a3780000000000,"year":n:407a000000000000,"type":s:"death","txt":s:"<b>Freja II</b> died of old age at 85. Much knowledge died with them — unless someone learned in time.","agent":n:407cd00000000000,"x":n:404327cffd77a6ac,"y":n:404161fa8febfbf8,"cause":s:"age","causes":[s:"cause:age",],},{"id":n:40c4268000000000,"tick":n:40ed330000000000,"day":n:40a3780000000000,"year":n:407a000000000000,"type":s:"customBack","txt":s:"🌱 <b>Ylva II</b> has revived Burning a twig at the grave — an old way returns.","custom":s:"c22",},{"id":n:40c4270000000000,"tick":n:40ed330000000000,"day":n:40a3780000000000,"year":n:407a000000000000,"type":s:"legend","txt":s:"🕊️ Freja II is gone. But someone still leaves a flower where no one sees. No one asks why it began.","agent":n:407cd00000000000,},{"id":n:40c4278000000000,"tick":n:40ed330000000000,"day":n:40a3780000000000,"year":n:407a000000000000,"type":s:"customLost","txt":s:"🕯️ No one remembers The Unseen Wills anymore. A piece of who they were is gone.","custom":s:"c27",},{"id":n:40c4280000000000,"tick":n:40ed334000000000,"day":n:40a37a0000000000,"year":n:407a000000000000,"type":s:"death","txt":s:"<b>Disa II</b> died of old age at 58. Much knowledge died with them — unless someone learned in time.","agent":n:407fd00000000000,"x":n:4051494e3edc0431,"y":n:4048fd72037a9370,"cause":s:"age","causes":[s:"cause:age",],},{"id":n:40c4288000000000,"tick":n:40ed334000000000,"day":n:40a37a0000000000,"year":n:407a000000000000,"type":s:"moved","txt":s:"<b>Signe II</b> moved into an abandoned hut.",},{"id":n:40c4290000000000,"tick":n:40ed334000000000,"day":n:40a37a0000000000,"year":n:407a000000000000,"type":s:"child","txt":s:"👶 <b>Rune II</b> and <b>Vidar II</b> have had a child, <b>Vera II</b> — generation 18. They inherit traits from both.","agent":n:4083780000000000,"x":n:4040d06692470051,"y":n:403ddd748a12d141,"causes":[s:"agent:58