ear":n:407d500000000000,"type":s:"death","txt":s:"<b>Orm II the Voice of Alveheim</b> died of old age at 84. Much knowledge died with them — unless someone learned in time.","agent":n:4081d00000000000,"x":n:404101c0204a6a51,"y":n:403c76339c75a409,"cause":s:"age","causes":[s:"cause:age",],},{"id":n:40c6e20000000000,"tick":n:40f07b1000000000,"day":n:40a5fa0000000000,"year":n:407d500000000000,"type":s:"legend","txt":s:"🕊️ Orm II the Voice of Alveheim is gone. But someone still always the first to fall asleep. No one asks why it began.","agent":n:4081d00000000000,},{"id":n:40c6e28000000000,"tick":n:40f07b1000000000,"day":n:40a5fa0000000000,"year":n:407d500000000000,"type":s:"child","txt":s:"👶 <b>Liv II</b> and <b>Idun II</b> have had a child, <b>Tuva II</b> — generation 20. They inherit traits from both.","agent":n:4086180000000000,"x":n:40410c182454e81c,"y":n:4041062358b9329a,"causes":[s:"agent:665",s:"agent:673",],},{"id":n:40c6e30000000000,"tick":n:40f07b1000000000,"day":n:40a5fa0000000000,"year":n:407d500000000000,"type":s:"customLost","txt":s:"🕯️ No one remembers Burning a twig at the fallen prey anymore. A piece of who they were is gone.","custom":s:"c52",},{"id":n:40c6e38000000000,"tick":n:40f07b2000000000,"day":n:40a5fc0000000000,"year":n:407d500000000000,"type":s:"field","txt":s:"🌾 <b>Selma II</b> brings in the harvest from Selma II's field. Winter holds less fear now.","agent":n:4084780000000000,"x":n:403e000000000000,"y":n:4039000000000000,},{"id":n:40c6e40000000000,"tick":n:40f07b2000000000,"day":n:40a5fc0000000000,"year":n:407d500000000000,"type":s:"taught","txt":s:"<b>Ask II</b> taught <b>Signe II</b> the secret of Eira's the tale. The knowledge spreads.","tech":s:"storytelling",},{"id":n:40c6e48000000000,"tick":n:40f07b4000000000,"day":n:40a5fc0000000000,"year":n:407d500000000000,"type":s:"season","txt":s:"❄️ Winter closes over the world. The stores will decide who sees spring.",},{"id":n:40c6e50000000000,"tick":n:40f07ba000000000,"day":n:40a5fc0000000000,"year":n:407d500000000000,"type":s:"sharing","txt":s:"🍞 <b>Signe II</b> shared food with <b>Saga II</b> — The Full Bowl Custom holds. Those who keep the same ways do not let each other starve.","x":n:4046e3a88f978182,"y":n:404b1eef9d349b71,"agent":n:4084280000000000,"causes":[s:"agent:645",s:"agent:669",],},{"id":n:40c6e58000000000,"tick":n:40f07ba000000000,"day":n:40a5fc0000000000,"year":n:407d500000000000,"type":s:"child","txt":s:"👶 <b>Signe II</b> and <b>Saga II</b> have had a child, <b>Alve II</b> — generation 20. They inherit traits from both.","agent":n:4086200000000000,"x":n:4046e3a88f978182,"y":n:404b1eef9d349b71,"causes":[s:"agent:645",s:"agent:669",],},{"id":n:40c6e60000000000,"tick":n:40f07c1000000000,"day":n:40a5fc0000000000,"year":n:407d500000000000,"type":s:"moved","txt":s:"<b>Loke II</b> moved into an abandoned hut.",},{"id":n:40c6e68000000000,"tick":n:40f07c8000000000,"day":n:40a5fc0000000000,"year":n:407d500000000000,"type":s:"child","txt":s:"👶 <b>Torv II</b> and <b>Sten II</b> have had a child, <b>Ronja II</b> — generation 20. They inherit traits from both.","agent":n:4086280000000000,"x":n:403948046b1ba93a,"y":n:403aafd7aee74157,"causes":[s:"agent:634",s:"agent:666",],},{"id":n:40c6e70000000000,"tick":n:40f07c9000000000,"day":n:40a5fc0000000000,"year":n:407d500000000000,"type":s:"star","txt":s:"✨ <b>Nanna II</b> watches the stars again, night after night. Something is taking shape.","agent":n:4085780000000000,},{"id":n:40c6e78000000000,"tick":n:40f07cb000000000,"day":n:40a5fe0000000000,"year":n:407d500000000000,"type":s:"taught","txt":s:"<b>Halvar II</b> taught <b>Ask II</b> the secret of Ask's silo. The knowledge spreads.","tech":s:"granary",},{"id":n:40c6e80000000000,"tick":n:40f07d0000000000,"day":n:40a5fe0000000000,"year":n:407d600000000000,"type":s:"season","txt":s:"🌸 Spring returns. The survivors count each other, and begin again.",},{"id":n:40c6e88000000000,"tick":n:40f07d0000000000,"day":n:40a5fe0000000000,"year":n:407d600000000000,"type":s:"quirk","txt":s:"🙂 <b>Nanna II</b> stops at the same strange stone every day, and looks at it. It began the year Nanna II died. It has not stopped since.","agent":n:4082a80000000000,"x":n:4041f21fe72d762e,"y":n:4041a9e30784c4bd,},{"id":n:40c6e90000000000,"tick":n:40f07d0000000000,"day":n:40a5fe0000000000,"year":n:407d600000000000,"type":s:"quirk","txt":s:"🙂 <b>Ask II</b> stops at the same strange stone every day, and looks at it. Once begun, never stopped.","agent":n:4084b00000000000,"x":n:404f949717623c41,"y":n:40486ab11b5ba1fe,},{"id":n:40c6e98000000000,"tick":n:40f07d0000000000,"day":n:40a5fe0000000000,"year":n:407d600000000000,"type":s:"leader","txt":s:"🕯️ <b>Alveheim</b> is without a leader — <b>Orm II</b>'s voice is gone, and no one yet speaks for all.","village":s:"Alveheim","x":n:403accb07cb47926,"y":n:403b37b6657cab98,"causes":[s:"ev:11373",],},{"id":n:40c6ea0000000000,"tick":n:40f07d0000000000,"day":n:40a5fe0000000000,"year":n:407d600000000000,"type":s:"death","txt":s:"<b>Saga II</b> was taken by the fever that walks where many live close. Much knowledge died with them — unless someone learned in time.","agent":n:4085d80000000000,"x":n:4042ca1db2af1070,"y":n:4042236a3ddb9807,"cause":s:"sickness","causes":[s:"cause:sickness",],},{"id":n:40c6ea8000000000,"tick":n:40f07d2000000000,"day":n:40a5fe0000000000,"year":n:407d600000000000,"type":s:"moved","txt":s:"<b>Vera II</b> moved into an abandoned hut.",},{"id":n:40c6eb0000000000,"tick":n:40f07d5000000000,"day":n:40a5fe0000000000,"year":n:407d600000000000,"type":s:"hunt","txt":s:"🎣 <b>Ask II</b> pulled silver from the water.","agent":n:4084b00000000000,"x":n:404f949717623c41,"y":n:40486ab11b5ba1fe,},{"id":n:40c6eb8000000000,"tick":n:40f07dd000000000,"day":n:40a5fe0000000000,"year":n:407d600000000000,"type":s:"taught","txt":s:"<b>Otto II</b> taught <b>Disa II</b> the secret of Ask's lodge. The knowledge spreads.","tech":s:"hut",},{"id":n:40c6ec0000000000,"tick":n:40f07e0000000000,"day":n:40a5fe0000000000,"year