000000000,"day":n:40a7140000000000,"year":n:407ed00000000000,"type":s:"death","txt":s:"<b>Signe II</b> starved to death. Much knowledge died with them — unless someone learned in time.","agent":n:4087e80000000000,"x":n:4042deddb6df8ed6,"y":n:403b7320aa6fa21a,"cause":s:"starvation","causes":[s:"cause:starvation",],},{"id":n:40c8c18000000000,"tick":n:40f14e5000000000,"day":n:40a7140000000000,"year":n:407ed00000000000,"type":s:"customLost","txt":s:"🕯️ No one remembers Placing a stone on the grave anymore. A piece of who they were is gone.","custom":s:"c39",},{"id":n:40c8c20000000000,"tick":n:40f14e6000000000,"day":n:40a7140000000000,"year":n:407ed00000000000,"type":s:"star","txt":s:"📜✨ <b>Saga II</b> pressed the pattern of the stars into clay — the first star-marks. Now the sky can be remembered.","agent":n:4086c80000000000,},{"id":n:40c8c28000000000,"tick":n:40f14e7000000000,"day":n:40a7140000000000,"year":n:407ed00000000000,"type":s:"death","txt":s:"<b>Halvar II</b> died of old age at 78. Much knowledge died with them — unless someone learned in time.","agent":n:4083300000000000,"x":n:4050d03981d4e9a7,"y":n:404422cae621ebe1,"cause":s:"age","causes":[s:"cause:age",],},{"id":n:40c8c30000000000,"tick":n:40f14e7000000000,"day":n:40a7140000000000,"year":n:407ed00000000000,"type":s:"legend","txt":s:"🕊️ Halvar II is gone. But someone still whistles every morning. No one asks why it began.","agent":n:4083300000000000,},{"id":n:40c8c38000000000,"tick":n:40f14e7000000000,"day":n:40a7140000000000,"year":n:407ed00000000000,"type":s:"child","txt":s:"👶 <b>Falk II</b> and <b>Vera II</b> have had a child, <b>Nanna II</b> — generation 21. They inherit traits from both.","agent":n:4088480000000000,"x":n:404d3b1816c321a3,"y":n:40424e4625312213,"causes":[s:"agent:686",s:"agent:683",],},{"id":n:40c8c40000000000,"tick":n:40f14eb000000000,"day":n:40a7160000000000,"year":n:407ed00000000000,"type":s:"child","txt":s:"👶 <b>Disa II</b> and <b>Embla II</b> have had a child, <b>Ulv II</b> — gener