d","txt":s:"🕊️ Sten II is gone. But someone still visits the same strange stone daily. No one asks why it began.","agent":n:4083e00000000000,},{"id":n:40c91e8000000000,"tick":n:40f172b000000000,"day":n:40a7460000000000,"year":n:407f100000000000,"type":s:"customLost","txt":s:"🕯️ No one remembers Burning a twig at the grave anymore. A piece of who they were is gone.","custom":s:"c22",},{"id":n:40c91f0000000000,"tick":n:40f172e000000000,"day":n:40a7460000000000,"year":n:407f100000000000,"type":s:"hoard","txt":s:"🏺 <b>Ask II</b> has begun laying up stores beyond any need. The pile grows — and eyes have begun to follow it.","agent":n:4086900000000000,"x":n:40415e1fc4cb4431,"y":n:403cfb08fd98fac0,"causes":[s:"agent:722",],},{"id":n:40c91f8000000000,"tick":n:40f1735000000000,"day":n:40a7460000000000,"year":n:407f100000000000,"type":s:"hunt","txt":s:"🎣 <b>Selma II</b> pulled silver from the water.","agent":n:4088380000000000,"x":n:40442d4b86b35260,"y":n:40400070b5a3e0b0,},{"id":n:40c9200000000000,"tick":n:40f173b000000000,"day":n:40a7460000000000,"year":n:407f100000000000,"type":s:"hunt","txt":s:"🎣 <b>Otto II</b> pulled silver from the water.","agent":n:4087400000000000,"x":n:403e9dd7a5f02f69,"y":n:40407d87e98e9560,},{"id":n:40c9208000000000,"tick":n:40f173b000000000,"day":n:40a7460000000000,"year":n:407f100000000000,"type":s:"taught","txt":s:"<b>Liv II</b> taught <b>Ronja II</b> the secret of Ask's longbow. The knowledge spreads.","tech":s:"bow",},{"id":n:40c9210000000000,"tick":n:40f173e000000000,"day":n:40a7460000000000,"year":n:407f100000000000,"type":s:"taught","txt":s:"<b>Kare II</b> taught <b>Orm II</b> the secret of Ask's number. The knowledge spreads.","tech":s:"numbers",},{"id":n:40c9218000000000,"tick":n:40f173e000000000,"day":n:40a7460000000000,"year":n:407f100000000000,"type":s:"child","txt":s:"👶 <b>Sixten II</b> and <b>Torv II</b> have had a child, <b>Freja II</b> — generation 22. They inherit traits from both.","agent":n:4088b80000000000,"x":n:403d5a46d80b916