00,"day":n:40a7580000000000,"year":n:407f200000000000,"type":s:"taught","txt":s:"<b>Sixten II</b> taught <b>Orm II</b> the secret of Embla's seedcraft. The knowledge spreads.","tech":s:"farming",},{"id":n:40c9498000000000,"tick":n:40f1812000000000,"day":n:40a7580000000000,"year":n:407f200000000000,"type":s:"observed","txt":s:"👁️ <b>Bjorn II</b> noticed that certain leaves ease pain and close a wound. An idea begins to form.","obs":s:"herbsHeal","agent":n:4088a00000000000,"x":n:404c989401485b28,"y":n:404115c534d91b5b,},{"id":n:40c94a0000000000,"tick":n:40f1814000000000,"day":n:40a7580000000000,"year":n:407f200000000000,"type":s:"observed","txt":s:"👁️ <b>Freja II</b> noticed that grass fibers hold when twisted. An idea begins to form.","obs":s:"fibersTwist","agent":n:4087c80000000000,"x":n:4050b88a3b2439c5,"y":n:40494428413de070,},{"id":n:40c94a8000000000,"tick":n:40f1817000000000,"day":n:40a7580000000000,"year":n:407f200000000000,"type":s:"moved","txt":s:"<b>Disa II</b> moved into an abandoned hut.",},{"id":n:40c94b0000000000,"tick":n:40f181b000000000,"day":n:40a75a0000000000,"year":n:407f200000000000,"type":s:"taught","txt":s:"<b>Selma II</b> taught <b>Sten II</b> the secret of Ask's knife. The knowledge spreads.","tech":s:"sharp",},{"id":n:40c94b8000000000,"tick":n:40f1820000000000,"day":n:40a75a0000000000,"year":n:407f300000000000,"type":s:"journey","txt":s:"🚶 <b>Saga II</b> set out for Alveheim. Ideas travel on foot.","agent":n:4084e80000000000,"x":n:403ef8d3550ee46f,"y":n:4041619b16fe7ad1,},{"id":n:40c94c0000000000,"tick":n:40f1820000000000,"day":n:40a75a0000000000,"year":n:407f300000000000,"type":s:"quirk","txt":s:"🙂 <b>Kare II</b> always takes the long way home, even in rain. It began the year Alve II the Voice of Ronjastead died. It has not stopped since.","agent":n:4084100000000000,"x":n:404cdd65ed4bdaed,"y":n:40419c381f8b7680,},{"id":n:40c94c8000000000,"tick":n:40f1820000000000,"day":n:40a75a0000000000,"year":n:407f300000000000,"type":s:"quirk","txt":s:"🙂 <b>Selma II</b> walks the last few steps home backward. Always. Once begun, never stopped.","agent":n:4085680000000000,"x":n:403cc8d0a22ae69a,"y":n:40397e474091fcaa,},{"id":n:40c94d0000000000,"tick":n:40f1820000000000,"day":n:40a75a0000000000,"year":n:407f300000000000,"type":s:"leader","txt":s:"🕯️ <b>Runestead</b> is without a leader — <b>Idun II</b>'s voice is gone, and no one yet speaks for all.","village":s:"Runestead","x":n:403e5a7031830b7a,"y":n:4043b7da751bb8dd,"causes":[s:"ev:12612",],},{"id":n:40c94d8000000000,"tick":n:40f1820000000000,"day":n:40a75a0000000000,"year":n:407f300000000000,"type":s:"leader","txt":s:"👑 In <b>Alveheim</b>, the people have begun to listen when <b>Eira II</b> speaks — prestige has hardened into leadership. No one voted; it is simply so.","village":s:"Alveheim","agent":n:4084a80000000000,"x":n:403accb07cb47926,"y":n:403b37b6657cab98,"label":s:"A LEADER IS RECOGNIZED","causes":[s:"agent:661",],},{"id":n:40c94e0000000000,"tick":n:40f1820000000000,"day":n:40a75a0000000000,"year":n:407f300000000000,"type":s:"epithet","txt":s:"✨ From that day on, <b>Eira II</b> was known as <b>Eira II the Voice of Alveheim</b>.","agent":n:4084a80000000000,"x":n:40418874452e5de6,"y":n:4040e228fb1da582,},{"id":n:40c94e8000000000,"tick":n:40f1820000000000,"day":n:40a75a0000000000,"year":n:407f300000000000,"type":s:"rediscovered","txt":s:"💡 In <b>Frejaheim</b>, Ask's javelin is known again — a craft the village had lost returns to living hands.","tech":s:"spear","x":n:401694c57b07baee,"y":n:402e6c5a92f0d5d4,"village":s:"Frejaheim",},{"id":n:40c94f0000000000,"tick":n:40f1820000000000,"day":n:40a75a0000000000,"year":n:407f300000000000,"type":s:"rediscovered","txt":s:"💡 In <b>Frejaheim</b>, Ask's urn is known again — a craft the village had lost returns to living hands.","tech":s:"pottery","x":n:401694c57b07baee,"y":n:402e6c5a92f0d5d4,"village":s:"Frejaheim",},{"id":n:40c94f8000000000,"tick":n:40f1820000000000,"day":n:40a75a0000000000,"year":n:407f300000000000,"t