, and standing becomes wealth.","village":s:"Alveheim","agent":n:4088180000000000,"x":n:403accb07cb47926,"y":n:403b37b6657cab98,"causes":[s:"agent:771",s:"ev:14991",],},{"id":n:40cd490000000000,"tick":n:40f3dd0000000000,"day":n:40aa7e0000000000,"year":n:4081b00000000000,"type":s:"knowledgeLost","txt":s:"🕯️ In <b>Frejaheim</b>, Glassblowing is lost — the land cannot feed the craft, or the last who knew it is gone. Until it is brought back or rediscovered.","tech":s:"glassblowing","x":n:401694c57b07baee,"y":n:402e6c5a92f0d5d4,"village":s:"Frejaheim",},{"id":n:40cd498000000000,"tick":n:40f3dd8000000000,"day":n:40aa7e0000000000,"year":n:4081b00000000000,"type":s:"taught","txt":s:"<b>Ask II</b> taught <b>Loke II</b> the secret of Ask's hearth. The knowledge spreads.","tech":s:"kiln",},{"id":n:40cd4a0000000000,"tick":n:40f3de0000000000,"day":n:40aa7e0000000000,"year":n:4081b00000000000,"type":s:"star","txt":s:"🌌 Under the Watchers, the people gather in the dark and turn their faces to the stars.","agent":n:4089b00000000000,"x":n:4043dc925d3ff810,"y":n:40425b44507fdade,},{"id":n:40cd4a8000000000,"tick":n:40f3de0000000000,"day":n:40aa7e0000000000,"year":n:4081b00000000000,"type":s:"child","txt":s:"👶 <b>Eira II</b> and <b>Otto II</b> have had a child, <b>Embla II</b> — generation 24. They inherit traits from both.","agent":n:408d280000000000,"x":n:40320d4dac419f35,"y":n:40414295060b8a32,"causes":[s:"agent:871",s:"agent:894",],},{"id":n:40cd4b0000000000,"tick":n:40f3de2000000000,"day":n:40aa800000000000,"year":n:4081b00000000000,"type":s:"star","txt":s:"✨ <b>Kare II</b> lay awake in the dark and watched the lights that do not fall.","agent":n:408c800000000000,"x":n:4041edd060e538e9,"y":n:4040073df9bdfd5b,},{"id":n:40cd4b8000000000,"tick":n:40f3de4000000000,"day":n:40aa800000000000,"year":n:4081b00000000000,"type":s:"star","txt":s:"✨ <b>Freja II</b> watches the stars again, night after night. Something is taking shape.","agent":n:408c780000000000,},{"id":n:40cd4c0000000000,"ti