l who understood glassblowing — died, and the knowledge went dark.",s:"Then came a quieter grief: in the year 427, Ask II — the last soul who understood scholarship — died, and the knowledge went dark.",s:"Then came a quieter grief: in the year 427, Ask II — the last soul who understood temple — died, and the knowledge went dark.",s:"Then came a quieter grief: in the year 445, Ask II — the last soul who understood storytelling — died, and the knowledge went dark.",s:"Then came a quieter grief: in the year 445, Ask II — the last soul who understood fire — died, and the knowledge went dark.",s:"Then came a quieter grief: in the year 445, Ask II — the last soul who understood pottery — died, and the knowledge went dark.",s:"Then came a quieter grief: in the year 445, Ask II — the last soul who understood rope — died, and the knowledge went dark.",s:"Then came a quieter grief: in the year 445, Ask II — the last soul who understood sharpened stone — died, and the knowledge went dark.",s:"Then came a quieter grief: in the year 445, Ask II — the last soul who understood spear — died, and the knowledge went dark.",s:"Then came a quieter grief: in the year 445, Ask II — the last soul who understood axe — died, and the knowledge went dark.",s:"Then came a quieter grief: in the year 445, Ask II — the last soul who understood hut — died, and the knowledge went dark.",s:"Then came a quieter grief: in the year 445, Ask II — the last soul who understood kiln — died, and the knowledge went dark.",s:"Then came a quieter grief: in the year 445, Ask II — the last soul who understood brick — died, and the knowledge went dark.",s:"Then came a quieter grief: in the year 445, Ask II — the last soul who understood weaving — died, and the knowledge went dark.",s:"Then came a quieter grief: in the year 445, Ask II — the last soul who understood farming — died, and the knowledge went dark.",s:"Then came a quieter grief: in the year 445, Ask II — the last soul who understood well — died, and t