 came a quieter grief: in the year 445, Ask II — the last soul who understood temple — died, and the knowledge went dark.",s:"Yet in the year 444 it returned - storytelling, rediscovered, as if the world refused to forget forever.",s:"Yet in the year 444 it returned - fire, rediscovered, as if the world refused to forget forever.",s:"Yet in the year 444 it returned - pottery, rediscovered, as if the world refused to forget forever.",s:"Yet in the year 444 it returned - rope, rediscovered, as if the world refused to forget forever.",s:"Yet in the year 444 it returned - sharpened stone, rediscovered, as if the world refused to forget forever.",s:"Yet in the year 444 it returned - spear, rediscovered, as if the world refused to forget forever.",s:"Yet in the year 444 it returned - axe, rediscovered, as if the world refused to forget forever.",s:"Yet in the year 444 it returned - hut, rediscovered, as if the world refused to forget forever.",s:"Yet in the year 444 it returned - kiln, rediscovered, as if the world refused to forget forever.",s:"Yet in the year 444 it returned - brick, rediscovered, as if the world refused to forget forever.",s:"Yet in the year 444 it returned - weaving, rediscovered, as if the world refused to forget forever.",s:"Yet in the year 444 it returned - farming, rediscovered, as if the world refused to forget forever.",s:"Yet in the year 444 it returned - well, rediscovered, as if the world refused to forget forever.",s:"Yet in the year 444 it returned - granary, rediscovered, as if the world refused to forget forever.",s:"Yet in the year 444 it returned - the wheel, rediscovered, as if the world refused to forget forever.",s:"Yet in the year 444 it returned - bow, rediscovered, as if the world refused to forget forever.",s:"Yet in the year 444 it returned - fishing, rediscovered, as if the world refused to forget forever.",s:"Yet in the year 444 it returned - music, rediscovered, as if the world refused to forget forever.",s:"Yet in the year 4