aheim.",s:"From that day on, Otto II was known as Otto II the Voice of Runestead.",s:"Saga II is gone. But someone still whistles every morning. No one asks why it began.",s:"Kare II is gone. But someone still hums at first light. No one asks why it began.",s:"Tuva II is gone. But someone still collects round stones. For nothing. No one asks why it began.",s:"Sixten II is gone. But someone still always sits farthest from the fire. No one asks why it began.",s:"Embla II is gone. But someone still always the first to fall asleep. No one asks why it began.",s:"Sten II is gone. But someone still always takes the long way home. No one asks why it began.",s:"Ulv II is gone. But someone still counts the others every evening. No one asks why it began.",s:"Rune II is gone. But someone still counts the others every evening. No one asks why it began.",s:"Halvar II is gone. But someone still always sits farthest from the fire. No one asks why it began.",s:"Liv II is gone. But someone still leaves a flower where no one sees. No one asks why it began.",s:"Liv II is gone. But someone still always the first to fall asleep. No one asks why it began.",s:"Tuva II the Oathbreaker is gone. But someone still visits the same strange stone daily. No one asks why it began.",s:"Halvar II is gone. But someone still always sits farthest from the fire. No one asks why it began.",s:"Alve II is gone. But someone still visits the same strange stone daily. No one asks why it began.",s:"Freja II is gone. But someone still carries a stick. It is never used. No one asks why it began.",s:"Vera II is gone. But someone still carries a stick. It is never used. No one asks why it began.",s:"Tuva II is gone. But someone still collects round stones. For nothing. No one asks why it began.",s:"Ylva II is gone. But someone still always takes the long way home. No one asks why it began.",s:"Ask II is gone. But someone still always sits farthest from the fire. No one asks why it began.",s:"Saga II is gone. But someone still carries a stick. It is never used. No one asks why it began.",s:"Ulv II the Voice of Ronjastead is gone. But someone still always the first to fall asleep. No one asks why it began.",s:"And in those same years, Embla II is always the first to fall asleep, wherever they are. Once begun, never stopped.",s:"Majaheim is without a leader — Ulv II's voice is gone, and no one yet speaks for all.",s:"In Runestead, the people have begun to listen when Falk II speaks — prestige has hardened into leadership. No one voted; it is simply so.",s:"Runestead is without a leader — Falk II's voice is gone, and no one yet speaks for all.",s:"In Ronjastead, the people have begun to listen when Ulv II speaks — prestige has hardened into leadership. No one voted; it is simply so.",s:"In Majaheim, the people have begun to listen when Nanna II speaks — prestige has hardened into leadership. No one voted; it is simply so.",s:"In Runestead, the people have begun to listen when Otto II speaks — prestige has hardened into leadership. No one voted; it is simply so.",s:"And each harvest-turn, those with surplus laid a share at the leader's door. So standing became wealth, and wealth standing.",s:"Hunger turned to theft 12 times in this age — desperate hands in lean seasons, and every one remembered.",s:"Greed walked openly 5 times — the strong taking because the gap was cheaper to close by force.",s:"The year 425 paid an old debt: Kare II the Oathbreaker came for Orm II — an old wrong, not forgotten, paid back in goods and bruises. Blood remembers.",s:"And when the food ran low, those who kept the same ways fed one another. The rituals, whatever the skeptics said, kept people alive.",s:"6 times in this age, someone left one way for another. Minds were changing, and with them, the world.",s:"Through it all 38 children were born under its skies and 50 lives ended - 47 to age, 3 to hunger.",],},{"title":s:"The Hunger Winter","from":n:407c300000000000,"to":n:407e000000000000,"text":[s:"Th