he year 473, Ask II — the last soul who understood storytelling — died, and the knowledge went dark.",s:"Then came a quieter grief: in the year 473, Ask II — the last soul who understood fire — died, and the knowledge went dark.",s:"Then came a quieter grief: in the year 473, Ask II — the last soul who understood pottery — died, and the knowledge went dark.",s:"Then came a quieter grief: in the year 473, Ask II — the last soul who understood rope — died, and the knowledge went dark.",s:"Then came a quieter grief: in the year 473, Ask II — the last soul who understood sharpened stone — died, and the knowledge went dark.",s:"Then came a quieter grief: in the year 473, Ask II — the last soul who understood spear — died, and the knowledge went dark.",s:"Then came a quieter grief: in the year 473, Ask II — the last soul who understood axe — died, and the knowledge went dark.",s:"Then came a quieter grief: in the year 473, Ask II — the last soul who understood writing — died, and the knowledge went dark.",s:"Then came a quieter grief: in the year 473, Ask II — the last soul who understood kiln — died, and the knowledge went dark.",s:"Then came a quieter grief: in the year 473, Ask II — the last soul who understood brick — died, and the knowledge went dark.",s:"Then came a quieter grief: in the year 473, Ask II — the last soul who understood weaving — died, and the knowledge went dark.",s:"Then came a quieter grief: in the year 473, Ask II — the last soul who understood farming — died, and the knowledge went dark.",s:"Then came a quieter grief: in the year 473, Ask II — the last soul who understood well — died, and the knowledge went dark.",s:"Then came a quieter grief: in the year 473, Ask II — the last soul who understood the wheel — died, and the knowledge went dark.",s:"Then came a quieter grief: in the year 473, Ask II — the last soul who understood bow — died, and the knowledge went dark.",s:"Then came a quieter grief: in the year 473, Ask II — the last soul who understood fishing — died, and the knowledge went dark.",s:"Then came a quieter grief: in the year 473, Ask II — the last soul who understood music — died, and the knowledge went dark.",s:"Then came a quieter grief: in the year 473, Ask II — the last soul who understood sailing — died, and the knowledge went dark.",s:"Then came a quieter grief: in the year 473, Ask II — the last soul who understood medicine — died, and the knowledge went dark.",s:"Then came a quieter grief: in the year 473, Ask II — the last soul who understood calendar — died, and the knowledge went dark.",s:"Then came a quieter grief: in the year 473, Ask II — the last soul who understood counting — died, and the knowledge went dark.",s:"Then came a quieter grief: in the year 473, Ask II — the last soul who understood glass — died, and the knowledge went dark.",s:"Then came a quieter grief: in the year 473, Ask II — the last soul who understood philosophy — died, and the knowledge went dark.",s:"Then came a quieter grief: in the year 473, Ask II — the last soul who understood masonry — died, and the knowledge went dark.",s:"Then came a quieter grief: in the year 473, Ask II — the last soul who understood school — died, and the knowledge went dark.",s:"Then came a quieter grief: in the year 473, Ask II — the last soul who understood composition — died, and the knowledge went dark.",s:"Then came a quieter grief: in the year 473, Ask II — the last soul who understood road — died, and the knowledge went dark.",s:"Then came a quieter grief: in the year 473, Ask II — the last soul who understood scholarship — died, and the knowledge went dark.",s:"Then came a quieter grief: in the year 473, Ask II — the last soul who understood temple — died, and the knowledge went dark.",s:"Yet in the year 456 it returned - writing, rediscovered, as if the world refused to forget forever.",s:"Yet in the year 456 it returned - rope, rediscovered, as if the world refused to forget forever.",s:"Yet in the year 456 it returned - sharpened stone, rediscovered, as if the world refused to forget forever.",s:"Yet in the year 456 it returned - spear, rediscovered, as if the world refused to forget forever.",s:"Yet in the year 456 it returned - farming, rediscovered, as if the world refused to forget forever.",s:"Yet in the year 456 it returned - fishing, rediscovered, as if the world refused to forget forever.",s:"Yet in the year 456 it returned - music, rediscovered, as if the world refused to forget forever.",s:"Yet in the year 456 it returned - calendar, rediscovered, as if the world refused to forget forever.",s:"Yet in the year 456 it returned - counting, rediscovered, as if the world refused to forget forever.",s:"Yet in the year 456 it returned - glass, rediscovered, as if the world refused to forget forever.",s:"Yet in the year 456 it returned - philosophy, rediscovered, as if the world refused to forget forever.",s:"Yet in the year 456 it returned - masonry, rediscovered, as if the world refused to forget forever.",s:"Yet in the year 456 it returned - school, rediscovered, as if the world refused to forget forever.",s:"Yet in the year 456 it returned - scholarship, rediscovered, as if the world refused to forget forever.",s:"Yet in the year 456 it returned - temple, rediscovered, as if the world refused to forget forever.",s:"Yet in the year 472 it returned - sailing, rediscovered, as if the world refused to forget forever.",s:"Yet in the year 472 it returned - road, rediscovered, as if the world refused to forget forever.",s:"Yet in the year 472 it returned - storytelling, rediscovered, as if the world refused to forget forever.",s:"Yet in the year 472 it returned - fire, rediscovered, as if the world refused to forget forever.",s:"Yet in the year 472 it returned - pottery, rediscovered, as if the world refused to forget forever.",s:"Yet in the year 472 it returned - axe, rediscovered, as if the world refused to forget forever.",s:"Yet in the year 472 it returned - kiln, rediscovered, as if the world refused to forget forever.",s:"Yet in the year 472 it returned - brick, rediscovered, as if the world refused to forget forever.",s:"Yet in the year 472 it returned - weaving, rediscovered, as if the world refused to forget forever.",s:"Yet in the year 472 it returned - well, rediscovered, as if the world refused to forget forever.",s:"Yet in the year 472 it returned - the wheel, rediscovered, as if the world refused to forget forever.",s:"Yet in the year 472 it returned - bow, rediscovered, as if the world refused to forget forever.",s:"Yet in the year 472 it returned - medicine, rediscovered, as if the world refused to forget forever.",s:"Yet in the year 472 it returned - composition, rediscovered, as if the world refused to forget forever.",s:"Yet in the year 472 it returned - rope, rediscovered, as if the world refused to forget forever.",s:"Yet in the year 472 it returned - sharpened stone, rediscovered, as if the world refused to forget forever.",s:"Yet in the year 472 it returned - spear, rediscovered, as if the world refused to forget forever.",s:"Yet in the year 472 it returned - writing, rediscovered, as if the world refused to forget forever.",s:"Yet in the year 472 it returned - farming, rediscovered, as if the world refused to forget forever.",s:"Yet in the year 472 it returned - fishing, rediscovered, as if the world refused to forget forever.",s:"Yet in the year 472 it returned - music, rediscovered, as if the world refused to forget forever.",s:"Yet in the year 472 it returned - calendar, rediscovered, as if the world refused to forget forever.",s:"Yet in the year 472 it returned - counting, rediscovered, as if the world refused to forget forever.",s:"Yet in the year 472 it returned - glass, rediscovered, as if the world refused to forget forever.",s:"Yet in the year 472 it returned - philosophy, rediscovered, as if the world refused to forget forever.",s:"Yet in the year 472 it returned - masonry, rediscovered, as if the world refused to forget forever.",s:"Yet in the year 472 it returned - school, rediscovered, as if the world refused to forget forever.",s:"Yet in the year 472 it returned - scholarship, rediscovered, as if the world refused to forget forever.",s:"Yet in the year 472 it returned - temple, rediscovered, as if the world refused to forget forever.",s:"The winter of year 455 was a hard one. Food ran thin, the cold pressed close, and the fires were fed like gods.",s:"The winter of year 468 was a hard one. Food ran thin, the cold pressed close, and the fires were fed like gods.",s:"The spear fed the people: hunters brought down deer when the bushes stood bare, and the winters lost some of their terror.",s:"From that day on, Orm II was known as Orm II the Voice of Alveheim.",s:"From that day on, Sten II was known as Sten II the Voice of Majaheim.",s:"From that day on, Selma II was known as Selma II the Voice of Runestead.",s:"Signe II is gone. But someone still always the first to fall asleep. No one asks why it began.",s:"Rune II is gone. But someone still always the first to fall asleep. No one asks why it began.",s:"Saga II is gone. But someone still hums at first light. No one asks why it began.",s:"Kare II is gone. But someone still visits the same strange stone daily. No one asks why it began.",s:"Ylva II is gone. But someone still carries a stick. It is never used. No one asks why it began.",s:"Maja II is gone. But someone still whistles every morning. No one asks why it began.",s:"Sten II the Voice of Majaheim is gone. But someone still collects round stones. For nothing. No one asks why it began.",s:"Maja II is gone. But someone still leaves a flower where no one sees. No one asks why it began.",s:"Orm II the Voice of Alveheim is gone. But someone still always the first to fall asleep. No one asks why it began.",s:"Vidar II is gone. But someone still always sits farthest from the fire. No one asks why it began.",s:"Liv II is gone. But someone still always the first to fall asleep. No one asks why it began.",s:"Ask II is gone. But someone still always takes the long way home. No one asks why it began.",s:"Nanna II the Oathbreaker is gone. But someone still visits the same strange stone daily. No one asks why it began.",s:"Sixten II is gone. But someone still visits the same strange stone daily. No one asks why it began.",s:"Liv II reached Ronjastead. Strangers shared a fire that night. So it has always gone: ideas travel on foot.",s:"And in those same years, Selma II counts the others every evening before sleep. It began the year Saga II died. It has not stopped since.",s:"Ronjastead is without a leader — Ulv II's voice is gone, and no one yet speaks for all.",s:"In Alveheim, the people have begun to listen when Orm II speaks — prestige has hardened into leadership. No one voted; it is simply so.",s:"Majaheim is without a leader — Nanna II's voice is gone, and no one yet speaks for all.",s:"In Majaheim, the people have begun to listen when Sten II speaks — prestige has hardened into leadership. No one voted; it is simply so.",s:"Runestead is without a leader — Otto II's voice is gone, and no one yet speaks for all.",s:"In Runestead, the people have begun to listen when Selma II speaks — prestige has hardened into leadership. No one voted; it is simply so.",s:"Runestead is without a leader — Selma II's voice is gone, and no one yet speaks for all.",s:"Majaheim is without a leader — Sten II's voice is gone, and no one yet speaks for all.",s:"Alveheim is without a leader — Orm II's voice is gone, and no one yet speaks for all.",s:"And each harvest-turn, those with surplus laid a share at the leader's door. So standing became wealth, and wealth standing.",s:"Hunger turned to theft 16 times in this age — desperate hands in lean seasons, and every one remembered.",s:"Greed walked openly 4 times — the strong taking because the gap was cheaper to close by force.",s:"And when the food ran low, those who kept the same ways fed one another. The rituals, whatever the skeptics said, kept people alive.",s:"5 times in this age, someone left one way for another. Minds were changing, and with them, the world.",s:"Through it all 67 children were born under its skies and 44 lives ended - 36 to age, 8 to hunger.",],},{"title":s:"The Hunger Winter","from":n:407e100000000000,"to":n:407fe00000000000,"text":[s:"Then came a quieter grief: in the year 485, Ask II — the last soul who understood spear — died, and the knowledge went dark.",s:"Then came a quieter grief: in the year 485, Ask II — the last soul who understood brick — died, and the knowledge went dark.",s:"Then came a quieter grief: in the year 485, Ask II — the last soul who understood granary — died, and the knowledge went dark.",s:"Then came a quieter grief: in the year 485, Ask II — the last soul who understood bow — died, and the knowledge went dark.",s:"Then came a quieter grief: in the year 485, Ask II — the last soul who understood sailing — died, and the knowledge went dark.",s:"Then came a quieter grief: in the year 485, Ask II — the last soul who understood glass — died, and the knowledge went dark.",s:"Then came a quieter grief: in the year 485, Ask II — the last soul who understood masonry — died, and the knowledge went dark.",s:"Then came a quieter grief: in the year 485, Ask II — the last soul who understood temple — died, and the knowledge went dark.",s:"Then came a quieter grief: in the year 487, Ask II — the last soul who understood storytelling — died, and the knowledge went dark.",s:"Then came a quieter grief: in the year 487, Ask II — the last soul who understood fire — died, and the knowledge went dark.",s:"Then came a quieter grief: in the year 487, Ask II — the last soul who understood pottery — died, and the knowledge went dark.",s:"Then came a quieter grief: in the year 487, Ask II — the last soul who understood rope — died, and the knowledge went dark.",s:"Then came a quieter grief: in the year 487, Ask II — the last soul who understo