o understood the wheel — died, and the knowledge went dark.",s:"Then came a quieter grief: in the year 507, Ask II — the last soul who understood bow — died, and the knowledge went dark.",s:"Then came a quieter grief: in the year 507, Ask II — the last soul who understood fishing — died, and the knowledge went dark.",s:"Then came a quieter grief: in the year 507, Ask II — the last soul who understood music — died, and the knowledge went dark.",s:"Then came a quieter grief: in the year 507, Ask II — the last soul who understood sailing — died, and the knowledge went dark.",s:"Then came a quieter grief: in the year 507, Ask II — the last soul who understood medicine — died, and the knowledge went dark.",s:"Then came a quieter grief: in the year 507, Ask II — the last soul who understood counting — died, and the knowledge went dark.",s:"Then came a quieter grief: in the year 507, Ask II — the last soul who understood philosophy — died, and the knowledge went dark.",s:"Then came a quieter grief: in the year 507, Ask II — the last soul who understood law — died, and the knowledge went dark.",s:"Then came a quieter grief: in the year 507, Ask II — the last soul who understood composition — died, and the knowledge went dark.",s:"Then came a quieter grief: in the year 507, Ask II — the last soul who understood glassblowing — died, and the knowledge went dark.",s:"Then came a quieter grief: in the year 507, Ask II — the last soul who understood scholarship — died, and the knowledge went dark.",s:"Yet in the year 481 it returned - hut, rediscovered, as if the world refused to forget forever.",s:"Yet in the year 481 it returned - law, rediscovered, as if the world refused to forget forever.",s:"Yet in the year 481 it returned - storytelling, rediscovered, as if the world refused to forget forever.",s:"Yet in the year 481 it returned - fire, rediscovered, as if the world refused to forget forever.",s:"Yet in the year 481 it returned - pottery, rediscovered, as if the world refu