r 650, Ask II — the last soul who understood university — died, and the knowledge went dark.",s:"Then came a quieter grief: in the year 654, Selma II — the last soul who understood mill — died, and the knowledge went dark.",s:"Then came a quieter grief: in the year 655, Ask II — the last soul who understood storytelling — died, and the knowledge went dark.",s:"Then came a quieter grief: in the year 655, Ask II — the last soul who understood sharpened stone — died, and the knowledge went dark.",s:"Then came a quieter grief: in the year 655, Ask II — the last soul who understood rope — died, and the knowledge went dark.",s:"Then came a quieter grief: in the year 655, Ask II — the last soul who understood hut — died, and the knowledge went dark.",s:"Then came a quieter grief: in the year 655, Ask II — the last soul who understood bow — died, and the knowledge went dark.",s:"Then came a quieter grief: in the year 655, Ask II — the last soul who understood kiln — died, and the knowledge went dark.",s:"Then came a quieter grief: in the year 655, Ask II — the last soul who understood granary — died, and the knowledge went dark.",s:"Then came a quieter grief: in the year 655, Ask II — the last soul who understood brick — died, and the knowledge went dark.",s:"Then came a quieter grief: in the year 655, Ask II — the last soul who understood weaving — died, and the knowledge went dark.",s:"Then came a quieter grief: in the year 655, Ask II — the last soul who understood the wheel — died, and the knowledge went dark.",s:"Then came a quieter grief: in the year 655, Ask II — the last soul who understood music — died, and the knowledge went dark.",s:"Then came a quieter grief: in the year 655, Ask II — the last soul who understood counting — died, and the knowledge went dark.",s:"Then came a quieter grief: in the year 655, Ask II — the last soul who understood calendar — died, and the knowledge went dark.",s:"Then came a quieter grief: in the year 655, Ask II — the last soul who understood pottery — died, and the knowledge went dark.",s:"Then came a quieter grief: in the year 655, Ask II — the last soul who understood fire — died, and the knowledge went dark.",s:"Then came a quieter grief: in the year 655, Ask II — the last soul who understood medicine — died, and the knowledge went dark.",s:"Then came a quieter grief: in the year 655, Ask II — the last soul who understood sailing — died, and the knowledge went dark.",s:"Then came a quieter grief: in the year 655, Ask II — the last soul who understood axe — died, and the knowledge went dark.",s:"Then came a quieter grief: in the year 655, Ask II — the last soul who understood fishing — died, and the knowledge went dark.",s:"Then came a quieter grief: in the year 655, Ask II — the last soul who understood writing — died, and the knowledge went dark.",s:"Then came a quieter grief: in the year 655, Ask II — the last soul who understood well — died, and the knowledge went dark.",s:"Then came a quieter grief: in the year 655, Ask II — the last soul who understood spear — died, and the knowledge went dark.",s:"Then came a quieter grief: in the year 655, Ask II — the last soul who understood glass — died, and the knowledge went dark.",s:"Then came a quieter grief: in the year 655, Ask II — the last soul who understood farming — died, and the knowledge went dark.",s:"Then came a quieter grief: in the year 655, Ask II — the last soul who understood philosophy — died, and the knowledge went dark.",s:"Then came a quieter grief: in the year 655, Ask II — the last soul who understood masonry — died, and the knowledge went dark.",s:"Then came a quieter grief: in the year 655, Ask II — the last soul who understood law — died, and the knowledge went dark.",s:"Then came a quieter grief: in the year 655, Ask II — the last soul who understood school — died, and the knowledge went dark.",s:"Then came a quieter grief: in the year 655, Ask II — the last soul who understood composition — died, and the knowledge went dark.",s:"Then came a quieter grief: in the year 655, Ask II — the last soul who understood glassblowing — died, and the knowledge went dark.",s:"Then came a quieter grief: in the year 655, Ask II — the last soul who understood road — died, and the knowledge went dark.",s:"Then came a quieter grief: in the year 655, Ask II — the last soul who understood scholarship — died, and the knowledge went dark.",s:"Then came a quieter grief: in the year 655, Ask II — the last soul who understood temple — died, and the knowledge went dark.",s:"Then came a quieter grief: in the year 655, Ask II — the last soul who understood optics — died, and the knowledge went dark.",s:"Then came a quieter grief: in the year 655, Ask II — the last soul who understood university — died, and the knowledge went dark.",s:"Then came a quieter grief: in the year 655, Ask II — the last soul who understood science — died, and the knowledge went dark.",s:"Yet in the year 634 it returned - glassblowing, rediscovered, as if the world refused to forget forever.",s:"Yet in the year 636 it returned - farming, rediscovered, as if the world refused to forget forever.",s:"Yet in the year 636 it returned - science, rediscovered, as if the world refused to forget forever.",s:"Yet in the year 639 it returned - optics, rediscovered, as if the world refused to forget forever.",s:"The winter of year 634 was a hard one. Food ran thin, the cold pressed close, and the fires were fed like gods.",s:"The winter of year 647 was a hard one. Food ran thin, the cold pressed close, and the fires were fed like gods.",s:"The spear fed the people: hunters brought down deer when the bushes stood bare, and the winters lost some of their terror.",s:"Torv II is gone. But someone still collects round stones. For nothing. No one asks why it began.",s:"Orm II is gone. But someone still leaves a flower where no one sees. No one asks why it began.",s:"Orm II is gone. But someone still always sits farthest from the fire. No one asks why it began.",s:"In Runestead, no one remembers why one goes on carrying a stick one never uses. Not even they do. One simply does.",s:"Tuva II is gone. But someone still always the first to fall asleep. No one asks why it began.",s:"In Runestead, no one remembers why one goes on humming together as the sun rises. Not even they do. One simply does.",s:"Otto II is gone. But someone still always takes the long way home. No one asks why it began.",s:"Vidar II the Voice of Majaheim is gone. But someone still always the first to fall asleep. No one asks why it began.",s:"Nanna II is gone. But someone still visits the same strange stone daily. No one asks why it began.",s:"Kare II is gone. But someone still collects round stones. For nothing. No one asks why it began.",s:"Ask II is gone. But someone still collects round stones. For nothing. No one asks why it began.",s:"It is also remembered that Nanna II stops at the same strange stone every day, and looks at it. It began the year Vidar II the Voice of Majaheim died. It has not stopped since.",s:"Majaheim is without a leader — Vidar II's voice is gone, and no one yet speaks for all.",s:"And each harvest-turn, those with surplus laid a share at the leader's door. So standing became wealth, and wealth standing.",s:"The year 632 knew open greed: Embla II set upon Signe II and seized goods — the gap was cheaper to close by force.",s:"And when the food ran low, those who kept the same ways fed one another. The rituals, whatever the skeptics said, kept people alive.",s:"One soul, that age, quietly left an old way for a new one.",s:"Through it all no children were born and 22 lives ended - 22 to age.",],},{"title":s:"The Last Chapter","from":n:4084a80000000000,"to":n:4084a80000000000,"text":[s:"In these years no children were born and 1 lives ended - 1 to age.",s:"Here the last human died, and the world fell silent. What follows is only memory.",],},],},"endState":{"tick":n:40f7398000000000,"hour":n:4036000000000000,"day":n:40a